<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="ACT" style="id">IBWANA i silmajiri- HUNGWARHEA</book>
  <para style="h">Ibwan sil</para>
  <para style="toc1">Ibwan sil</para>
  <para style="toc2">Ibwan sil</para>
  <para style="toc3">Ibwan sil</para>
  <para style="mt1">Ibwan i silmajiri</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="ACT 1" />
  <para style="s1">A zangi Yesu koro zaro</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 1:1" />Na utakada numui u jigu, Tiyopilus, ni rubuci ka̱mu ina i Yesu aba rwagi ia̱ga hinda ni ina aba cibage <verse eid="ACT 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 1:2" />kwa huna aba zangi Yesu korwo u zaro, kapi aba zangi Yesu korwo u zaro nga̱ Hwinsu uba zwamage pa wa u silmajiri sina si buba tanga. <verse eid="ACT 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 1:3" />Na u'o u Yesu na songorwo, bu cibe icwa i buba hinda na ina cibe ga cikarigo ci Yesu pa aco an bui kwajuwo. Bware bu ma cibe pa aco hal muhon kope nasi hinda cikarigo ci cigwama ci Hwinsu. <verse eid="ACT 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 1:4" />Azi huna, Yesu buba na re mare na silmajiri, bu butaga ga an: &lt;&lt;A ta curya urshalima, hinda i curi kwa buca a bumui pa daje nga̱ buba i alkawali, una gya hinda na sano na kargyana. <verse eid="ACT 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 1:5" />Yohana ai ia̱gi baptisma na miya, na muhu cimu ai ia̱gya bapttisma Ahuru a burya̠ .&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 1:6" />Nga̱ aba matanago, kwa aba na kaban Yesu, &lt;&lt;Bugwama bu doone, na lokaci uniya bui ringagya Israila cigwama ciba?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 1:7" />Kwa Yesu na hin nab: &lt;&lt;Idaku i lokaci ko sigita i sa nuhin Buca̱ a bumui bubabuba bube buzi uni koce. <verse eid="ACT 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 1:8" />Ama ai pan koce lokaci una Ahuru a burya̠ aba a kore ahwahin; hinda i san sheda numui na urshalima, na usala u Yahudiya na samariya, hal kuro u iyaka i doone.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 1:9" />Nga̱ Yesu iba hogi izwamago, kwa aba na zangaca Yesu kuro u zaro na haisa hab, hinda kwa halala kwa kutagana Yesu pa mugingo mu aba. <verse eid="ACT 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 1:10" />A dandiye haisa hab na zaro aba na mugingo buba na alah, ai sanuwo kwa aco barya na siltaga na hazUnga ha cene kwa ne yisan ciyabu pa ba. <verse eid="ACT 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 1:11" />&lt;&lt;Aco Galili,&gt;&gt; Kwa aba na hin, &lt;&lt;Baisa ga̱hi yisa i yiwa na mugigiwo mu zaro? Yesu ina, aba zangi kuro u zaro, i maringe nga̱ ga̱hi i hyan buba ni ala zaro.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">A tanga Matayas ma swate Yahuda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 1:12" />Kwa aba na maringe Urshalima alaga yina wa a'ogo a i'on i zaitun, cihano ci hun uika hun wa Asabar korwo wai i'ogo i labe. <verse eid="ACT 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 1:13" />Nga ab ese ne i'ogo kwa yindana zata pa ukaba una ab yanse: Wata Bitrus,Yohana,Yakubu, na Andarawus, na Filibus, na Toma,na Bartalomi, na Matiyu, na Yakub, bwa bu Halfa,na Saminu ana ab ogo buna buza isibu i i'ogo i yaba, na Yahuda bwa bu Yakub. <verse eid="ACT 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 1:14" />Kwa aba ni gama siwa ka̱mu sab na ahunda̱, na si'a na Imaryamu amaci a Yesu, na hunwo Yesu. <verse eid="ACT 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 1:15" />Na huni Bitrus i yisan pa alagano Yesu [a wuci aco dari uika na kope harya] <verse eid="ACT 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 1:16" />kwa na hin, &lt;&lt;Alagano a Yesu, dole asiji cikarigo ci Hwinsu cina cab sano na zwamaga pa uno u Dauda cina cab i zwama Yahuda, ina i cibe aco an a konbe Yesu- <verse eid="ACT 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 1:17" />Yahuda i yanse na ga̱ci hinda bu tane pa ibwana i cikarigo ci Hwinsu.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 1:18" />[Na daje una u bware buba ce zwama mugota muna mu bware buba hin, Yahuda i sa fili; bu hyene apayi, mukabo mu bware mumapusi, sibu si sire na ijepu. <verse eid="ACT 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 1:19" />Aco ka̱mu na ana a yiwa na Urshalimaa hoge, kwa aba ne zana ihugo ini ize na anre aba Akaldama, wato, ihuga i mahya.] <verse eid="ACT 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 1:20" />Bitrus an hyan, &lt;&lt;Arubuci na utakad u Zabura, &lt;&lt; &lt;Ansan ihug i dala i bware san nga̱ kupayi; ata hyana buna bui ma dala na shuwa,&gt; hinda, &lt;&lt; &lt;An hin buna bui madala na ihugo i buba i cilabe.&gt; <verse eid="ACT 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 1:21" />Zwama haruni u gyamace ci tanga buco buika buna bu yiwa nigaci tun huna isho na siro u Yesu bugwama bu Duniya bu na gaci, <verse eid="ACT 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 1:22" />irwago hun Yohana baptisma kurwo u hun aba zangi Yesu pa gaci korwo u zaro. Zwama ai hyan i bikan ina i san shaida u asingewa i bware korow u zaro.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 1:23" />Kwa aba ne kule haze ha aco barya: Isifu ina aba yiwa ne oge Barsaba [hinda a yiwa oge bware Yusuf] hinda na Matiyas. <verse eid="ACT 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 1:24" />Kwa aba ne ea a̱hunda, &lt;&lt;Bugwama bu doone, bu daki soo u tiga. Cicibe pa aco na barya̱ buna bu goo tanga <verse eid="ACT 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 1:25" />bu ce ibwana i Hwinsu ina i goo buci pa, ina i Yahuda an curi kwa ne tangan ihugo ina i buba bwa sere.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 1:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 1:26" />Kwa aba ne mabyana, hinda cibyano ci cebe Matiyas; kwa aba ne tana ize i bware ize i silmajiri ikope na sikan.<verse eid="ACT 1:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="ACT 2" />
  <para style="s">Kurwa wa a̱hunru a Hwinsu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 2:1" />Hona a̱huru a Hwinsu aba a korya, aba kwa ma tanaga ihugo inka. <verse eid="ACT 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 2:2" />Ai sanuwo kwa aba na hoge ijumu ihya nga̱ mupyala mu sirya na zaro hinda kwa na sinji yaba ka̱mu ihuga ina aba ma tanaga. <verse eid="ACT 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 2:3" />An hyan ina nyaga ula u garu zata na icwa i ka̱mu wab. <verse eid="ACT 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 2:4" />Ka̱mu wab a̱huru a Hwinsu a ise na ikanga yaba kwa na hinan cikarigo na sire si mewa iyak ina aba pa ga a zwamage. <verse eid="ACT 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 2:5" />Baniya aza aco ana ayiwa na dala ni Isra'ila Hayahudawa hana ha yiwa na huge i wasa i Hwinsu hana ha sire cinge ka̱mu na duniya. <verse eid="ACT 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 2:6" />Nga̱ aba hoge i jumu, kwa upugo wa u sirya mamake, zwama a hoge aba na karigyaga na sere sab. <verse eid="ACT 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 2:7" />Kwa aba na hoge mamake dinya, kwa kaban: &lt;&lt;Ai sa aco Galili? <verse eid="ACT 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 2:8" />Bai san gaci ci hoge na zwamaga cikarigo sire a sici? <verse eid="ACT 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 2:9" />Gaci abona cisa aco Fartiyawa, na Mediyawana Elamawa; ana madale na Mesofotamiya, na usala u Yahudiya na Kafadokiya na una uyiwa na Fantus na u Asiya, <verse eid="ACT 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 2:10" />na pirijiya na pampiliya na Masar na moog muna mu ringa usala u Libiya ciyabu na Sayirin; na hanyagat ha cinge ci Roma <verse eid="ACT 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 2:11" />[na Hayahudawa na aco na Halarabawa]; Kiritawa na Halarabawa ka̱mu nuci-gaci hoge mamaki u Hwinsu aba na karigyag na iri u cikarigo na sire asici!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 2:12" />Ka̱mu wab a hoge mamaki dinyiya, kwa aba na makaban, &lt;&lt;Baina haruna?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 2:13" />Zwama haruni, acagiya aco, a hina ni samega, &lt;&lt;Aso maro ma laco asigagi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bitrus a kargyane aco na matanaga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 2:14" />Kwa Bitrus na masinga tare na silmajiri kupe na uika̱ kwa ni danda bicwaro kwa ni kargyana aco ni matanaga: &lt;&lt;Aco numui Hayahudawa ni ka̱mu nuhi aco ni madale ni urshalima, ni zwama; sablaji ni burya̠ ini gya ni ka̱ri zwamana. <verse eid="ACT 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 2:15" />Aco na ga̱hi hyan isuwa maro, nga̱ ga̱hi hyan. Baniya kape utanasi nubungwa! <verse eid="ACT 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 2:16" />Aye, ina acuma Hwinsu Yowel aba i cikarigo: <verse eid="ACT 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 2:17" />&lt;&lt; &lt;Lokaci u yiwa na kurwo, Hwinsu u hin, ni cuma ni a̱huru nimui kurwo pa aco. Sawo asihi ni sicware si ia̱g cikarigo cina ci hurgi, Alagasa hya ina i kure i i, a'unga nahi i ia̱g halabo. <verse eid="ACT 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 2:18" />Ka̱mu ni gyama nimui a cware na si'a, ni cumagega ni a̱huru nimui ni muhun mun muyiwa ni kurwa, hinda i zwamaga cikarigo cina ci inayiwa ni kurwo. <verse eid="ACT 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 2:19" />Ni cibaga i mamaki ni zaro hinda ni alama ni cinge, hinda ni mahya ni ula ni hinda ni ciyabu ni muhiwu. <verse eid="ACT 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 2:20" />Hwinsu ui maringiye ci'incu hinda pyana ui marigiye mahya kapin kurwo u Bugwama bu doone. <verse eid="ACT 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 2:21" />Hinda ka̱mu buna bu uga ize buco bu yaba Yesu ai ca bo.&gt; <verse eid="ACT 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 2:22" />&lt;&lt;Aco Isra'ila, sablaji i huge: Yesu i Nazaret Hwinsu biya u iri bware ui cibe ana u yaji ni bware, iyi mamaki ini Hwinsu uba i pa bware kurwo ahwahi, nga̱ ga̱hi daki ka̱mu nuhi. <verse eid="ACT 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 2:23" />Buco buna Hwinsu ube ui cuta nga̱ uba gimba hinda nga̱ uba daki; hinda ga̱hi, ni ibanganu i co eewo, a huni Yesu aba jukai bware zata e'o. <verse eid="ACT 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 2:24" />Kwa Hwinsu ni yasinga bware pa aco kwajo, ni handgag bware ni sungorwa u'o, zwama u'o uza kuce uba ui kumgaga bware. <verse eid="ACT 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 2:25" />Dauda u zwamage cikarigo ci bware: &lt;&lt; &lt;Ni hyan Bugwama bu doone tuhumba ahwamui. zwama bu yiwa ni wa u cuga numui, niza ihuge iwasa. <verse eid="ACT 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 2:26" />Ube u san gya ni huge laco ni soo numui hinda si hugi laco zangaci ize yuba; hinda ikanga numui imadala ni itano i soo, <verse eid="ACT 2:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 2:27" />Zwama Buca̠ bu yaba Yesu buza na curya na suwa doone aco na kwajo, ko hinda bui curya buna bu za magwata bu pwase. <verse eid="ACT 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 2:28" />Buna cibuwa a yina ana ai ni kula zaro; bui ni sinda suwa numui ni wa̱wo apabwe.&gt; <verse eid="ACT 2:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 2:29" />&lt;&lt;Ahun nimui, ni zwaman cikarigo sa tare na iwasa ina ia̱gi na kaka akaci Dauda ihuga ina aba wumba bware, hinda izi i bware i yiwa harkabaniya. <verse eid="ACT 2:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 2:30" />Bware busa bucuma bu Hwinsu hinda bu daki Hwinsu ana Hwinsu u macuni ana ui tana azwaga a bware pa cigwama. <verse eid="ACT 2:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 2:31" />Ihyanu ina yiwa ni kurwa, bware bu i cikarigo ci yasingo i Kristi, ana i curuwo bware ni suwa doone aco na kwajo, ko hinda ikanga ibware i pwase na izi. <verse eid="ACT 2:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 2:32" />Hwinsu u yasinge Yesu zwam i masinge ni duniya hinda ka̱mu nuci ci hya ni hisa ahaci. <verse eid="ACT 2:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 2:33" />Hwinsu u ansenge Yesu kwa ni dala bware ni wa u cuga u Hwinsu, bware bu co pa buco bu bware a̱huru a Hwinsu hinda bware bui hala ina ga̱hi hyan hinda i hoge baniya. <verse eid="ACT 2:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 2:34" />Dauda ui masiguwa kurwo zaro, ama bware bu hin</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 2:34">&lt;&lt; &lt;Hwinsu u hyan na Buco bu yaba numui:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:34">&lt;&lt;Madale ni wa u cuga .<verse eid="ACT 2:34" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 2:35" />hal gya san buna bu wonje bu san ina goo bui</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 2:35">kwa na bu pana koce pa aco na bu wonje.&gt;&gt; &gt;<verse eid="ACT 2:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 2:36" />&lt;&lt;Zwama haruni Izra'ila ka̱mu i daki kamahinda: Hwinsu u san Yesu ina, ini i ga̱hi jukai, i san Buca̱ bu yaba yesu hinda Kristi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 2:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 2:37" />Nga̱ aco aba hoge haruni, i damega ni hasoo haba kwa aba ni hyen ni Bitrus ni silmajiri sina si yiwa tare ni bware, &lt;&lt;Ahun numui, ci ia̱g niya?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 2:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 2:38" />Bitrus a canega curyaji eewo nihi hinda ai ia̱gi baptisma, ka̱mu nuhi, ni ize i Yesu Kristi zwama ai curgagi eewo amahi. Hinda ai pan daje u a̱huru a Hwinsu. <verse eid="ACT 2:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 2:39" />Alkawari ana asa ahahi ni saawo nuhi hinda aco niyibta na aco nimire-zwama aco na Bugwama bu duniya Hwinsu nuciya uba ui ugan.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 2:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 2:40" />Ni cikarigo dinyiya Bitrus a numiga hacube; hinda kwa bware ni uniga, ma'unji pa azwaga ana aco eewo.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 2:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 2:41" />Aco ana ciye cikarigo ci Bitrus a ia̱giga baptisma hinda a hin aco dubu taco ana laga Yesu huni.<verse eid="ACT 2:41" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nga̱ utanaganu u Krista uba nyaga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 2:42" />Kwa silmajiri si Yesu na pa sicwa saba pa icibagu ya aco hinda na utanaganu, ni re mare tare ni ia̱gu ya ahunda. <verse eid="ACT 2:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 2:43" />Tigamba bu hugi mamaki, hinda iyi mamaki dinyiya silmajiri siba iyi. <verse eid="ACT 2:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 2:44" />Ka̱mu aco na a yaji ni Yesu amatanagan ihuga inka a iyi tibai ka̱mu waba tare. <verse eid="ACT 2:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="ACT 2:45" />A sange ka̱mu i yaba ni icwana yaba, kwa ni mahapsaga tigamba inabuba za. <verse eid="ACT 2:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="ACT 2:46" />Tun hun aco na yaje sa kure ni yaba ahunda i Hayahudawa i labe amatangan. Aba ni re mare tare ni muyaba maba aba nire mare ni suwa uika, <verse eid="ACT 2:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="ACT 2:47" />aba ni pan Hwinsu cilabe ni hugi laco zwama yama Hwinsu pa aco ka̠mu. Hinda Buca̠ bu yaba bo jidaniga muso wa aco ana a yaji ni Yesu.<verse eid="ACT 2:47" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="ACT 3" />
  <para style="s">Bitrus i hwingacume Bugunu ne iba igenga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 3:1" />Aza huna Bitrus na Yohana aba na yina u kurwo pa yaba ahunda i Hayahudawa zwama a̱hunda-na karpe ataco. <verse eid="ACT 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 3:2" />Baniya aza buna bwa mace na cigunu azangi kurwo wai i'iba i yaba ahunda i Hayahudawa i labe ina aba ogo Gyamace, tuhunba sa zangi bwa akole a iri bwa na yaba ahunda i Hayahudawa zwama aco na yiwa na ginbo ese yaba ahunda i Hayahudawa. <verse eid="ACT 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 3:3" />Nga̱ buba hyan Bitrus ginbo ise yaba ahunda i Hayahudawa, kwa buba na kaban ga musarya. <verse eid="ACT 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 3:4" />Kwa Bitrus na Yohana na byana bwa. Kwa Bitrus na hin, &lt;&lt;Cibyanya̱!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 3:5" />Kwa hankali a buba ni maringe pa ba, na tano soo an ai pan bo i hya. <verse eid="ACT 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 3:6" />Kwa Bitrus ni hin, &lt;&lt;Azurpa ni Zinariya ciza, ina gaci za ibe i gaci ci bu pan. Ni ize i Yesu Kristi i Nazaret, masinge i cihano.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 3:7" />Kwa Bitrus konbe bwa na wa ucuga, kwa ni zangaca bwa, ai sanuwo kwa uwongorumi na buna u buba ni marenge na koce. <verse eid="ACT 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 3:8" />Kwa buba ni ma zarika na yinsana na buna buba kwa na hinana cihano. Kwa buba ni lagana ga eso u yaba ahunda i Hayahudawa ilabe, na cihano na mazarkaga, na ciba cilabe ci Hwinsu. <verse eid="ACT 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 3:9" />Nga̱ aco ka̱mu aba hin bwa na jabaga na zangaci Hwinsu, <verse eid="ACT 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 3:10" />a ganige bwa an buna bu madalago ne i'iba yaba ahunda i Hayahudawa ina aba yiwa ne oge Gyamace, hinda mamaki u konbe ga ne hyanu ina i ea na buba.<verse eid="ACT 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bitrus a karigyane aco na yiwa na mugingo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 3:11" />Bugunu buba kwa bu kumgage Bitrus na Yohana, aco ka̱mu hoge mamaki kwa eaman monda korwo pa aba na ihug ina aba yiwa na oge Uzala u Sulemanu. <verse eid="ACT 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 3:12" />Nga̱ Bitrus aba hyan, kwa bware ne hin naba: &lt;&lt;Aco Israila, baisan ga̱hi i hoge mamaki u ina i ea? Bai san ga̱hi i yiwa na mugingo amuci nga̱ gaci ci i ina na koce nuci gaci san boco buna bu jabage na buna u buba? <verse eid="ACT 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 3:13" />Hwinsu u Ibrahim, Ishaku na Yakub, Hwinsu u hacaca a haci, ube u kule izangacu pa bugyama a buba Yesu. I cuta bware pa Bilatus a hone bwa, hinda i cibe bware bi san a buhiyo pa Bilatus, hinda bware yaje an curi Barabas ana a hone aco a ali. <verse eid="ACT 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 3:14" />I cibe buna bu nagu ciri kwa ni hin naba buna bu hunago aco a curi bo pa ga̱hi. <verse eid="ACT 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 3:15" />I hone buna busa ipicu ea a̱huru, ama Hwinsu u ansinge bwa pa aco a kwaju. Gaci hinda cisa shaida u ini ka̱mu. <verse eid="ACT 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 3:16" />Na itano i soo na Yesu, buco buna bu ga̱hi i hya bu jabage. Ne ize i Yesu hinda na itano i soo i buba ea kulage i handgago na mahona ma buba, nga̱ ka̱mu ga̱hi i hyan na sicwa a sihin ga̱hi hyan. <verse eid="ACT 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 3:17" />&lt;&lt;Bane, ahun namui, Na daki ka̱mu i ia̱gi na nagu u cidako, nga̱ aco labe nuhin aba ia̱gi. <verse eid="ACT 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 3:18" />ama harbuni Hwinsu uba siji ina uba zwamage na haya hana ha ali na uno u acoma a Hwinsu, an Kristi iba i so wahala. <verse eid="ACT 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 3:19" />Curaj iwo, hinda i maringya pa Hwinsu, nga̱ aba ai hangaga na magwata̱ a mahi, zwama Hwinsu u kimga hasoo ahahin, <verse eid="ACT 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 3:20" />Hwinsu i pan kuce hinda i cumane na Kristi ina, uba ui tangage tun na jigo-wata Yesu. <verse eid="ACT 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 3:21" />Bware bui yana na zaro hal huna u Hwinsu uba ui ringe tibai, nga̱ uba i alkawali tun na jigu pa acubago a nagu ciri a Hwinsu an za ciri. <verse eid="ACT 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 3:22" />Zwama Musa u zwamage, &lt;Hwinsu na icwa i ba ui asinga Bucuma buna bu nyaga na gya na soo aco nuhin; i yaje na tibai ina buba bui zwama. <verse eid="ACT 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 3:23" />Ka̱mu buna bui yaduwa na buba ai kwaman bwa pa aco.&gt; <verse eid="ACT 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 3:24" />&lt;&lt;Harbuni, acuma Hwinsu ka̱mu a rwage na Samaila kurwa cyage, nga̱ aba zwamage, izwamago na moho muna mu ali. <verse eid="ACT 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 3:25" />ga̱hin hinda isa saawo sa acuma a Hwinsu kucuna ku Hwinsu uba ia̱gi hacaca a hahi. Zwama Hwinsu hin Ibrahim, &lt;Pa saawo asibui na cinge ai tana ga uno u burya̠.&gt; <verse eid="ACT 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 3:26" />Nga̱ Hwinsu uba ansinge bugyama buba, kwa uba ne cuma bwa buba a hwahin na jigo zwama bwe tane uno uburya̠ zwama ka̱mu nuhin i curi eewo nihin.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 3:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="ACT 4" />
  <para style="s">A kole Bitrus na Yohana pa majalisa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 4:1" />Alabe na buco bulabe buna aco nayiwa a̱pe ui yaba ahunda i Hayahudawa i labe na Hasadaukiyawa kwa aba na korya pa Bitrus na Yohana aba na ia̱gya aco cikarigo. <verse eid="ACT 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 4:2" />Hasoo hab ha hacigage zwam a hoge Bitrus na Yohana a yiwa na cibaga aco i a̱singo Yesu pa aco a kwadwo. <verse eid="ACT 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 4:3" />Kwa aba na konbe Bitrus na Yohana, hinda zwam uyinbe u iwo, kwa aba na tana ga ukaba u ci'incwu kapi ubungwa u bungya. <verse eid="ACT 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 4:4" />Ama aco dinya ana hoge cikarigo a yaje, hinda upugo waba u ma jidane kurwo dubu uta.<verse eid="ACT 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 4:5" />Nga̱ ubungwa ub wa bonge, onga na hawalami icibago i Musa a matanaga na Urshalima. <verse eid="ACT 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 4:6" />Hannana, bulabe bu labe ayanse, aba na Kayapa, na Yohana, na Alekzanda na aco na asa yashuba uika na bulabe bu labe. <verse eid="ACT 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 4:7" />Kwa aba na san akulagiya ga Bitrus na Yohana zwam a ia̱gi ga makaba̱: &lt;&lt;Ne koce ganba ko hinda na ize i ganba i ga̱hi i yiwa na ia̱go ina?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 4:8" />Bitrus , i sindu na a̱huru a Hwinsu, an hin nab: &lt;&lt;Mugwamgwam na onga aco! <verse eid="ACT 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 4:9" />Iyiwa na ci kabgana zwama ci zwamage ina i burya̠ iba ia̱gi bugunu buna hinda aci kabo nga̱ aba hwingacume bwa, <verse eid="ACT 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 4:10" />baniya daki, ga̱hi na aco israila: Na ize i Kristi Nazaret, ina i ga̱hi i hone bube Hwinsu uba asinge pa aco a kwadwo, ube ga̱hi i hyan buco buna buyiwa na yisan nuhin bu hwenge. <verse eid="ACT 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 4:11" />Yesu isa</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 4:11">&lt;&lt; &lt;Tare una aco ema aba yagage,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 4:11">ube usa tare una u kimga ema.&gt;<verse eid="ACT 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 4:12" />Hyanu i yaba zaro aza hyan pa buciyahya, zwama aza iziya na cinge ina yaba pan aco ina gaci ci hya yaba izaro.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 4:13" />Nga̱ aba hyan koce u soo u Bitrus na Yohana hinda a daki an ai iwomakaranta, asa talaka, a hoge mamake dinya kwa aba ne gane an aco na a yinsa tare na Yesu. <verse eid="ACT 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 4:14" />Ama nga̱ aba hyan buna bwab hwingacume bu yiwa tare na Bitrus na Yohana, anagi ina aba ai karigyane. <verse eid="ACT 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 4:15" />Kwa aba ne hin na Bitrus na Yohana a sire na ijapu i majalisa zwam a i shawara na sicwa sab. <verse eid="ACT 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 4:16" />&lt;&lt;Aco majalisa amakabo bai gaci ci ia̱go na aco na? &lt;&lt;A kabo. &lt;&lt;Kanmu aco na yiwa a madale na Urshalima a daki a ia̱gi i mamaki, hinda ciza ihyan sa harbuniya. <verse eid="ACT 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 4:17" />Ama zwam ci gazga ina ne ise tuhob na eso hacobe ha aco na cinge a cici, ci numui ga hacobe ata karigyakana na buciyahya na iziya i Yesu.&gt; <verse eid="ACT 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 4:18" />Kwa aba ni gupa i'oga ga na suwa hinda kwa na hin ata eakano cikarigo na buca̱hya ko acibe buca̱yahya na ize i Yesu. <verse eid="ACT 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 4:19" />Ama Bitrus na Yohana kwa na cane ga, &lt;&lt;Eage sicwa a sihin makab si ugyamace ci hoge cikarigo ci Hwinsu ko nabe ci boma. <verse eid="ACT 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 4:20" />Zwam ci za i curya i zwamag ina gaci hyan hinda ci hoge.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 4:21" />Nga̱ aba numui ga hacobe kwa aba na curya ga amalani. Anagi nga̱ aba hole ga, zwam aco aba na wa̱won ina aba hyan. <verse eid="ACT 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 4:22" />Zwama buna bwab hwingacome bu hwace haya kope nasi.<verse eid="ACT 4:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ahunda aco na yaje na Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 4:23" />Nga̱ curi ga, Bitrus na Yohana kwa na aliyi pa aco ba kwa na cubaga ina alabe labe na an onga aba ia̱gi ga. <verse eid="ACT 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 4:24" />Nga̱ aba hoge haruni, kwa aba na danda bicwarwa bya aba na a̱hunda kurwo pa Hwinsu. &lt;&lt;Hwinsu bugwama bu doone,&gt;&gt; kwa ne hin, &lt;&lt;Go bu ia̱gi cinge na wo, na ina yiwa na suwa. <verse eid="ACT 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 4:25" />Bu i cikarigo na gaci pa unu u bugyama abubui, buca̱ abuci Dauda:</para>
  <para style="pi" vid="ACT 4:25">&lt;&lt; &lt;Bai san aco na ai san Hayahudawa aba yiwa apisa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 4:25">hinda aco menwa aba yiwa tunane una u za ihya?<verse eid="ACT 4:25" /></para>
  <para style="pi">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 4:26" />Mugwamgwa mu doone muba ginbago gasa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 4:26">hinda mugwamgwam muba gami sicwa</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 4:26">ginbo ui hune</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 4:26">na buna aba tanga Buca bu yaba na Yesu Almasihu.&gt;<verse eid="ACT 4:26" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 4:27" />Harbuni Bugwama Hiridus na Bugwama Bilatus aba madale kwa na gama muno na aco na ai sa Hayaduwa na cikarigo ci Yesu hinda na aco cinge ci Isra'ila aba gope i gamo muno zwam a husne buna bu za ciri Yesu, buna bu ga̠hi i tanga. <verse eid="ACT 4:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 4:28" />A ea ina koce wab uba pwan hinda ina Hwinsu uba hin an i ia̱ga. <verse eid="ACT 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 4:29" />Baniya, Bugwama bu doone, bu hyan nga̱ aba i kokari aci gazgo na ibwana pa ipano nici iwasa ama go bu pan bugyama abuboi koce buba i cikarigo sa tare na iwasa. <verse eid="ACT 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 4:30" />Danda wa nubui hwingacuma aco mahona na ize buna bu za ciri Yesu.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 4:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 4:31" />Nga̱ aba yi ahunda̱, ihugo ina aba yanse i madwumi. Hinda a siji ga na a̱huru a Hwinsu hinda kwa aba na zwama ga cikarigo ci Hwinsu ko na iwasa<verse eid="ACT 4:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Aco na yaje na Yesu ama habsage icwan yaba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 4:32" />Ka̱mu wa aco na yanse na lagan Yesu soo wab uika hinda tunane wab uikan. Aza buna hin an ina buba za isa i buba, ama habusage ina aba za ka̱mu. <verse eid="ACT 4:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 4:33" />Na koce dinya silmajiri si hina ia̱gya aco cikarigo ci ansigewa i Bugwama bu doone Yesu, hinda i burya̠ Hwinsu aba na sicwa sab dinya. <verse eid="ACT 4:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 4:34" />Aza buna bu nagi ihya ka̱mu wab. Zwama buna bu sange usakata ko yaba, busa bu kuleya musare mu ina aba sange <verse eid="ACT 4:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 4:35" />hinda a kuleya pa silmajiri aba i kasapi a byane aco na za ihya aba habsage ga. <verse eid="ACT 4:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 4:36" />Harbuni buna aba yiwa ne oge Isifu, buco bwa azwaga Lawi, buna bu silmajiri siba ogo Barnaba [ina aba yiwa na nupi bwa bu suwa u koce], <verse eid="ACT 4:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 4:37" />bu sange usakata u buba kwa ne kole musare pa silmajiri zwama a habsage kwa ne iri no usa wab.<verse eid="ACT 4:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="ACT 5" />
  <para style="s">Hananiya na Isafiratu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 5:1" />Baniya buna aba yiwa ne oge Hananiya, na bu'a bu bware Isafiratu, aba ma a sange icwana yab. <verse eid="ACT 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 5:2" />Na cidako ci bu'a bu bware aba ma gane musare, kwa ne kole muna mu gane pa silmajiri. <verse eid="ACT 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 5:3" />Kwa Bitrus na hin, &lt;&lt;Hananiya, naiya go bu yaje satan a sinji soo nubui hal go bu ia̱gi Hwinsu cibya goo bu magane musare muna mu goo bo sange usakata? <verse eid="ACT 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 5:4" />I sa nibui kapi ga̱hi sange? Hinda nga̱ ga̱hin sange, musare mui yanuwa na wa nibui? Bai san goo i ina ga̱hi ina isa i burya̠? Sa aco goo bu galaga ama bu galaga Hwinsu.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 5:5" />Nga̱ Hananiya aba hoge, kwa ni hene ni kwaji. Iwasa i kunbe aco dinyiya nga̱ aba hoge ina ea. <verse eid="ACT 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 5:6" />Kwa alagasa ni sere ni zangca ikanga i Ananiya, kwa na kore na wunbana bware. <verse eid="ACT 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 5:7" />Nga̱ awa ataco aba aliyi bu'a bu bware kwa ne es, ai dakuwo ina ea na boriyo. <verse eid="ACT 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 5:8" />Kwa Bitrus na kaban bwa, &lt;&lt;Na zwamane, ina i ganhi i sange icwana nihin baina go na bware a bubweya?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 5:8">&lt;&lt;Harbuni,&gt;&gt; e cane, &lt;&lt;Ina gaci sange bini.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 5:9" />Kwa Bitrus ne hyen na ba, &lt;&lt;Bai san go bu yaje i gwaji Hwinsu? Byana! Munponje mu aco na zangi io i bware na a̠pe nibui nijapu u i'iba, hinda ai bu zango baniya.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 5:10" />Bitrus ne gundan uno kwa iba ne magida ciyabu na buna i Bitrus kwa ni kwaji. Kwa alagasa ne es, ni bangi eo eba, zangaci bwa kwa na wonbana ciyabu ne izinya i bori. <verse eid="ACT 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 5:11" />Kwa ewasa dinyiya ne konbe aco coci ka̱mu na aco na hoge ka̱mu ina i ia̱gi.<verse eid="ACT 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Silmajiri Si Hwingacome Aco Dinyiya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 5:12" />Silmajiri si a̠gi i mamaki dinya pa aco. Ka̱mu aco na yiwa na lagana Yesu sa ma tanaga na uzala una u sulemanu. <verse eid="ACT 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 5:13" />Ama aco na gane aza buna bu za koce u soo buba bui ese pa ba, ka̱mu na cilabe cina aba yiwa ne pan ga. <verse eid="ACT 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 5:14" />Duk na haruni, aco na hina ne yaje na Yesu a hina tunhunba na ma jidagana aco cware na sia. <verse eid="ACT 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 5:15" />Zwama imamaki, aco hina ne kulage aco mahona aba ne labtaga na siyina zwama a̱huru u Bitrus u dangi aco mahona. <verse eid="ACT 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 5:16" />Aco dinyiya a matanaga ana a sire mu'og muna mu ringa Urshalima, aba ne kulage aco mahona na aco apisa, ka̱mu wab a hwingacume pa mahona maba.<verse eid="ACT 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">An pan silmajiri wahala zwama Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 5:17" />Kwa bulabe bu labe na aco na yiwa na ibwana ihug ikan, ana soo uikan tare na Hasadaukiyawa, kwa isibu na sinji hashuwa haba. <verse eid="ACT 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 5:18" />Zwama haruni kwa silmajiri si Yesu ne konbe kwa na tana ga na soo ukaba u ci'incu una aba tagano tiganba. <verse eid="ACT 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 5:19" />Ama na usan u gita kwa Hwinsu ne cuma acuma a Hwinsu kwa na gonja i'iba ukaba u ci'incu kwa ne silacome ga na ijapu. <verse eid="ACT 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 5:20" />&lt;&lt;Ala, yinsa na usa ui ia̠gi nga̠,&gt;&gt; kwa ne hin, &lt;&lt;Hinda zwamaga aco ka̱mu cicoma ci cikarigo a̱huru a burya̠.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 5:21" />Goo bungo uba wa bonge kwa aba ne ese yaba ahunda̠ i Hayahudawa i labe, nga̱ aba zwama ga, kwa aba ne hinan i cibag aco.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 5:21">Nga̠ bulabe bu labe bu labe buba bu es tare na aco na yiwa ne ibwana na buba, kwa aba ne oga majalisa maba-na onga a israila-kwa aba na cuman a koleya silmajiri na suwa u ukaba u ciicu. <verse eid="ACT 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 5:22" />Ama nga̱ aba kore na soo ukaba u ci'incu, ai hyanuwo bucahya. Kwa aba ne maringya kwa na cubagana ga, <verse eid="ACT 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 5:23" />&lt;&lt;Ci bangi ukaba u ci'incu kwa u kulli, aco na yiwa na a̠pe kwa a yisinga na mu'iba; nga̱ ga̱ci ci gonje mu'iba, ci hyanuwo buciyahya na shuwa.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 5:24" />Nga̠ aba hoge haruni, buco bulabe bu aco a̠pe ui yaba ahunda̠ i Hayahudawa i labe na bulabe bu labe a hoge mamaki dinyiya, kwa aba na mazwaman ina i ia̱gana.<verse eid="ACT 5:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 5:25" />Kwa buciyahya ne korya na hin, &lt;&lt;Byana! aco na ga̱hi i tane na suwa u ukaba u ci'incu abe bana yinsiga na suwa ui ginga na cibaga aco.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 5:26" />Kwa aco a̠pe ui yaba ahunda i Hayahudawa na es na silacome ga. Ai cibewa ga koce, zwama iwasa ai ibwaga ga na hatare. <verse eid="ACT 5:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 5:27" />Nga aba a silacome ga, kwa na kola ga pa majalisa zwama bulabe bu labe bu ia̠gi ga makabo. <verse eid="ACT 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 5:28" />&lt;&lt;Ci numi hacobe an i ta rubakano ize ina ko icibage aco na iziya ina,&gt;&gt; bware bu hin. &lt;&lt;Ama ga̱hin abuna i hogo siji cinge ci Urshalima na cibago ia̱ aco na ize i Yesu i sano aci zangi ga̠ci cisa aco eewo mahya ma buco buna i yiwa na icwa nuci.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 5:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 5:29" />Bitrus na silmajiri si cane: &lt;&lt;Ciza ihoge iwasa buma ci wonje Hwinsu! <verse eid="ACT 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 5:30" />Hwinsu u hacaca ahci ube ansinge Yesu pa aco akwadwo-ina i ga̱hi hone i jukai bware zata u'on. <verse eid="ACT 5:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 5:31" />Hwinsu u zangaci bware kwa na dala bware ne wa u cuga nga̱ bwa bu bugwama hinda na bu cagagowa aco magwata̱ hinda bu cibe Israila yina ai curya ia̱gu i magwata̱. <verse eid="ACT 5:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 5:32" />Ga̠ci ka̱mu cisa hasheda u ini, hinda a̱huru a Hwinsu, an pan aco na alaga cikarigo ci uba.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 5:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 5:33" />Nga̠ majalisa aba hoge, ha soo haba kwa na dabe kwa na ginbage a hone ga. <verse eid="ACT 5:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 5:34" />Ama Buparise hin buna bwaba ogo Gamaliyel, walami ui cibago ci Musa, buna aba yiwa ne hoge iwasa i buba dinyiya, bu masinge na majalisa kwa na hyen ana a silacome ga kacume. <verse eid="ACT 5:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 5:35" />Kwa na ia̱gya ga cikarigo: &lt;&lt;Aco Isra'ila, cimasikei jo ina gaci ci ka̱ri ia̱go na aco na. <verse eid="ACT 5:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 5:36" />Haya hana ha ali aza buna bwa sire iziya i buba Tudas, buna bu zangi icwa i buba busa ihya, hinda bu hin aco na wuci dari unasi na laganobwa. A hone ga, ka̱mu aco na laga bwa a ma pusi, hinda ai hugakano ijumu yaba. <verse eid="ACT 5:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 5:37" />Nga̱ uni uba ali, bucage buco bu gope i sirya ize i buba Yahuda buco bu Galili lokaci una aba yiwa ne rutaga aco bu san aco laga bwa pa i ansingo hankali wa aco. Iba ma an hone bware, hinda ka̱mu aco na laga bware amagatagage. <verse eid="ACT 5:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 5:38" />Zwama haruniyo, ni ginbo i pan shawara: i ma ryabi na aco na! Maryabi naba a ali! Zwama si ibwana yaba isa pa buco, i ma hacigag. <verse eid="ACT 5:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 5:39" />Ama sisa i Hwinsu, iza i pwana i yanse ga; ga̱hin i maringe na ia̱ga cuhuri na Hwinsu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 5:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 5:40" />Cikarigo ci bware ci nume hashohab a yaje na bware.Kwa aba ne oga silmajiri na showa kwa ne swace ga. Kwa ne numi ga hacube an ata eakano cikarigo na iziya i Yesu, kwa ne curya ga a ali.<verse eid="ACT 5:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 5:41" />Kwa silmajiri na curya majalisa maba, na wa̱wo zwama a dwobe apan ga wahala u izaya i Yesu. <verse eid="ACT 5:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 5:42" />Tohoba, a hina ne lagana muyaba, ai curiwo icibago ne iziya i Yesu hinda ne cubago i burya̠ an bube busa Kristi.<verse eid="ACT 5:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="ACT 6" />
  <para style="s">A tanga aco ibwana tandarya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 6:1" />Ni muhon muniya ni musu silmajiri siba si majidaga, Kwa Hayahudawa hana ha hugagi Helinanci kwa ni ciban cidan pa Hayahudawa hana ha hugagi Haremiya. Ha Yahudawa hana ha hugagi Helinanci ha cibe cigam zwama huga ihapsagu i mare <verse eid="ACT 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 6:2" />Kwa aco ikope burya̠ buna aba tangage a tani silmajiri ka̱mu kwa ne hin, &lt;&lt;Uza gyamata ci curi cikarigo ci Hwinsu zwama i habsago i mare. <verse eid="ACT 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 6:3" />Ahun nimui aco cu'a na aco cware tangaja aco utandarya ciki nuhi an a sinji na a̱huru a Hwinsu na mahasa, hinda ci tanaga a i kula na zwamu wa aco. <verse eid="ACT 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 6:4" />hinda ga̠ci pan sicwa a sici pa ahunda na ibwana i Hwinsu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 6:5" />Aco ka̱mu a hoge laco u cikarigo cini. Kwa aba ne tangana Istifanus, buco buna buza iyadwo i showa na a̠huru a Hwinsu; na Pilibus na Burokoras na Nikanor na Timon na Barminas na Nikolas buco bu Antakiya, buna bu ese adini a Yahudawa. <verse eid="ACT 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 6:6" />Kwa aba ne kole ga pa silmajiri zwama a ia̠gi ga anhuda hinda a dwukane ga siwa. <verse eid="ACT 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 6:7" />Cikarigo ci Hwinsu ci hina ne ange tohoba.Monswa u silmajiri na Urshalima i majidane monso na mabuna, hinda alabe dinya a ma jidane itano ishowa pa cikarigo ci Hwinsu.<verse eid="ACT 6:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">An konbe Istifanus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 6:8" />Baniya Istifanus, buna bu sinji na i burya̠ u Hwinsu na koce Hwinsu u yiwa na bware, bu ia̱gi imamaki dinya na alama pa aco. <verse eid="ACT 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 6:9" />Kwa gadama na masinge, pa aco, na aba yiwa na oge aco yaba ahunda i Hayahudawa ina i yiwa na dal ui icwa yaba (nga̱ aba yiwa na oge)-Hayahudawa han ha sirya Sayirinna Alekzandiriya, na Asiya. <verse eid="ACT 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 6:10" />Ama ai hinwo buna bwe manumo na bware zwama idaku na mahansa zwama idaku i cikarigo na buna buba karigyago na buba. <verse eid="ACT 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 6:11" />Kwa aba ne amagan aco an a galago, an Istifanus icwane Hwinsu na cikarigo ci Musa.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 6:12" />Kwa aba ne amagana aco na onga hinda na hawalami hai icibago i Musa. Kwa aba ne konbe Istifanus kwa ne kola bware pa majalisa mab. <verse eid="ACT 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 6:13" />Kwa aba ne kole acuma cibe, an zwamage buco buna buta curiwo inumaga cibe na ihuga na za ciri na icibagi i Musa. <verse eid="ACT 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 6:14" />Zwama ci hoge bware bu hyen Yesu ina i Nazaret i ka̱ri huzag ihug ina iburya̠ hinda bu sake cikarigo cina ci Musa uba ci curigagi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 6:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 6:15" />Aco na madale na majalisa a hanjaga Istifanus haisa, kwa aba ne hyan sinu bware inyaga na sinu i bucuma bu Hwinsu.<verse eid="ACT 6:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="ACT 7" />
  <para style="s">Cikarigo ci Istifanus pa majalisa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 7:1" />Kwa bulabe bu labe na kabano Istifanus, &lt;&lt;Ina aba hin an bu i harbuniya?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 7:2" />Kwa Istifanus ne cane: &lt;&lt;Ahun nimui na hacaca a hamui, na kublaje! Hwinsu u zaro u silta buca a buci Ibrahim bware buba na Mesofotamiya, kwa bu siwa na Haram. <verse eid="ACT 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 7:3" />&lt;Kwa Hwinsu ne hyen na bware, &lt;Curya cinge aciboi na aco nibui,&gt; hinda kore cinge ci gya na bu ciba.&gt; <verse eid="ACT 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 7:4" />&lt;&lt;Kwa bware na curya cinge ci Hakaldiyawa kwa ne madala na Haram. Nga̱ buca bu bware buba kwaji, Hwinsu u cuma bware pa cinge cina ci ga̱hi i madale bane. <verse eid="ACT 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 7:5" />Kwa Hwinsu ne pan bware gadwo u pini, ko na iponje inka. Ama Hwinsu u egyi bware alkawali an buba na saawo sibuba si gada cinge cini, ko nga̱ Ibrahim isa hyinwo bwa. <verse eid="ACT 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 7:6" />Harbuna Hwinsu uba i cikarigo na bware harbuna: &lt;Sawo asiboi si san hanyagat na cinge cina ci san caba, hinda aco cinge cini ci san asa gyama ai panga wahala dinya hal haya dari unasi. <verse eid="ACT 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 7:7" />Ama ne pan cinge cina ci san ga cigyama wahala,&gt; Hwinsu u hyen, &lt;Hinda na silacume ga na cinge cini zwama a kurya ana pan cilabe.&gt; <verse eid="ACT 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 7:8" />Kwa Hwinsu pan Ibrahim alkawali a kaciya. Hinda kwa Hwinsu san a maciya Ibrahim bware bwa iziya i buba Ishaku a egyi bware kaciya buba na monhon utataco.Ishaku kwa ne mace Yakub, hinda Yakubu a sa buca bu hakaka a haci ikope na harya. <verse eid="ACT 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 7:9" />&lt;&lt;Hinda hakaka ahaci haba yiwa ne hoge isibu i Isifu,an sange bware bu san bugyama na Masar. Ama Hwinsu u yanse na bware <verse eid="ACT 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 7:10" />hinda u handgage bware pa wahala wab. Hwinsu u pan bware mahansa kwa ne san bugwama bu Masar maka̠la̠ ma bware: kwa ne pan bware cugwama ci eogo Masar na yaba ahunda i Hayahudawa i bu gwama. <verse eid="ACT 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 7:11" />&lt;&lt;Kwa imirwa ne konbe Masar na Ka'ana, na wahala doone, hinda hacaca hab ha ma yage na hyan mare. <verse eid="ACT 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 7:12" />Nga̱ Yakub iba hoge an mare ma yiwa na Masar, kwa bware ne cuman hacaca a haci cihano cab ci jigu. <verse eid="ACT 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 7:13" />Na cihano cyaba ci lagi, Isihu i zwama ahun bware an bube bu sa buhun bwab, hinda Firauna a gane ihug ina Isihu. <verse eid="ACT 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 7:14" />Baya uni, Isihu i cuma a kurya na buca buba Yakub na dangi u bware ka̱mu, waba aco kope tandarya na aco ta. <verse eid="ACT 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 7:15" />Kwa Yakub ne zibi kurya u Masar, ahwayi iba kwaji na buca a buci. <verse eid="ACT 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 7:16" />Kwa aba ne huga hakanga haba kwa ne kole a na Shekem kwa iri han na iziya ina i Ibrahim iba san na musare dinyiya pa saawo si Hamor apayi na shekem. <verse eid="ACT 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 7:17" />&lt;&lt;Nga̱ lokaci uba i una u Hwinsu uba ka̱ri sinji alkawali uba ia̱gi Ibrahim, monso wa aco naci na Masar uma jidaga dinyiya. <verse eid="ACT 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 7:18" />Kwa aba na ea bugwama hya, buna boi dakuwo Isihu, aba tane bo bugwama bu Masar. <verse eid="ACT 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 7:19" />Bugwama buni bu egyi aco naci ina i sa burya̠ bu pan hakaka a haci wahala bu sa ci kwama mujinjiri nga̱ muba moi kwaji. <verse eid="ACT 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 7:20" />&lt;&lt;Lokaci buni aba mace Musa, hinda bware bui san bwa bu harbuniyo. Pyana bitaco aba hyaba bware na yaba buco bu bware. <verse eid="ACT 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 7:21" />Nga̱ aba kwama bware na ijapu, bwa bu Pirauna bu cu'a bu tanga bware kwa ringya bwa nga̱ bwa buba. <verse eid="ACT 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 7:22" />Kwa aba ne cibaga Musa ka̱mu mahansa aco Masar hinda bware buza koce pa cikarigo na ibwana. <verse eid="ACT 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 7:23" />&lt;&lt;Nga̱ Musa uba wuci haya kopenasi, kware na kore ibonge aco bware Israila. <verse eid="ACT 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 7:24" />Kwa bware ne hyan buco bu Masar buba ne pan buco bu Masar wahala, kwa buba ne kore zwama bu banga buco bu Israila hal buco bu Masar bu kwaji. <verse eid="ACT 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 7:25" />Musa u nga̱ an ko aco uba ai daki an Hwinsu u kole bware zwama taimaki aco uba, ama ina ai dakuwo. <verse eid="ACT 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 7:26" />Inga ubogwa uba wa bonge Musa kwa ne bangi aco barya asa Israila wab ne ihona. Kwa bware ne kore an bu hangage ga bu hyan naba, &lt;Ga̱hi aco na, i hanwo; be san ga̱hi i ginbo na macumaga?&gt; <verse eid="ACT 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 7:27" />&lt;&lt;Kwa buna buyiwa ne pan bucagiye wahala ne cane, &lt;Ganba bubusan go isan bugwama na alkali naci?&gt; <verse eid="ACT 7:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 7:28" />Buginbo na hona nga̱ go bwa hone buco bu Masar uho?&gt; <verse eid="ACT 7:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 7:29" />Inga Musa uba hoge haruni, kwa bware ne some koro Midiyan, ihuga ina i buba madale ne cinyagata hinda bware bu mace saawo sirya. <verse eid="ACT 7:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 7:30" />&lt;&lt;Nga̱ haya kopenasi hab aliyi, bucuma bu Hwinsu bu silta Musa na ula u garu na ca hila ciya na eogo i Sinai. <verse eid="ACT 7:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 7:31" />Nga̱ bware buba hyan, bu hoge mamaki dinya na hila, nga̱ buba ma yabuta zwa bu hyan, kwa buba ne hoge bicwaro bi Hwinsu: <verse eid="ACT 7:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 7:32" />Gyamui nesa Hwinsu buco bu hakaka a habui, Hwinsu u Ibrahim, ishaku na Yakub.&gt; Musa zwama iwasa kwa buba ne ihoge iwasa i byane. <verse eid="ACT 7:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 7:33" />&lt;&lt;Kwa Hwinsu ne hin ni bware, &lt;mazacige hatak a habui; zwam ihuga ina i goo bu yiwa isa ihuga ina i za ciri. <verse eid="ACT 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 7:34" />Na hyano wahala wa aco nimui na Masar. na hogo cidaro cyaba na kurya zwama gya handgage ga na wahala wab. Baniya kurya, ne gopa ne bucuma korwo u Masar. <verse eid="ACT 7:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 7:35" />&lt;&lt;To, Musa una aba wonje hal ne zwamaga, &lt;Ganba buba pan cugwama na alkali acici?&gt; Hwinsu cuma bware an bu san buco bulabe hinda buna bui cagaga, nga̱ acuma a Hwinsu aba a silta bware na hil. <verse eid="ACT 7:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 7:36" />Bu sire nab na Masar bu egyi i mamakina cinge ci Masar, na uwo u sane na suwa u hilo. <verse eid="ACT 7:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 7:37" />&lt;&lt;Musa uni buna una u zwama aco Israila, &lt;Hwinsu ui cuma na bucuma bu Hwinsu buna bu yiwa nga̱ gya na shuwa wa aco nahin.&gt; <verse eid="ACT 7:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 7:38" />Bware bube bu tanaga aco Israila na hilo, hinda buba na acuma a Hwinsu ana a ia̠gi ga cikarigo na eogo i Sinai, hinda na hacaca a haci; bu ce cikarigo cina cici san zangaro u sigita. <verse eid="ACT 7:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 7:39" />&lt;&lt;Ama hacacaa haci ha wonje lagan cikarigo ci bware kwa aba na ka̠ri maringe Masar. <verse eid="ACT 7:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 7:40" />A zwama Haruna, &lt;Ci ia̠gi ugunki una u ga̠ci oi ci ciba yina a ga̠ci ci lagan. Zwama Musa una wa ci silacome na cinge ci Masar ci dakuwo ina i ia̱gi na bware!&gt; <verse eid="ACT 7:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 7:41" />Lokaci buni aba ia̠gi gunki una u nyaga alaki. A kolage on sadaka kwa ne ia̱ga lago we ihogo i laco ina wa wab uba ia̠gi. <verse eid="ACT 7:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 7:42" />Zwama haruni Hwinsu u pan ga kacuta kwa uba ne san ga i lagano ikanga mu zaro. uni u i daidai na ina acubago Hwinsu hab zwamage na hatakad hab: &lt;&lt; &lt;Ina kolage sadaka na daje haya kope nasi na hilo, aco yaba i Israila? <verse eid="ACT 7:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 7:43" />I pan gunki u Molek cilabe na muginga hagunki aha̱hin Repan, hagunki han ha ga̱hin i kuztaganu. Zwama haruni nisan ai zan cigyama ai kole mere u Babila. <verse eid="ACT 7:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 7:44" />&lt;&lt;Hacaca a haci aza mukaba muna mu cibe ana Hwinsu u yanse nab na hilo. Uni ube usa ukab una u Hwinsu uba zwama Musa u i, hinda a i daidai nga̱ Hwinsu hin an bu i. <verse eid="ACT 7:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="ACT 7:45" />Mukab muni mu be mu hacaca a haci hab gaje, aba a gya cumi lokaci u Joshuwa nga̱ aba ce cinge cina ci Hwinsu uba ance ga. Ikaba ini iyiwa hal kurwa u zamani u Dauda, <verse eid="ACT 7:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="ACT 7:46" />Hwinsu u hugi laco yama Hwinsu kwa na kaba Hwinsu bu i eme pa Hwinsu i dala zwama kaka akaci Yakub. <verse eid="ACT 7:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="ACT 7:47" />Ama Sulemanu abe ama yaba zwama Hwinsu. <verse eid="ACT 7:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="ACT 7:48" />&lt;&lt;Ka̱mu na haruni, Hwinsu uza na madala na yaba ina buma buba ma na wa. nga̱ izwamago ea cuma Hwinsu: <verse eid="ACT 7:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="ACT 7:49" />&lt;&lt; &lt;Zaro usa ihug in gya niyiwa ni cigwama waba hina zaro usa huga ina gya nizi kuce wab dalo nimu, hinda cinge san ihuga i uhunpacu nimui? <verse eid="ACT 7:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="ACT 7:50" />Sa wa nimoi ube u egyi ina ka̱mu?&gt; <verse eid="ACT 7:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="ACT 7:51" />&lt;&lt;Ga̠hi aco na ai hugagowa, aco na da̱ri soo na hacobe han hai hugagowa! I nyaga na hacaca an ha̠hin: Tohonba iwonje yaje na cikarigo ci Hwinsu! <verse eid="ACT 7:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="ACT 7:52" />Aza acubago a ha̠hin hana aba ai panuwa wahala? An kome buna bu i cikarigo korwo buna buza magwata̠. Hinda baniya i cuta kwa ne hone bware- <verse eid="ACT 7:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="ACT 7:53" />ga̱hi i ce icibago pa acuma Hwinsu hinda i laganowa ina ga̱ini hoge.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 7:53" /></para>
  <para style="s">A bwagi Istifanus na hatare</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="ACT 7:54" />Nga̱ aba hoge haruni, kwa aba ne dabe hashuwa aba na mahakanga hela. <verse eid="ACT 7:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="ACT 7:55" />Ama Istifanus, na koce u Hwinsu, bu dande haisa na zaro u hyan monsho ui ibwana i ba, hinda Yesu kwa ima dale na wa u cuga u Hwinsu. <verse eid="ACT 7:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="ACT 7:56" />&lt;&lt;Byana.&gt;&gt; bware bu hyen, &lt;&lt;Nahyan zaro magoje hinda kwa gya ne hya Bwa bu buco buyiwa tare na wa ucuga u Hwinsu.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 7:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="ACT 7:57" />Ama kwa aba ne san cuog dinyiya, kwa na ma kubtagana hacobe, kwa ne yanmana munda pa bware. <verse eid="ACT 7:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="ACT 7:58" />kwa na silacome bware na i'ogo kwa aba tadana itag bware na hatare. Aisanuwo, kwa aba iri hazonga hab pa bulagasa hya buna aba uga Shawulu. <verse eid="ACT 7:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="ACT 7:59" />Aba tag bware na hatare, Istifanus i yi a̱hunda, &lt;&lt;Bugwama bu doone Yesu, ca a̱huru nimui.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 7:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="ACT 7:60" />Kwa bware ne kuzat kwa buba ne gonja uno, &lt;&lt;Bugwama bu doone, rutaga magwata̱ mana maba i.&gt;&gt; Nga̱ bware hin haruni kwa buba ne labuta.<verse eid="ACT 7:60" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="ACT 8" />
  <para style="p">1 Hinda Shawulu an yanse apayi, buna busa ciki a seda bu yaje ana a hone Istifanus.</para>
  <para style="s">Shawulu a dame alagano yesu hinda a ma pusi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 8:2" />Aco na ayiwa na hoge iwasa Hwinsu an wunba Istifanus kwa na egyi bware makoki. <verse eid="ACT 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 8:3" />Ama shawulu a hina ne dama aco coci. Bu hina na lagana muyaba muab aco coci bu silacumya ga hinda bu kwama ga na ukaba u ci'incu. <verse eid="ACT 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 8:4" />Aco na an mapusi a hina ne zwamaga aco cikarigo ci Hwinsu duk ihug ina aba kore. <verse eid="ACT 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 8:5" />Filibus kwa zibi i'ogo ina i yiwa na Samariya kwa bware na zwamag cikarigo ci Kristi hwayi. <verse eid="ACT 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 8:6" />Inga aco na matanaga aba huan i mamaki ina i Filibus aba i, kwa aba ne iri suwa waba pa cikarigo ci bware. <verse eid="ACT 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 8:7" />Mupyala mu wo mu sire na cuogo, hinda aco mahona ma amaci na gunu a hwengacome ga. <verse eid="ACT 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 8:8" />Zwama haruni a i wa̱wo na i'ogo ka̱mu.<verse eid="ACT 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Saminu a cibyano</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 8:9" />Aza buco buna niyiwa bu ugi Saminu bu ia̱gu cibyanu ni i'ogo hinda bupa aco mamaki ni Samariya. Buhina ni ciba ani busa bucyahya zwama ina buba ia̱gu, <verse eid="ACT 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 8:10" />Hinda aco labe i aco nuya, a yaji ni buba dinyiya kwa aba ni hyin, &lt;&lt;Buco buna buza kuce Hwinsu dinya. <verse eid="ACT 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 8:11" />A hina ni lagan zwama iyi mamaki ina uba ni ia̱gu. <verse eid="ACT 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 8:12" />Ama nga̱ buba yaji ni Pilibus nga̱ bware buba ia̱giga cikarigo ci urya ci cigwama ci Hwinsu ni ize i Yesu Kristi, a ia̱giga baptisma, aco cware na aco cu'a. <verse eid="ACT 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 8:13" />Saminu abama a yaji hinda kwa aba ni ia̱gi bware baptisma. Kwa bware ni lagana Pilibus tuhumba bware bu wali, ni iugi i mamaki u ina bware bu hyan Pilibus a i. <verse eid="ACT 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 8:14" />Nga̱ silmajiri ni Urshalima siba hugi ana aco Samariya aco cikarigo ci Hwinsu, kwa aba ni cumana Bitrus ni Yuhana paba. <verse eid="ACT 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 8:15" />Nga̱ aba wuci, kwa aba ni ia̱gyaga ahunda nga̱ a̱huru a burya̠ aba e kure paba, <verse eid="ACT 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 8:16" />Zwama a̱huru a burya̠ esi kurya paba; ama a ia̱gi ga baptisma ni ize Bugwama bu duniya Yesu. <verse eid="ACT 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 8:17" />Hinda Bitrus ni Yuhana ataniga wa, kwa aba ni cya a̱huru a burya̠. <verse eid="ACT 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 8:18" />Nga̱ Saminu aba hyan apa a̱huru aburya̠ pa idangagu ni wa ina silmajiri siba i, kwa bware ni cutanga musare <verse eid="ACT 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 8:19" />kwa ni hin, &lt;&lt;Ni panoji iri koce na nga̱ gyama si ni tani buco wa buba cya a̱huru a burya̠.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 8:20" />Bitrus a cyani bware: &lt;&lt;Goo ni musare amabui i kwaji, zwama goo bu nga̱ ana buisa daji u Hwinsu ni musare! <verse eid="ACT 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 8:21" />Buza habe ni ibwana ini i Hwinsu, zwama soo nibui wuisa u burya̠ ni Hwinsu. <verse eid="ACT 8:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 8:22" />Curyaji eewo hinda i iyi ahunda̱ pa Bugwama bu doone Yesu. Ko bui bu curyagya ina goo buza eewo ni soo ninui. <verse eid="ACT 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 8:23" />Zwama ni hyan suwa nibui hacigagi dinyiya hinda eewo iriganu ibu kumgagu.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 8:24" />Kwa Saminu ni cyani, &lt;&lt;Ni ia̱gi ahunda̱ pa Buca̱ bu yaba Yesu zwama ini goo bu hin iza na hyan.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 8:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 8:25" />Nga̱ aba zwama cikarigo ci Hwinsu ni samaritan, kwa Bitrus ni Yuhana kwa ni maringiya Urshalima, aba ni ia̱gu cibaga cikarigo ci Hwinsu ni mu'ogo mu Samariya.<verse eid="ACT 8:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Filibus ni buco bu Itopiya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 8:26" />Baniya kwa acuma Hwinsu ni hyan ni Filibus, &lt;&lt;Ala imiyi yina hila una ulaga kuruwa Urshalimani Gaza.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 8:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 8:27" />Kwa bware ni ala hinda bware ni yina u kuro kwa ni bangi buco bu Itopiya buna busa bulabe bu ci'iru, Isarauniya i Itopiya. Buco buna bu kuri Urshalima zwama bu pa Hwinsu ci labe, <verse eid="ACT 8:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 8:28" />Buba ni yina u giyu zata u bijwak bi buba ni karanta utakada u bucubagu bu Hwinsu Ishaya. <verse eid="ACT 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 8:29" />Kwa ahuru burya̠ ni hyan ni Filibus, &lt;&lt;Madanjigani kuri pa bijwak hinda goo yisa ciyabu ni buba.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 8:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 8:30" />Kwa Filibus ni kuri pa bijwak nga̱ bware buba kubli kwa ni huge buba ni karanta u takada u acibagu a Hwinsu Ishaya. &lt;&lt;Bu ganige ini goo ini goo buyiwa ni karanta? Filibus a kaba. <verse eid="ACT 8:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 8:31" />&lt;&lt;Niya gya ni ganya,&gt;&gt; bu hin, &lt;&lt;Kwa ni hin buna bui ni cibaga ?&gt;&gt; Kwa buba ni uga Filibus a hindana bijwak a madale ni bware. <verse eid="ACT 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 8:32" />Bu'unga buni buyiwa ni karanta cikarigo ci Hwinsu cina ci hin: &lt;&lt;A kaji bware nga̱ bitamui bina buba gimba i baciga, hinda nga̱ bitamui aba baciga hinda bui hinwa ihya. <verse eid="ACT 8:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 8:33" />A yagage bware aba gazga bware ni cikarigo ci kamahinda gamba bui ia̱gu cikarigo ci azwaga bware? Zwama azacigi a̱huru a bware ni cinge.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 8:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 8:34" />Bu unga kwa ni kabana Filibus, &lt;&lt;Ni zwamana, Gamba acuma a Hwinsu aba rubagu bware pya ko buco bu mayiwa?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 8:35" />Kwa Filibus ni rwag i hugu ini aba i cikarigo ci Hwinsu hinda kwa ni zwamani bwa cikarigu ci burya̠ ci Yesu. <verse eid="ACT 8:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 8:36" />Nga̱ aba ali ni cihana, kwa aba ni wuca̱ ihugu ini zi miya kwa bu'unga buni ni kaban Filibus, &lt;&lt;Byan, miya aman. Biya igaz ini ia̱gi baptisma?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 8:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 8:37" />Kwa filibus ni hin, &lt;&lt;su bu tani soo nibuya, ibu ia̱gya.? Kwa bu'unga ni cani, &lt;&lt;Ni tani soo Yesu Kristi isa bwa bu Hwinsu.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 8:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 8:38" />Kwa bware ni zwaman bijwak bi yisa. ka̱mu ni Filibus ni Bu'unga a kanzigi kwa ni isa ni miya kwa filibus ni egyaga baptisma. <verse eid="ACT 8:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 8:39" />Inga aba a sire ni suwa miya, ahuru a burya̠ a Hwinsu kwa ni zangaco Filibus, hinda bu'unga bui hyanakana bware, kwa buba ni mawalan buba ni egu wa̱wo. <verse eid="ACT 8:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 8:40" />Kwa Filibus, ni mahyanan ni icwa yaba pa Azotus. Hinda bware bu hina ni ringe mu'ogo buba ni cibaga cikarigo ci Hwinsu ni mu'ogu ka̱mu kwa nga̱ bware bu wuci Kaseriya.<verse eid="ACT 8:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="ACT 9" />
  <para style="s">Shawulu u ciye yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 9:1" />Shawulu uri gaba na tsananta alagano Yesu. Bware bu kure pa Bulabe bulab <verse eid="ACT 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 9:2" />Kwa na ciya utakarda u izini kurwa na yaba ya hunda a Damasku, zwama si bware bu kumbe duk buna bu lagano yina burya̠ , bu zangi bwa kura Urshalima ko boco bu cu'a ko buco bu cure. <verse eid="ACT 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 9:3" />Inga shawulu buba yabta Damasku na cihano cibware, kwa haske na zaro na katane bware. <verse eid="ACT 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 9:4" />Kwa bware na hene na cinge bicuro na zaro kwa na hina bware, &lt;&lt;Shawulu, Shawulu, zwama biya goo bu yiwa na tsananta?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 9:5" />&lt;&lt;Goo busa gamba, Bugwama bu duniya?&gt;&gt; Shawulu a kaba̱. &lt;&lt;Gyamuyi nasa Yesu, buna goo buyuwa na tsananta,&gt;&gt; a cane bware. <verse eid="ACT 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 9:6" />&lt;&lt;Baniya masingaye, ise na i'ogo, ibu zwaman ina guwo bui hin&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 9:7" />Aco na yiwa na cihano na Sawul a yisa ko ni cikarigo; a huge cikarigo amma a hyenuwa buciyehe. <verse eid="ACT 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 9:8" />kwa Shawulu a masinge na cinge, amma nga̱ bware buba gungiye hise ha bware bua henu ihe. kwa aba ni kaji bware kuruwa damasku. <verse eid="ACT 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 9:9" />Muho mu bwa mutaco, bware buruba, bware iyuwa bwa shuwa. <verse eid="ACT 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 9:10" />Na Damasku almajirai hye a yuwa iziya yaba Hananiya. Bugwama bu. duniya bu ugu bware na halabuwa, &lt;&lt;Hananiya!&gt;&gt; kwa bware na cane, &lt;&lt;Gyamui a buna bugwama bu duniya&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 9:11" />Kwa Yesu na zwama bware, &lt;&lt;Kwa na yaba Yahuda yina na u'ahiye sambai, goo kaba buciyehe bu tarsus iziya ibuba shawulu, buyiwa na hye a hunda. <verse eid="ACT 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 9:12" />Na halabuwa bware bu hye buciyahye izina ibuba Hananiya a kura a jukani bware wah ahyegi bware a hunda bware bu hyenage.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 9:13" />&lt;&lt;Buca̱ bu yaba&gt;&gt; Hananiya a cane, &lt;&lt;Na huge cikarigwo zwam bware na eewo ka̱mu pa aco na za ciri na Urshalima. <verse eid="ACT 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 9:14" />Hinda bware bu kura na koce a Bulabe bulabe bu kunbage alagano ana yiwa na uge ize nubwe&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 9:15" />Ama kwa bugwama bu doone na hya na Hananiya, &lt;&lt;Ala! Buco buna busa numui bware bui kule ize nimui pa aco ni sa Hayahudawa na mugwama muwab pa aco Isra'la <verse eid="ACT 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 9:16" />Nai ciba nga̱ bware buba bui so wahala zwama ize nimui&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 9:17" />Kwa Hananiya ne kure na Yaba ina Bulus uba yiwa, kwa ni tana bware wa. &lt;&lt;Buhun abumui Bulus,&gt;&gt; kwa ni hin Hwinsu ni cuma-Yesu ni icwa yoba una wa bu silta na yina ana ga̱hi laga kurwo pini. Bware buni cuma zwam ga̱hi i hyanagi hinda i sinji na a̱huru a Hwinsu. <verse eid="ACT 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 9:18" />Take, ihye ina nyaga na upogo na sire na suwa hise ha Shawulu, bware kwa na hyana gya hinda. Bware bu masinge kwa aba na yhage bware baptisma. <verse eid="ACT 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 9:19" />Kwa Shawulu na re mare, bware kwa koce bware na maringiya. Shawulu uhyi muho na silmajeri na suwa Damasku. Shawulu na suwa Damasku na Urshalima.<verse eid="ACT 9:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Shawulu u zwama aco cikarigo ci Hwinsu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 9:20" />Take bware bu hina na rwage wa'azi na muginga Yesu asa bwa bu hwinsu. <verse eid="ACT 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 9:21" />Kamu aco na huge bware kwa mamaki na kumbega hal hina makaba, &lt;&lt;Sa buci mana bwa bu hunage aco ana lagano na suwa Urshalima? sa bubiya bwa kure apiyi zangiye aco ni yaba ci'incu pa bulabe bu labe?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 9:22" />Ama ka̱mu na harunya Shawulu a jidana na koce. bware bu hina na rikita Hayahudawa ana ama daliya na Damasku na tabacega na Yesu abiya asa Kristi. <verse eid="ACT 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 9:23" />Nga̱ muho cimu aba aliyi, Hayahudawa kwa na iyi shawara a hune Shawulu; <verse eid="ACT 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 9:24" />Amma Shawulu kwa na huge shiri wab. gita na hwinsu aba na ape na ibba zwama si hya bware a hune bware. <verse eid="ACT 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 9:25" />Amma alaganu bware a zangaciye bware na gita kwa na zumbuliye bware na tasu i labe zata wa katanga. <verse eid="ACT 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 9:26" />Inga bware buba kura na Urshalima, bware bu yi kokari bu magami na silmariji, amma aba kamu na wasa i bware, a yajuwa ana bware busa almajiri. <verse eid="ACT 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 9:27" />Ama Barnaba a zangi bware kwa na kuliya pa silmajiri si Yesu. Bware bu zwama ga Shawulu na kura cuhanu ci bware bu hyan Buca̱ bu yaba Yesu na u yina korwo Damasku hind Buca̱ bu yaba bu iyi cikarigio na bware, nga̱ bware buba hina na wa'azi na Damaskus na wasa na ziya Yesu. <verse eid="ACT 9:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 9:28" />Shawulu a madaliye naba na Urshalima ko na iwasa, na cikarigiwo ko na iwasa na ziya Buca̱ bu yaba Yesu. <verse eid="ACT 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 9:29" />Bware bu iyi cikarigo Helinanci na Hayahudawa, amma a iyi kokari i huni ibware. <verse eid="ACT 9:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 9:30" />Nga̱ alagano Yesu, kwa aba na suwe na bware kura kaisairiya, na cuma bware kura wa Tasus. <verse eid="ACT 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 9:31" />Kwa alagano ana yiwa Hayahudawa, na Galili na samariya, kwa aba na hin dala a salama. a huge kuce; hinda a a̱huru a burya̠ a hinda a hina na pana kuce, a hina na Musa dinyiya, na dala i wasa Buca̱ bu yaba Yesu.<verse eid="ACT 9:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Iniyas na Tabita</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 9:32" />Nga̱ Bitrus aba i cihano na mu'ogo kwa ni lagana aco Hwinsu ana yiwa na Lidda. <verse eid="ACT 9:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 9:33" />Bware bu bangi buciyaye aba ugo Iniyas, buna buza mahuna ma maci haya Utataco. <verse eid="ACT 9:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 9:34" />&lt;&lt;Iniyas &gt;&gt; Bitrus a hin na bware, &lt;&lt;Yesu Kristi aba hungacuma. masingiya zagaciya ugupa nubiya&gt;&gt; Take kwa Iniyas na masingya. <verse eid="ACT 9:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 9:35" />Kamu aco na yiwa na dala na Lidda na sharon a hyan bware kwa aba na marigiya pa Buca̱ bu yaba Yesu. <verse eid="ACT 9:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 9:36" />Na Yoffa almajiri a yiwa ana aba ugana Itabita (ni Helinanci a ugo nya Dokas), Tamba i ia̱gagu i burya̠ pa aco na za ihya. <verse eid="ACT 9:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 9:37" />Na Muhun muni i labci mahuna kwa iba na kwaji, nga̱ aba asigi nya̱ kwa na labuta ikanga iba na okaba zata. <verse eid="ACT 9:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 9:38" />Lidda u yabta na Yoffa; nga̱ silmajiri siba huge ana Bitrus ayuwa na Lidda, aba kwa na cuma aco bware pa Bitrus kwa aba na ure bware, &lt;&lt;Kusu kura tare na gaci baniya!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 9:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 9:39" />Bitrus a kura tare nab, nga̱ bware buba wuce kwa aba na kulah bware na kaba uzatae kamu si'a sina si nage sare kwa siba na ringan bware, na cidaro aba na cibaga bware hazunga hana itabita iba pangaga lokaci ana iba hyase tare naba <verse eid="ACT 9:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 9:40" />Bitrus a silacumega kamu na japu; kwa bware na kuszata na hawugurmi ha bware na hina ahunda bware kwa na bena Bu'ah buna bu kwaji; bware bu hye, &lt;&lt;Tabita, masingiya&gt;&gt; kwa iba na gunja hisah hyeb, nga̱ iba hye Bitrus kwa iba na madalah. <verse eid="ACT 9:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 9:41" />Kwa Bitrus na cutan wa wuba kwa na asinga nya bi yinsa. kwa bware na uga alagano na si'a sina si nagagi sare sibba kwa na cutanaga iba na muhuju. <verse eid="ACT 9:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 9:42" />zwamuniya dagaba bu huge wuh kamu na i ugo i Yoffa, aco danya ayaje na Buca̱ bu yaba Yesu. <verse eid="ACT 9:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 9:43" />Bitrus amedaliye na Yoffa lokaci cimu na yaba bucohya buna busa baduku ana aba ugo siman.<verse eid="ACT 9:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="ACT 10" />
  <para style="s">Bitrus a oga usoja labe ziyara</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 10:1" />Na kaisariya aza buco muna aba ugo koneliyus, busa usoja i labe na roma. <verse eid="ACT 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 10:2" />Buba kamu na bu'a na saawo buba ayiwa na hugi iwasa Hwinsu; bu panga daja pa aco na za ihya bu egu ahunda̱ pa hwinsu taba lokaci: <verse eid="ACT 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 10:3" />wahye, na karfe atacu a hwinsu kwa bware na hye halabuwa. bware bu hye acuma Hwinsu, ma kura pa bware kwa na hye, &lt;&lt;Koneliyus! &gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 10:4" />Koneliyus kwa na halana bwa haisa na iwasa Koneliyus bu kaba.&lt;&lt; Biya, guwo bu gimba gya ia̱g?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 10:4">kwa acuma Hwinsu na cana, &lt;&lt;a̱hunda na daje wa aco na za ihya u kurya zata i butarego pa Hwinsu. <verse eid="ACT 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 10:5" />Baniya cumana aco na Yoffa a ringiya kacuta buco buna aba ugo Saminu buna aba ogo Bitrus. <verse eid="ACT 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 10:6" />Bware bu madale pa saminu Baduku ana aza yaba ciyabu ni u'wo&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 10:7" />Inga acuma a Hwinsu mana ma iyi cikarigo na bware maba ma aliyi, kwa kolineyus na uga gyama bware barya, na soja una iza iwasa Hwinsu. <verse eid="ACT 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 10:8" />Kwa kolineyus na zwamana ga tuwamba ka̱mu ina egyi kwa na cumanaga kurwa u Yoffa.<verse eid="ACT 10:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Halabuwa ha Bitrus.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 10:9" />Na hwinsu na icwa daidai nga̱ ubungwa uba wa bunge aba na cihano cab a yabutano i'ogo, Bitrus a danje zata ukaba a ea ahunda. <verse eid="ACT 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 10:10" />Kwa Bitrus na huge imirwa bu gimbage mare ma cire, nga̱ aba egyi bware mare, kwa Hwinsu na ciba bware ihya nga̱ halabo. <verse eid="ACT 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 10:11" />Bitrus a hyan zaro u ma gunjiye hinda i hyan aba na zubali ulapo i labe kurwa u cinge hagagi ha nasi ha duniya. <verse eid="ACT 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 10:12" />Na suwa ui ulapo i labe nama ka̱mu na mukwacukwacu si cinge, mawono mu zaro. <verse eid="ACT 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 10:13" />Kwa bicagiye bicwara na hin na Bitrus, &lt;&lt;Masinge, Bitrus. Bacige go i're&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 10:14" />Bitrus a cane. &lt;&lt;Aye, Bugwama bu duniya! &gt;&gt; &lt;&lt;Nas tabuwa ire ina yiwa na ciri &gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 10:15" />Hwinsu kwa ni jidana ia̱gya bware cikarigo, &lt;&lt;Ta ugana ina ihya ina Hwimsu uba ia̠gi an isa burya̠ &gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 10:16" />A ia̠gi haruni hal korwa utaco kwa aba na zangace ulapo kuro zaro. <verse eid="ACT 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 10:17" />Bitrus aba na wugi soo halabuwa ha bware, aco na Koneliyus aba a cuma a wuco i'eba yaba Saminu kwa a yisana na i'eba i yaba. <verse eid="ACT 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 10:18" />Kwa aba na ogan ko buna aba ogo saminu hinda Bitrus bu yiwa na shuwa u yaba ni. <verse eid="ACT 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 10:19" />Bitrus uba na wugi halabuwa ha bware, kwa a a̠huru a burya̠ na hin na bware, &lt;&lt;Byana, aco bataco a yiwa na gimbo nobuya. <verse eid="ACT 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 10:20" />Masimge kazinge. Ta hacigaga lokaci naba, zwamu na cumaga.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 10:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 10:21" />Bitrus kwa na kazinge kwa na hyen bwa naba, &lt;&lt;Gyamuya gahe iyuwa na gimbo. igya ya ikuliya?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 10:22" />Aco ni kwa na cane bware, &lt;&lt;Koneliyus isoja i labe ibe ya cicuma. Busa buco bu burya̠ bu yiwa na hoge iwasa i Hwinsu, Hayahudawa ha yiwa na pan bware cilabe. bucuma bu Hwinsu na zaa ciri ginbago an goo kore zwama ahoge ina goo bui zwame.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 10:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 10:23" />Bitrus kwa na isa aco ni na yaba bware bitrus na suwa yaba ya Koneliyus.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 10:23">Inga ubungwa uba wa bunge Bitrus kwa na ala tare naba, acagiya alagano kure tare nab na Yoffa. <verse eid="ACT 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 10:24" />nga ubungwa uba wa bunge a kore Karsariya. Koneliyus uba na anpe wab, hal bware bu uga ka̱mu anhun bware na siboki si bware. <verse eid="ACT 10:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 10:25" />Inga Bitrus aba ise na yaba, koneliyus kwa na kore pa bware kwa na kuzata na buna Bitrus na pana bware cilabe. <verse eid="ACT 10:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 10:26" />Kwa Bitrus na sana bware bu masinge &lt;&lt;Masingiye&gt;&gt; bware bu hin, Gya nasa buma kawai nga̱ goo&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 10:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 10:27" />Inga Bitrus wa ise yaba aba na cikarigiyo kalinuis, Bitrus a ise yaba kwa na bangi aco dinga na suwa yaba. <verse eid="ACT 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 10:28" />Bitrus a hin naba; &lt;&lt;Ga̱hin i daki ka̱mu an wai sa u burya̠ an Bayahude amagamai na buna bui sa Bayahude ko hinda bu kore na yaba i buba. hind Hwinsu una cibiye an gya ta ugana buciyahya ana buza ciri. <verse eid="ACT 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 10:29" />Zwamu harbuniya, Inga aba a cuma ahwamui. Na kura i kabana isa guwo bu cuma ahamui?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 10:30" />Kwa koneliyus na cane, &lt;&lt;Muhu nu nasi muna mu aliye gye na yaba namui na hunda na karfe ataco na hwinsu. wa sanuwo na hyan buciyahye na hazunga a cene kwa bu yisa ciyabu na gye. <verse eid="ACT 10:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 10:31" />Kwa buba hyen, &lt;Koneliyus, Hwinsu u hugo ahunda nabuya na daje una u go bu pangano aco na za ihye. <verse eid="ACT 10:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 10:32" />cuma pa Yoffa buciyahya aba ugo Saminu buna aba ogo Bitrus baduku bu madaliye ciyabo na u'wo. <verse eid="ACT 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 10:33" />kwa gya na cumana ga a bu'ugane na mabuna, hinda u i gama nga̱ ganhi korya. Baniya ka̱mu nuciya ciyiwa na pa Hwinsu cikubuliya ina ka̱mu bugwama Bu Duniya buba bwe ci zwaman&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 10:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 10:34" />Bitrus biniya kwa na rwaga cikarigiwo: &lt;&lt;Baniya, kamahinda na dako an Hwinsu ui sa u maka̠la̠ mai icwa <verse eid="ACT 10:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 10:35" />ama hwinsu u yaje na aco ka̱mu an yiwa na hoge iwasa uba hinda a ia̱gu ina sa burya̠ . <verse eid="ACT 10:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 10:36" />I daki cicuma cina Hwinsu uba wa cuma pa aco Isra'ila, na zwamaga cikarigiyo ci laco ci dala burya̠ cina ciyiwa pa Yesu Kristi, ana sa Bugwama bu duniya ka̱mu. <verse eid="ACT 10:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 10:37" />I daki ina i ia̠gi ka̱mu na yahudiya, i rwagu na galili na hogu cikarigo ci baptisma cina ci Yohana aba i <verse eid="ACT 10:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 10:38" />Inga Hwinsu uba tanga Yesu u Nazaret na manobe na a̠huru a burya̠ na koce, nga̱ Yesu iba hina na ange na ia̱ga i burya̠ na hungacuma aco mahuna ka̱mu mana ma shetan aba palage koce buba, zwamu Hwinsu uyanse na bware. <verse eid="ACT 10:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 10:39" />&lt;&lt;Cisa shaidu ina bware buba ia̠gi ka̱mu na mu'ugo mu Hayahudawa na Urshalima. A hune bware hal juka bware na u'on, <verse eid="ACT 10:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 10:40" />Ama Hwinsu u asingiya bware pa aco kwadwo hon tacula usa aco henagi bware. <verse eid="ACT 10:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 10:41" />Sa ka̱mu aco a hyan bware, ama gaci ha shaidu hana ha Hwinsu uba tanga ga̠ci buna ci re na ci so tare na bware nga̱ buba masinge pa aco a kwadwo. <verse eid="ACT 10:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 10:42" />Hwinsu bu cisa ci ia̠gi aco wa'azi hinda ci zwame an bu biya bui sana ana a cikarigo ci aco na yiwa na aco na kwadagi. <verse eid="ACT 10:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 10:43" />Ka̠mu Acubagu a i a zwamage an ka̱mu buna bu yaje na Bware ai curya magwata̱ ma buba zwama iziya pa iziya bware.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 10:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 10:44" />Bitrus aba na cikarigo, kwa a̱huru a burya̠ na kure pa ka̱mu aco na yiwa huge cikarigiwo. <verse eid="ACT 10:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="ACT 10:45" />Hayahudawa hana ha laga Bitrus a huge mamaki ka̱mu na aco na aisa Hayahudawa a ciye daje wa a̱huru aburya̠ . <verse eid="ACT 10:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="ACT 10:46" />Zwamu ahuge ga na numaga na sire sina si mewa aba na pana Hwinsu cilabe.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 10:46">Kwa Bitrus na hin, <verse eid="ACT 10:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="ACT 10:47" />&lt;&lt;Aza buna bui gazgana a ia̱gi aco na baptisma a miya? zwama a cuwa Ahuru a burya̠ nga̱ ga̱ci ci ce&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 10:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="ACT 10:48" />Kwa Bitrus na ia̱giga baptisma na iziya i Yesu Kristi. Kwa aba na hin na Bitrus a yinsa naba a muho cimu.<verse eid="ACT 10:48" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="ACT 11" />
  <para style="s">Bitrus a egyi aco na lagano Yesu na Urshalima bayani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 11:1" />Acumana na cagiya silmajiri si Yesu ana yiwa tuhumba na usala wa Yahudiya a hoge na aco na asa Hayahudawa aba ma a ce cikarigo ci Hwinsu. <verse eid="ACT 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 11:2" />Nga̱ Bitrus aba kure Urshalima, alagano na za kaciya a ce bware <verse eid="ACT 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 11:3" />kwa aba na hya, &lt;&lt;Bukure na yaba aco na za kaciya hinda burya̠ mare na nab&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 11:4" />Kwa Bitrus na zwamanga ini ia̱gi ka̱mu. <verse eid="ACT 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 11:5" />&lt;&lt;Ni yiwa e'og i Yoppa gya na ia̱ga ahunda̱, kwa gya na hyan ruya na hya i hya i nyaga na utakarda we dage a kazgi u'wa na zaro, uza hasala ha nasi, iba kwa na zubali pa gya na yiwa. <verse eid="ACT 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 11:6" />Nga̠ gya na byane kwa gyan nama na za Ibuna nasi na cinge, na mukwacukwacu mu hila na ina iza mukwat mu buna na wa sihwa na sikwadagi na muwono mu zaro. <verse eid="ACT 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 11:7" />kwa gya na hoge cikarigo ci hin na gya, &lt;Masingai, Bitrus. Baciga hinda goo ire.&gt;<verse eid="ACT 11:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 11:8" />&lt;&lt;Kwa gya na cane, &lt;Sa harbuniya, Buca̠ bu yaba! Aza ihye ina za daba ko ciri ya tabo ise na uno numiya.&gt;<verse eid="ACT 11:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 11:9" />&lt;&lt;Kwa gya na huge cikarigiwo korwa u lagi na zaro, Ta ugana ina Hwinsu uba hin isa iburya̠ an isa burya̠ &gt; <verse eid="ACT 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 11:10" />Zomuna u ia̠gi kasi ataco, ai sanuwo kwa aba na zangace ini kurwa u zaro hinda.<verse eid="ACT 11:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 11:11" />&lt;&lt;Ai sanuwo lokaci aco bataco an aba a cuma a hwamui ana a sirya kaisariya a kura na yaba na gya na yiwa. <verse eid="ACT 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 11:12" />Ahuru a burya̠ ana zwama gya ta hacigaga lokaci ne alagano waba. Alagano Yesu cunuhi na Yopa ani urga kurwo Karseriya kwa ga̱ci na ise yaba Karliniyos. <verse eid="ACT 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 11:13" />Bware bu ci zuma nga̱ bware buba hyan acuma Hwinsu maba ma silata na yaba kwa na hyen, cumana kura yoffa pa saminu, buna aba ugo Bitrus. <verse eid="ACT 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 11:14" />kwa Bitrus na kulage cicuma cina ka̱mu u yaba nibui ai cagaga.&gt;<verse eid="ACT 11:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 11:15" />&lt;&lt;Nga̠ gya na hina cikarigo, Ahuru a burya̠ a kurya wab nga̱ aba akure pa gaci na jigo. <verse eid="ACT 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 11:16" />kwa gya na mabutarege ina Buca̠ bu yaba buba bu hyen na jigu: &lt;Yohana wi ia̱gya baptisma na miya, ama ia̱gya baptisma na a̠huru a burya̠ .&gt; <verse eid="ACT 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 11:17" />Si Hwinsu pa daje iri uika nga̱ uba ci pa, buna bui yage na Buca̠ bu yaba Yesu Kristi, gya dwobe gazgana ibwana i Hwinsu? <verse eid="ACT 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 11:18" />Nga̠ aba hoge Bitrus a zwame ini, kwa aba na nagi ina aba i kargyagan. Kwa di a pa Hwinsu cilabe, aba na numaga, &lt;&lt;Harbuniya, Hwinsu u pa aco na a sa yahuduwa acuri kurwa icyago?&gt;<verse eid="ACT 11:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Iginga ina yiwa na Antakiya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 11:19" />Baniya aco na amagatgage zwama ihono Istipanus ali hal cinge ci finikiya, sayifuru na e'ogo Antakiya, aba na egya hayahudawa habahaba cikarigo ci Hwinsu. <verse eid="ACT 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 11:20" />Ama sicage silmajiri, aco na a sire sayifurus na sayarin, a kure Antakiya a hina na karigyagana Hahelinawa na cubagana cikarigio ci bugwama bu duniya Yesu <verse eid="ACT 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 11:21" />Wa u Hwinsu u yanse tare naba, Aco dinya a yaje a ciye cikarigo amaringeya pa Bugwama bu duniya. <verse eid="ACT 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 11:22" />Labari ina egyi i kore hacobe ha coci una u yiwa na Urshalima, kwa aba na cumana Barnaba kuro Antakiya. <verse eid="ACT 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 11:23" />Inga bware buba wuci bu hyan i burya̠ u Hwinsu, Bware bu hoge Wawo bu jidane ga koce u shuwa a yisa na burya̠ pa Buca̠ bu yaba ka̱mu na hasuwa hab. <verse eid="ACT 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 11:24" />Barnabas busa buco bu burya̠ , na sinju Ahuru a Burya̱ na tanu soo, aco dinyiya a kuliya pa Buca̠ bu yaba.<verse eid="ACT 11:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 11:25" />Kwa Barnaba na kure Tarsus gimbo u Bulus, <verse eid="ACT 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 11:26" />Nga̱ bware buba hyan Bulus, kwa Barnabas na koleya bua Antakiya. Hal uya danda Barnabas na Bulus a hina na Matagana na aco na suwa wi ginga-aba na cibaga aco dinyiya. A payiya na Antakiya aba wrage uganaga alagano a Yesu.<verse eid="ACT 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 11:27" />Na lokaci uniya a cigiya Acubago Hwinsu a sirya Urshalima kura Antakiya. <verse eid="ACT 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 11:28" />Buco buika, ize buba Agabas, bu masingiya a̱huru burya̠ a zwama bwa i ia̱ga imirwa ka̱mu doone na cinge ci Roma. (Zwama uni u egyi na cigwama ci kalaudiyus.) <verse eid="ACT 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 11:29" />Silmajiri, si mazwama an taimaki alagano Yesu an yaje na koce yaba an madale na Yahudiya. <verse eid="ACT 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 11:30" />Ina aba ia̱gi bini, acuma Barnaba na hadaje hab kuro pa aco labe na Bulus.<verse eid="ACT 11:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="ACT 12" />
  <para style="s">Isumo i Bitrus imamaki na yaba ci'incu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 12:1" />Lokaci aniya Bugwama Hiridus aba kumbage alagano a church, ni gimgo i pan ga wahala. <verse eid="ACT 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 12:2" />Bware bu kumbe Yakub, buhuwa bu Yohana, bu hune bware na kashekari. <verse eid="ACT 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 12:3" />Inga bware buba hyan Hahudawa ha huge laco, kwa bware na kumbe Bitrus. zwama uniya u rwage hon lago wai re burodi ana aza yis. <verse eid="ACT 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 12:4" />Inga aba kumbe bware, kwa na kule bware na yaba u ci'incu, a san musoja munasi mu anpan ga. Hiridus a ka̱ri a sillacumya ga pa aco hon lago ui kacigago na sinu wa aco.<verse eid="ACT 12:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 12:5" />Zwamu harbuni a curi Bitrus na yaba u ci'incu, ama alagano ama yiwa na yab ahunda a curuwa i ahunda pa Hwinsu<verse eid="ACT 12:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 12:6" />Gita na Bugwama Hiridus iba ka̱ri ia̱gya bware makabo, Bitrus kwa a labuce na usa u musoja murya, a palage bware na mari mari marya̱, hinda an a̠pe kwa a a̱pa i'iba i yaba u ci'incu. <verse eid="ACT 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 12:7" />Ai sanuwo kwa acuma Hwinsu na silataga kwa aba na hin malanga na suwa ukaba u ci'incu. Bu zime Bitrus u masinge. &lt;&lt;Mahaguza, masingiya!&gt;&gt; bu hin, kwa mari mari na ma kaksag na wa u Bitrus.<verse eid="ACT 12:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 12:8" />Kwa acuma Hwinsu na hin na Bitrus, &lt;&lt;Mabwada hazunga na hataka haboya.&gt;&gt; kwa Bitrus na ia̱gi nga̱ aba hin na bware. &lt;&lt;Mapala ugogo nibui ni laga, acuma a Hwinsu a zwama bo, <verse eid="ACT 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 12:9" />Bitrus kwa na lagana acuma Hwinsu suwa Yaba ci'icu, ama bware bwa dakuwo ina acuma Hwinsu maba egyi isa kamahinda; bware bu nga̱ an bu yiwa na halabuwa. <verse eid="ACT 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 12:10" />A hwace aco a̠pe we i'iba jigo na i'iba lagi, a wuci i'iba iroma ina sire iswa suwa wui i'ogo, i'iba kwa na ma gunja na ibaiba ,kwa aba na sire apayi. Inga aba a kure ugagi wu ujubu, kwa acuma Hwinsu na cure Bitrus .<verse eid="ACT 12:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 12:11" />Kwa hankali Bitrus na maringiya pa bware kwa na hyen, &lt;&lt;Baniya na daki kamahinda an Hwinsu u cuma acuma Hwinsu a kurya ana cagi na wa u Hiridus. ka̠mu na mugota mu hayahudawa aba magami muno a hyen ina i ia̱ga na gya.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 12:12" />nga̠ Bitrus aba a daki uniya, kwa bware na kore yaba Imaryamu amaci a Yohana, buna aba ugo markus, ihuga ina aco aba matanaga aba na ia̱g ahunda. <verse eid="ACT 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 12:13" />Bitrus kwabtana i'eba ijapu, kwa ikangaza hye igyama iziya iba Roda i kore ihyan buna bu yiwa na i'iba <verse eid="ACT 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 12:14" />Inga iba hoge bicwaro be Bitrus, kwa iba na gunjuwa i'iba kwa wa̱wo dinyiya, kwa iba na zwamana ga, &lt;&lt;Bitrus a yisa na i'iba!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 12:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 12:15" />&lt;&lt;Buza icwa,&gt;&gt; kwa aba na hin na ikangaza. Nga̱ iba natage an i yiwa harbuni, kwa aba na hin, &lt;&lt;Kila Acuma a Hwinsu a bware.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 12:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 12:16" />Ama Bitrus a curuwo ikwabtaganu wi i'iba, nga̱ aba gunjiya i'iba kwa aba na hyan bware, kwa na huge Mamaki. <verse eid="ACT 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 12:17" />Kwa Bitrus na danda wa na zaro an a o'tani, ata ea cikarigo kwa na bware na zwaman ga nga̱ bugwama bu doone buba silacome bware na yaba u ci'incu. &lt;&lt;Izwama yakub na alagano Yesu ini ina ia̱gi,&gt;&gt; bware bu hin, kwa bware na malana icyagiya ihuga. <verse eid="ACT 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 12:18" />Na ubugwa maita, rudani a ise tsakani a hasojoji na ina iagi na Bitrus. <verse eid="ACT 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 12:19" />Hiridus a gimbage Bitrus ai hyanuwa bware, kwa bware na kabgana hasojoji kwa na hyen a hunage ga. kwa Hiridus na kure na cinge ci Hayahudiya, na kure kaisariya kwa na madala ahwayi muho cimu ahwayi.<verse eid="ACT 12:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bugwama Hiridus a kwaji</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 12:20" />Hiridus bu hina cuhuriyo na aco Taya na sidon; kwa aco na kure pa Hiridus gimbo shiri. A gimbagi Bilatus ujogari u bugwama buna buba i na buba, a kaba dala u lafiya, zwama ni cinge ci Hiridus pa bware aba hyangu mare ma cire. <verse eid="ACT 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 12:21" />Na hwinsu uba wa wuce Hiridus, kwa bu madale na hazunga ha cugwama, bu madale na idalo i cugwama zwama bu egyi aco buba cikarego. <verse eid="ACT 12:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 12:22" />Kwa aba na sangana ci'ogwa, &lt;&lt;Bicwaro bi hwinsu , be san bi bumma.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 12:23" />Ai sanuwo, zwama Hiridus a panuwa Hwinsu cilabe, kwa acuma a Bugwama bu duniya na buze bware, icici hina na re bware hal bware bu kwaji. <verse eid="ACT 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 12:24" />Ama cikarigo ci burya̠ ci Hwinsu ci hina na majidana na mosho hinda na ese tuhumba na duniya. <verse eid="ACT 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 12:25" />Inga Barnaba na shawulu aba hogi ibwana na aba panga, kwa aba na maringiye Urshalima, a zangi Yohana ina aba yiwa na oge Markus.<verse eid="ACT 12:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="ACT 13" />
  <para style="s">A cuma Barnaba na Shawulu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 13:1" />A laganu ana yiwa na Antakiya aza Acubagu na Hawalami: Barnaba, na Simeyon buna aba ugi Busiri, na Lushiyus bu sayirin, na Manayen (buna bwa Musa na yaba Hiridus) na Shawulu. <verse eid="ACT 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 13:2" />Inga aba na ega ahunda pa Buca̠ bu yaba na azumi, a huru a burya̠ kwa na hye, &lt;&lt;Na kebiyi je Barnaba na Shawulu zwamu ibwana ge na uganga&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 13:3" />Inga aba hogi azumi na hunda, kwa aba na jukangana Wa'a kwa aba na cumanaga.<verse eid="ACT 13:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Silmajiri si ea wa'azi na Sayifurus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 13:4" />Aba aco barya, aba cuma zwama ahuro a burya̠ , aba na kaca kuro usayifuru. <verse eid="ACT 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 13:5" />Inga aba wuci salamis, kwa aba na cibaga na muginga mu Hayahudawa. Yohana uyiwa tare nab nga̱ buco bu taimako abuba. <verse eid="ACT 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 13:6" />Bulus a aliya i ange kamu siri hal kwa nga̱ aba a wuce Bafos. A payiya aba bangi bu Bayahude buna buza dabo hinda acubago cibya iziya ibuba Bar Yoshuwa; <verse eid="ACT 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 13:7" />Bar jesus bu yansi na gwamma sarjiyus Bulus. bulus usa buco bu mahasa, kwa na ugene Barnaba na Bulus, zwamu dware bu karsi huge cikarigo ci Hwinsu. <verse eid="ACT 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 13:8" />Amma buna iziya ibuba Alimas bu egu bu dabo zwama (ina iziya i buba ibiyiwa na nufi buniya.) bwa panuga goyon kacuta. bware na kokari bu biciki hankali a gwamma a curiye iyajo. <verse eid="ACT 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 13:9" />Amma Shawulu, buna aba uga Bulus bu sinji na ahuru a burya̠ kwa na halana Elimas hisa, kwa na hyen, <verse eid="ACT 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 13:10" />&lt;&lt;Go busa bwa bu shatan bu wunje tagamba kamu buna buza gaskiya hinda bu sinji kamu na muguta hinda na rudu. guwa bwe curuwa i hacigaga yina u burya̠ kurwa Buca̠ bu yaba? <verse eid="ACT 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 13:11" />Baniya u wa u Hwinsu uyiwa gaba na guwa. bwe rubana. lokaci cimu buza ihyena kana, buza ihyena kana haske hwinsu&gt;&gt; kwa ciku na sinji hisa ha bware, bware bu hina na takalgana na gimbo buna bwe kaji bware na wa. <verse eid="ACT 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 13:12" />Inga gwana uba hye ina fare, kwa bware na yaje, zwama bware buhugye mamaki u cicubegu ci zwama bugwama bu duniya.<verse eid="ACT 13:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Na bisidiya Antakiya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 13:13" />Daga na Bafos,Bulus na Sibikia rigoba na ci bware ukacuwa wa ferga na famfiliya, Iliya na Yohana uba curiga kwa na maringe na Urshalima. <verse eid="ACT 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 13:14" />Daga Ferga a aliye kuro Pisidiya na Antakiya . Hu wa asabar kwa na madala. <verse eid="ACT 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 13:15" />Nga̱ aba hugi karanta utakarda wu Musa muna Acubago, alabe a yaba i ahunda̱ a Hayahudawa kwa na cumanaga na cicuma ci karfafa yaba, kwa na hin &lt;&lt;Ahun nimui, siza cikarigio ci karfafawa pa aco, kusu kargyageje&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 13:16" />Kwa Bulus na Masinge bi yisa, kwa na danda wa u bware alama kwa na rwaga cikarigo: &lt;&lt;Aco Isra'ila na aco na asa Hayahudawa ana pagano Hwinsu cilabe, kubulaje! <verse eid="ACT 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 13:17" />Hwinsu wa Aco Isra'ila u tanga hacece haciya; Hwinsu sa hacaca haciya asa aco labe lokaci aba na Masar, Na Wa ukuce uba silacume ga siro wai i'ogo, <verse eid="ACT 13:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 13:18" />Bware bu iyi hakuri naba hal shekara kupe nasi na suwa uhila, <verse eid="ACT 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 13:19" />Hwinsu hunage si zwaga utandarya̠ na cinge ci ka'ana kwa na pana aco sa daje wi izana yaba. <verse eid="ACT 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 13:20" />kamu zwamuniya uzangi shakara 450 &lt;&lt;Baya wa haruniya, Hwinsu paga Silkali kwa kura Bucubago samaila. <verse eid="ACT 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 13:21" />kwa aco na kabana Bugwama, kwa uba na panaga Shawulu bwa bu kish, buna bwa sire na yaba Bayami, buna bu gwama ga hal shekara kupe nasi. <verse eid="ACT 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 13:22" />Na bisani Hwinsu u zacige Shawulu, kwa hwinsu na pana Dauda bugwama uba iyi game na Dauda: 'Na hyeguwo Dauda bwa bu Yesse buco bu suwa numuya; bware bui hye duk ina ghe na gimbo? <verse eid="ACT 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 13:23" />Na zuriya buco abuniya Hwinsu wa cumagiya Israila buco bui ceto Yesu, nga̱ uba yi alkawari <verse eid="ACT 13:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 13:24" />Kafin kurwa u Yesu, Yohanna u iyi Wa'azi we icuru wa iwo na i'egu baptisma pa kamu aco Israila. <verse eid="ACT 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 13:25" />Inga Yohana uba na hoga ibwana yuba, bware bu hye: 'Gamba gahi iyuwa na ape. Aye, amma bwa na kura kacuba kamu, buna ko hataka ha babu na panuwa pasinge? <verse eid="ACT 13:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 13:26" />Ahuwa namu; saawo si Ibrahim, na gahi ana asa hayahudawa ana wasa Hwinsu, Gaciya aba a cicumagiya cicuma ci ceto. <verse eid="ACT 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 13:27" />Aco urshalima na mugwamgwam mu aba da ganiwa Yesu, duk na harumiya ci acuma cina aba si karanci ta'amb asabar. <verse eid="ACT 13:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 13:28" />Duk na haruniya a kunbuwa bware na magata̱ mana aba hune bware, a kaba Bilatus a hune bware <verse eid="ACT 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 13:29" />Nga̱ aba zangi ka̱mu ina aba rubuci zwamu bware, a kuliya bware a kanzigi bware na u'on kwa nai labuta bware na ziya. <verse eid="ACT 13:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 13:30" />Ama Hwinsu u asingiye bware na u'o una bware buba kwaji; <verse eid="ACT 13:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 13:31" />hinda muhu dinyiya aba na henega bware cagiya aco aiyi cihano na bware kura Galili na Urshalima. Abiya baniya asa sheda bware kura pa aco.<verse eid="ACT 13:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 13:32" />&lt;&lt;Cizwama cikarigio ci laco; ina Hwinsu uba yhegiyiye hacece haciye alkawari <verse eid="ACT 13:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 13:33" />Hwinsu usinji pagacu, pa saawo saba, Inga uba asingiye Yesu. Inga aba rubuci na suwa zabura a Dauda na lagiye:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 13:33">&lt;&lt; &lt;Busa bwa abumui;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 13:33">nawuya ni sa Buca̱ abubui.<verse eid="ACT 13:33" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 13:34" />Hwinsu u ha'asingiya bware pa aco na a kadago, bware bwa posuwa, a rubuci harbuniya:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 13:34">&lt;&lt;&lt;Na bupana albarka a burya̠ , a tabaci ana gye na egiye Dauda alkawari.<verse eid="ACT 13:34" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 13:35" />Harubuni aba hilanga na ihuga hya; &lt;buza i cura bu nagu ciri bu puse na izin&gt;. <verse eid="ACT 13:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 13:36" />nga̱ Dauda uba sirji ibwana ina Hyuisu uba pa bware na zamani uba, bware kwa na labuta; a wumba bware tare na buce bu bware hinda ikanga bware i puasi <verse eid="ACT 13:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 13:37" />Ama buna Hwinsu wuba asingai pa aco na a kwadago bwa hyanuwa paso. <verse eid="ACT 13:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 13:38" />zwamu harbuni, a huwa namu na gimba go gahi daki na suwa Yesu aco aba hengu kafara u magwata̱ maba. <verse eid="ACT 13:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 13:39" />Na soo u bware ka̱mu buna bu yaje bu hinwa yama ka̱mu pa magwata̱ ma buba, kura cibago Musa ina mayage na pana i burya̱. <verse eid="ACT 13:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 13:40" />Hye kula ina acuma aba hye ta pala na goo: <verse eid="ACT 13:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 13:41" />&lt;&lt;Bena, ga̱hi aco leganu ya lela, zwama nawuya na ka̱ri hye ihe nawuya ina ga̱hi iza iyaje, ko bucohya bui zwama&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 13:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 13:42" />Nga̱ Bulus na Barnabas aba na siri na kaba wa hunda, aco kwa na uganaga regaba na cicibago zwama Hyuisu wa sabar. <verse eid="ACT 13:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 13:43" />Nga̱ aco aba Malani, kwa Hayahudawa dinyiya na cagiya aco na ise adini a Yahudawa na Kuce a laga Bulus na Barnaba, a kargyani ga a koce u soo a re gaba na aco na i burya̠ a Hwinsu. <verse eid="ACT 13:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 13:44" />Nga̱ Asabar aba a wuce aco i ia̱g ka̱ri na sire ka̱mu a huge numa Hwinsu. <verse eid="ACT 13:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="ACT 13:45" />Nga̱ Hayahudawa haba hye aco, kwa aba na huge isibu kwa na wuya yeje na ma Bulus na Barnaba aba na cibaga aco. <verse eid="ACT 13:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="ACT 13:46" />Kwa Bulus na Barnaba na caniga: &lt;&lt;Gahe Hayahudawa wu kamaci ci wrage na ia̱gi numa kacumo, nga̱ ga̱hi wanje hinda ya byanuwa buco a siji aco na a̱huru ana aza ihogu, baniya cimaringiwa paco na asa Hayahudawa <verse eid="ACT 13:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="ACT 13:47" />zwamu Buca̠ bu yaba bu na pano umurni: &lt;&lt;Nabu tanu haske pa aco na asa hayahudawa, zwamu goo kulagiya goo ceto kurwo ihogu i doone. <verse eid="ACT 13:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="ACT 13:48" />Nga̱ aco na asa Hayahudawa aba huge haruniya, kwa aba na huge wa̱wo kwa na pana cikarigio ci Hwinsu cilabe; hinda ka̱mu ana nupi yayi a̱huru ana aza ihogu aba na yayi ka̱mu. <verse eid="ACT 13:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="ACT 13:49" />cikarigo ci Hwinsu ci isa ka̱mu tuhumba na cinge. <verse eid="ACT 13:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="ACT 13:50" />Ama Hayahudawa kwa na amagane, si'a sina siza iwase Hwinsu ana aba paganu cilabe na cigiya aco na asige rigima zwamu Bulus na Barnaba, kwa aba na acega a curi. <verse eid="ACT 13:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="ACT 13:51" />kwa aba na mabizaga cinge ci hataka haba, zwama shaida wahe, kwa aba na malana na cinge ci ikoniya. <verse eid="ACT 13:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="ACT 13:52" />Silmaji wa̱wo ga hinda a̱huru a burya̠ a yiwa tare naba.<verse eid="ACT 13:52" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="ACT 14" />
  <para style="s">Bulus na Barnaba na ingo ikoniya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 14:1" />Na ikoniya Bulus na Barnabas aba ise na ukaba wa hunda wa Hayahudawa nga̱ aba sabe. Ahwaya aba iyi wa'azi hwa aco na asa Hayahudawa a yaje i ce cikarigo. <verse eid="ACT 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 14:2" />Ama Hayahudawa hana yajuwa kwa aba na zuge aco na asa Hayahudawa kwa aba na hacigaga ana alagano Yesu. <verse eid="ACT 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 14:3" />Kwa Bulus na Barnabas aba na mala na sana dinyiya, aba na numa ko na iwas na koce a Hwinsu, una u iyi shaida u cikarigiwo ci i burya̠ ina cisa ga ia̱go iyi mamaki na iyi mamaki. <verse eid="ACT 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 14:4" />Ama aco i'ogo kwa na ma cabaga cire; rabi na hin goyo wa ha Yahudawa, rabi na hye goya wa baya wa silmajiri si Yesu. <verse eid="ACT 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 14:5" />Kwa aco na asa Hayahudawa, na Hayahudawa tare na aco labe wab, a gamiye sicwa si yagiye silmajiri wulakanci a bwage ga na hatare <verse eid="ACT 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 14:6" />Ama nga̱ Silmajiri siba kwa siba na sume kuro likoniya iugo ya listira na Darbe na ciyabo nab, <verse eid="ACT 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 14:7" />A paiye aba hina na yhe wa'azi wa cikarigiow ci burya̠ .<verse eid="ACT 14:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bulus Banabas a i wa'azi na Listira na Dirbe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 14:8" />Na suwa Listira buciyaye buyiwa busa kuturu Buna busa gurgu tun lakaci na aba maci bua buasi tabuwa jabaga. <verse eid="ACT 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 14:9" />Kwa buba na kubute Bulus uba na hye cikarigiowo. Bulus kwa na bena bua hye buza bangaskiya buba bie henga. <verse eid="ACT 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 14:10" />kwa na ugana bwa, &lt;&lt;Masinge na buna na buya!&gt;&gt; kwa buco bumiya na masingya na mayhe na hyina ihye cihano. <verse eid="ACT 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 14:11" />kwa aba na tana Barnabas ziya Zuyus, kwa aba na tana Barnabas ziya Hermes. zwama bware bubiya dusa bunumago bwab <verse eid="ACT 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 14:12" />Kwa aba na pan Barnaba iziya Zeyus, Bulus hina aba ogo bo Hermes, zwam bube busa buco bu labe. <verse eid="ACT 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 14:13" />Bulabe bu uya Zeyus wa hude aba u yiwaa na kacuta ka i'ogo, kwa na kuliya ina na fulawa u gama na i'iba i'ogo zwama aco ka̠ri i hyanga Bulus sadaka.<verse eid="ACT 14:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 14:14" />Ama nga̱ silmajiri si Yesu Bulus na Barnaba aba huge haruniya, kwa aba na haji cilapo ciba kwa na kure pa aco na mabuna, aba na sangana ci ugo: <verse eid="ACT 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 14:15" />&lt;&lt;Aco, gacima cisa wuma nga̱ ga̠hi aco hinda. cikulaga cikarigio ci burya̠ , i curi muzwa mu doone imaringiya pa Hwinsu, una u ia̠gi zaro na cinge na suwa u uwo na tagha na yiwa nuba. <verse eid="ACT 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 14:16" />Na lokaci ana a ali, u juriny kama aco laga ha yina hana haba ka̠ri. <verse eid="ACT 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 14:17" />Ka̱mu na harbiniya wasi tabuwa &lt;&lt;cure i cuwiba na nagu u shaida; ucibiya i burya̠ na pagano Silla̱ zata na zaro ampani eta na lokaci waba; ucipa mare dinyiya usinji soo nuhi na wa̱wo&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 14:18" />Ka̱mu na cikarigio cab, a ponuwa igasgana aco na pana sadaka weba.<verse eid="ACT 14:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 14:19" />Amma acigiya Hayahudawa han ha sirya Antakiya na Ikoniya abiya a rinjaye aco. Aba bwage Bulus na hatare kwa na Silacuma na Japot ia̱go, a ugana bware bu koju. <verse eid="ACT 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 14:20" />Ama Nga̱ silmajiri siba ringa bware, kwa bware na masinge na maringe na i i'ogo. Nga̱ ubungwa wuba wa bunge Bulus na Barnaba kwa na ala Darde.<verse eid="ACT 14:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Uringuwa u Bulus na Barnabas Antakiya na Suriya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 14:21" />Bulus na Barnaba Ayi wa'azi wa cikarigio ci laco na suwa wi i'ogo a hye aco na yeje dinyiya. kwa aba na maringa na Listira,na Ikoniya, na Antakiya kuro wa Bisidiya. <verse eid="ACT 14:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 14:22" />Aba na karpaa Silmajiri a yisa na koce na tano soo waba i kamahinda. &lt;&lt;Dolegacu ise iru wahaloli na zwama soo cigwama ci Hwinsu&gt;&gt; aba hin. <verse eid="ACT 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 14:23" />Bulus na Barnaba kwa na zabega a'unga labe na tunba aco na lagano, Na hunda na azumi, a tane ga pa bugwama bu doone, buna aba tane iyajo puba. <verse eid="ACT 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 14:24" />Nga̱ aba na lagano na cinge ci Bisidiya kurwo Famfiliya. <verse eid="ACT 14:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 14:25" />Nga̱ aba i numa a Hwinsu na perga, kwa aba na alah kurwo Ataliya. <verse eid="ACT 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 14:26" />Daga-na Ataliya kwa aba na alah kura Antakiya, a payiye aba egiga a hunda zwama i burya̠ i Hwinsu a kubtaga na ibwana ina aba hogi. <verse eid="ACT 14:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 14:27" />Nga̱ aba wuci, kwa aba na tanagana alagano ihuga uika̱ a pa labari ina Hwinsu uba hin nga̱ uba gunja i'iba pa aco na asa Hayahudawa <verse eid="ACT 14:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 14:28" />Aba kwa na sana dinyiya tare na Silmajiri.<verse eid="ACT 14:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="ACT 15" />
  <para style="s">Taro aco na lagano na Urshalima.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 15:1" />Cagiya aco na kure usala wa Hayahudiya na Antakiya aba na cibaga alagano ahwaya: &lt;&lt;Kwa a ia̱gi kaciya, nga̱ al'ada uba cicibe na suwa cikarigiwo ci Musa, iza ihye ceto <verse eid="ACT 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 15:2" />Bulus na Barnaba a iyi mahawara na aco niya dinyiya. kwa aba na naji Bulus na Barnaba na cagiya alagano a kure Urshalima, zwamu a kure bangi silmajiri na unga-labe. zwama beni cikarigiwo ciniya. <verse eid="ACT 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 15:3" />aco na a lagano kwa na sibkega, kwa aba na lagano na cinge ci finikiya na Samariya, aba na pana labari nga̱ aco na asa Hayahudawa aba ce cikarigiwo. cini cisa alagano Yesu a huge wa̱wo dinya <verse eid="ACT 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 15:4" />Nga̱ aba a wuce Urshalima, kwa kamu alaganu na caga na wa̱wo na unga na silmajiri, kwa Bulus na Barnaba na pana labari ina pare kamu wato ina Hwinsu uba iyi na siwa saba. <verse eid="ACT 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 15:5" />Hinda acagiya alagano ana sa kungiya Hayahudawa kwa na masigiya na hin, &lt;&lt;Kwa a ia̱gya aco na asa Hayahudawa kaciya hinda dole alagano icibago ya Musa&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 15:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 15:6" />Silmajiri na a'unga a madaliye a byani cikarigiwo cina aba a kuliya zwama aco na ai sa Hayahudawa. <verse eid="ACT 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 15:7" />Nga̱ aba hogi cikarigo dinyiya, Bitrus kwa na masinga na ia̱go aco cikarigiwo: Ahun na muye, idaki tun na jigo Hwinsu una tanga gye ciki nahiya gyamuyi na ia̱gya ana a sa Hayahudawa cikarigiwo ci Hwinsu na una numuya a huge hinda a tani soo. <verse eid="ACT 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 15:8" />Hwinsu una u daki suwa, u cibiya u cyaga na panu ga a̱huru a burya̠, kyabo nga̱ uba cipa ga̱ci. <verse eid="ACT 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 15:9" />Hinda wa cibiwa banbanci na buna busa Buyahude na buna bwasa u yahudawa, zwama kimmaga suwa wab-na yajo. <verse eid="ACT 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 15:10" />Zwamu harbuniya, igyasa ga̱hi kari gwaji Hwinsu na pana silmajiri ugun guri na bicora bebba, ko hacaca a haci a ponuwa zangi? <verse eid="ACT 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 15:11" />Aye! Ga̱ci ma ce je na soo a burya̱ a Buca̱ bu yaba Yesu gaci hyan icagagu, nga̱ aba ma aba hye&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 15:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 15:12" />Kwa aco na matanaga ka̱mu na kubula nga̱ Barnaba na Bulus na Zwamma ganaga ina mamaki pari nab Hwinsu uba yi pa aco ana asa hayahudawa. <verse eid="ACT 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 15:13" />Nga̱ aba hogi cikarigo, kwa Yakub na cane: &lt;&lt;Ahun namui, &lt;&lt;O'tanaje i huge ahun aco cu'a na aco cware! <verse eid="ACT 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 15:14" />Saminu a cizwama nga̱ Hwinsu uba iyi i mamaki na ciba maka̠la̠ moba pa aco ana asa Hayahudawa u zangiya ico Yakub. <verse eid="ACT 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 15:15" />Cikarigo ci acubago daida na ina, nga̱ aba rubuci:<verse eid="ACT 15:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 15:16" />&lt;&lt;Baya harbuniya na maringiya</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 15:16">gya gufai ima yaba i Dauda na mahusi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 15:16">Ima huzi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 15:16">na goo ima,<verse eid="ACT 15:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 15:17" />Zwama aco na gane aba iginbag a Bugwama bu dunyiya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 15:17">na ka̱mu ana asa Hayahudawa ana gya na taganuwa ga asa na nuya.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 15:17">inji Bugwama Hwinsu bube bwa zwamage ciniya.<verse eid="ACT 15:17" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 15:18" />Uba hye tun na zamani ana a ali.<verse eid="ACT 15:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 15:19" />Zwamu harbuniya, hukunci asa numuya, ta cisana aco na asa Hayahudawa hana ha ciye Hwinsu ha huge wahala. <verse eid="ACT 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 15:20" />Kwadiya ci rubuci ga wasika, ci zwama ga ata kule a re mare ma ciri mana aba kulagiya ha gumakar ata ia̱ga lalata na si'ah, ata re munigwa muna aba wakuriya bicorwo na munigwa na mahei. <verse eid="ACT 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 15:21" />Zwamu Musa u iyi wa'azi na suwa timba iugo na zamani ana a ali hinda a karanci na suwa wa hakaba ha hunda Hwinsu wa sabar.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 15:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Silmajiri naunga labe pa aco na ai sa hayahudawa wasika</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 15:22" />kwa silmajiri na unga, ka̱mu na alagano, a hin u gyamace a tanga cagiya aco aba cumaga Kurwo Antakiya tare na Bulus na Barnaba. A tanga aco barya̱ ana aba yaje naba Yahuda, (ana aba ugo Barsaba) na Sila, <verse eid="ACT 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 15:23" />naba aba cuma ga na wasika: silmajiri na unga labe, Buhun abuhiya, alagano ana asa Hayahudawa. ana ayuwa na Antakiya, suriya na kilikiya: Ubungwa. <verse eid="ACT 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 15:24" />Ci huge labari cagiya aco ciki nuhi asire na japo sa na izin nuci, na hisiga cagiya aco hasoo na ina aba yiwa na kargyaga. <verse eid="ACT 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 15:25" />Zwamu harbuniya ci yaje ka̱mu nuci ci zabe aco gaci cumagi na a'usa na ga̱ci ka̠ri asici Barnaba na Bulus <verse eid="ACT 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 15:26" />Aco na pa a̱huru waba zwam iziye Yesu kristi Bugwama bu doone <verse eid="ACT 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 15:27" />Zwam harbuniya ci cuman Yahuda na Sila zwam a tabaci ga na cikarigo ci uno cina ci ga̱ci rubuci. <verse eid="ACT 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 15:28" />U ia̱gi Ahuru A burya̠ gama na gaci hinda ga̱ci ma tana mure zwama hin. <verse eid="ACT 15:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 15:29" />zwamu harbuniya i kula na mare mana aba panga sirye, na re nama ina iza mahya, hinda itas matana na lalata si ya heguwa zwamunya i'iyuwo ina Hwinsu uba gimbago i iwo na burya̠ duniya <verse eid="ACT 15:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 15:30" />kwa aba nai cumana aco na aba tamga kuwra Antakiya, kwa aba naa tanagana alagano kwa na panaga uwasika, <verse eid="ACT 15:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 15:31" />Nga̱ aco aba karanci wasika uni kwa aba na huge laco zwamu karfafana aba he na suwa wasika. <verse eid="ACT 15:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 15:32" />Yahuda na Silas, zwama aba ma asa acubago, kwa na ege alagano gargadi na cikarigiwo cilaco. <verse eid="ACT 15:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 15:33" />Nga̱ aba i muhon tare nab, kwa aba na sibkaga na itanu unu u burya̠ kwa na maringiya pa aco na a cumaga pa alagano Yesu. <verse eid="ACT 15:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 15:34" />Ama Silas a hya u i gama bware bu madalata cimu bu i muho tare naba. <verse eid="ACT 15:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 15:35" />Amma Bulus na Barnaba a iyi muho na Antakiya, Ihugana aba cibage na iyuwo wa'azi wa cikarigiwo ci bugwama bu duniya. Bulus na Barnaba taga bu kunbe yina buba.<verse eid="ACT 15:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 15:36" />Nga̱ muhu muba ali cimu kwa Bulus na hin na Barnaba, &lt;&lt;Ci maringe ci byani ahun cware na ahu a cu'a na tiyamba i'ogo ina gaci zwamagi cikarigo ci Hwinsu ci kure ci hyan nga̱ aba yiwa na jabaga.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 15:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 15:37" />Barnaba ukarisi zangi Yohana una aba ugo Markus, tare na bware, <verse eid="ACT 15:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 15:38" />Amma Bulus wa iyuwo tunane na burya̠ ukare na bware, zwamu bware buta curiga na cigeci famfiliya. bware hinda muwuje hin ibuna tare raba. <verse eid="ACT 15:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 15:39" />Kwa nagu wai madaka ne isi tsakani waba. mahandagage taga bu laga yina ububa. Barnaba uzangi Markus, Silas a kure na Sayifurus <verse eid="ACT 15:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 15:40" />Ama Bulus a zangi Silas kwa na malana, nga̱ alagano aba gamiga pa i burya̠ a Buca̠ bu yaba. <verse eid="ACT 15:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 15:41" />Bware bu laga usala u suriya na kilikiya aba na karfafa ka̱mu alagano.<verse eid="ACT 15:41" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="ACT 16" />
  <para style="s">Timoti a laga Bulus ni sila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 16:1" />Kwa Bulus ni kure pa Dabai Listira, i hugu ina almajiri aba igagu Timoti aba yiwa ni dala, buna amaci abuba isa Bayahudiya bulaga, ama buco bu bware busa bahelane. <verse eid="ACT 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 16:2" />Ka̱mu alagano yiwa ni i'ogo ina aba uga ikoniya ayiwa ni ia̱g cikarigo ci Timoti ci bware. <verse eid="ACT 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 16:3" />Bulus u gimbag si kure tare ni Timoti, kwa aba ni ia̱gya bware kaciya zwama Hayahudawa hana ha madaliye ni ihugu niya, zwama adaki ka̱mu buca bu bware busa Bahilane. <verse eid="ACT 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 16:4" />Nga̱ aba hina cihano ni i'ogo ni kurwa icyage na i'ogo, kwa aba ni cuba cikarigo cina ci silmajiri, a'ongo ni suwa Urshalima zwama aco aba laga. <verse eid="ACT 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 16:5" />Harbuni aco ni lagan Yesu ajidani ni tani isuwa tun nuhun a hina ni majidani i musan dinyiya.<verse eid="ACT 16:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bulus a hya cicuma ci Mackidoniya ni halabuwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 16:6" />Bulus ni siboki si cihana ci bware a ange ni mu'ogo mu Pirijiya na Galantiya, Ahuru a Hwinsu A gazgaga iyi cikarigo usala u asiya. <verse eid="ACT 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 16:7" />Nga̱ aba a wuci gagi Misiya, a iyi kokari a ise Betaniya, ama Ahuru a Yesu aza yaje ni haruniya. <verse eid="ACT 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 16:8" />Kwa aba ni lagan Misiya ikanzigu i'ogo i Toruwas. <verse eid="ACT 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 16:9" />Ni gita kwa Bulus ni hyan bucyahya ni halabuwa kwa ni hya bucyahya ni Makidokiya kwa bu isa ni rokuga, &lt;&lt;Kurojya apiya pa Makidoniya ci temaki.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 16:10" />Nga̱ Bulus aba hyan cicuma ni halabuwa, ci ma shiriji kurwo ni Makidoniya, a hyen Hwinsu u uganga a kure iyi cikarigo ci Hwinsu.<verse eid="ACT 16:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ilidiya i yaji ni Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 16:11" />Daga Toruwas ci hina cihana ni suwo uwo cali sambai kurwo Samotiras, nga̱ bungo uba wa bunge kurwa Matonis. <verse eid="ACT 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 16:12" />Hunni ga̱ci ni ala pa Pilipi, pa Roman kolonni ini i yiwa karkashi a Makidoniya. kwa ga̱cu ni yisana ni iyi muhun cimu. <verse eid="ACT 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 16:13" />ni hwinsu u asabar kwa gacu ni sire ni japu i'ogo ni i'iba i jaba, hugani ga̱ci tan tsamani ci hyan ihuga ahunda̱. Ci madaliye kwa ga̱cu ni hinan i ia̱g cikarigo ni sa'a sina si matanaga pa gaci yiwa. <verse eid="ACT 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 16:14" />Ciki aco ni a kumbule bu'a hyi bu yiwa buna aba ugo lidiya, sana 'a iba i sangu i halapo ni suwa i'ogo Tayatira, iba ma isa bulaganu bu Hwinsu. Hwinsu kwa ni gunja isuwa iba kwa iba ni cya cikarigo ci Bulus. <verse eid="ACT 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 16:15" />A ia̱gya iya Baptisma tare ni aco yaba yab, ici ugan ni yaba &lt;&lt;Si i yaji ni gya nisa Bugwama bu doone,&gt;&gt; iba hin, &lt;&lt;Kuroji madale ni yaba nimu.&gt;&gt; ici lalabi kwa ga̱cu ni yaji.<verse eid="ACT 16:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bulus ni Sila ni suwa yaba ci'incu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 16:16" />Gacu ni cuhana kurwa ihuga i ahunda, kwa gacu ni magami ni ikangaza i hyan isa igyam iza mupyala hya mui i zamanu ina i pala. isi hyan musare dinyiya pa buca bu yaba buba zwama ci byanu. <verse eid="ACT 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 16:17" />Ikangaza i hina ni lagan Bulus ni gaci, ni sangana ci'ugo, &lt;&lt;Aco na asa agyama Hwinsu Labe, Ana ayiwa ni zwamgan yina u ceto.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 16:18" />Idengi izwamag tunnuhun. kwa Bulus ni dabi suwa bware bu byani kacutu kwa ni hin ni mupyala mu cibyanu, &lt;&lt;Ni ize Yesu kristi ni hyen ni goo sirya curi iya!&gt;&gt; take kwa mupala ni curya iyan. <verse eid="ACT 16:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 16:19" />Inga buna bu huzi bugyama bu ikangaza bu daki ihuga i huni musare i alu, kwa aba ni kumbe Bulus ni Silas kuruwa uhuga i kasuwa zwama abangi mugwamgwam. <verse eid="ACT 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 16:20" />A kulega pa silkali kwa ni hin, &lt;&lt;Aco na asa Hayahudawa, asa i'ogo tashi u hankali <verse eid="ACT 16:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 16:21" />Acibago ini ya iyiwo daida ni cigwam ci Roma a yage ko a egi.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 16:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 16:22" />Kwa aco ni tani wa a yajuwa ni cikarigo ci Bulus ni Silas kwa silkali ni gunji hukunci a parega a egya ga bulala. <verse eid="ACT 16:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 16:23" />Inga aba hugi ega bulala dinyiya, kwa aba ni kwamaniga ni suwa yaba ci'incu, kwa aba ni hya ni aco ape yaba u ci'incu a apaga ni burya̠ . <verse eid="ACT 16:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 16:24" />Iga aba ciye uni umurni, aba ni taniga ni suwa ukaba u ci'incu kwa ni palaga buna yaba ni mari. <verse eid="ACT 16:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 16:25" />Ni gita ni usa Bulus ni Silas aba ni ahunda ni zubi hazuga kuro pa Hwinsu cyagi aco ni yiwa ni suwa yaba ci'incu a saple hazugahaba. <verse eid="ACT 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 16:26" />Take kwa cinge ni hinana nimajumag hal ima i yaba ci'incu i hina ni majunguta. take kwa mu'iba mu yaba ci'incu ni ma gunja, hinda kamu aco ni yiwa ni suwa marimari waba kwa ni mapasingya. <verse eid="ACT 16:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 16:27" />buco bu labe bu ape yaba u ci'incu kwa ni masiga, nga̱ buba hya mu'iba mu yaba u ci'incu mu gunje, kwa ni numka kashekari mu ka̠ri huni icu buba bu ugana aco ni yaba u ci'incu a swami. <verse eid="ACT 16:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 16:28" />kwa abu ni sumi san ciogo, &lt;&lt;Ta cuma ico nibo! ka̠mu nici ciyiwa!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 16:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 16:29" />Kwa buco bu a̠pe ni cuman ula zwama haske, kwa ni ise ni munda kwa ni kuzacya Bulus ni Silas. <verse eid="ACT 16:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 16:30" />Buba kwa ni silacumega kwa ni kaban, &lt;&lt;Alabe, ibiya gya ni ia̱g hyin ceto?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 16:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 16:31" />Kwa aba ni cyani bware, &lt;&lt;Yada ni bugwama bu duniya Yesu, bui hyan icyagu, ni aco yaba nibui.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 16:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 16:32" />Kwa aba ni zwamaniga cikarigo ci Hwinsu ka̠mu ni aco yaba buba. <verse eid="ACT 16:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 16:33" />Ni awa ani ni gita bu ape bu yaba u ci'incu bu zangi ga kwa ni guzaguga hahuga; take bware ni yaba bwaba kwa ni ia̱gyaga baptisma. <verse eid="ACT 16:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 16:34" />Buco bu ape i yaba u ci'incu kwa ni kulega ni yaba buba kwa ni kulage ga mare ma cire; wa̱wo kwa ni sinji bware zwama bware bu yaji ni Hwinsu-bware ni yaba bware ka̠mu. <verse eid="ACT 16:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 16:35" />Inga bungwa ubu wa bungi, silkali kwa ni cuma aco a̠pe i yaba u ci'incu: &lt;&lt;Curya aco ce.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 16:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 16:36" />Buco bu ape i yaba ciincu bu zwama bulus &lt;&lt;Silkali a hyan Bulus ni Silas ai curi alaji lafiya.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 16:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 16:37" />Ama Bulus u hya na buco bu a̠pe yaba u ci'incu: &lt;&lt;Aci ia̱ga bulala pa aco ko ni sheri'a, Gaci cisa aco cinge ci Roma hinda ci tane ni yaba u ci'incu. baniya gimbagu ni cisilacuma ko ni buna bu daki? Aye! Aba a kurya ni eco yaba asilacumi.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 16:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 16:38" />Buco bu ape i yaba u ci'incu akure bu zwama silkali, nga̱ silkali siba huge Bulus ni Silas asa aco cinge ci Roma kwa aba ni hugi iwasa. <verse eid="ACT 16:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 16:39" />A kure kwa ni rokoga hinda kwa ni sibkaga siro yaba u ci'incu, akaba ga acuri i'ogo. <verse eid="ACT 16:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 16:40" />Nga̱ Bulus ni Silas aba a sirya yaba u ci'incu, kwa aba ni kure yaba Lidiya, apaya̱ aba bangi alagano kwa aba ni hin naba a yisa na koce. Kwa aba ni mawalana.<verse eid="ACT 16:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="ACT 17" />
  <para style="s">A iyi tashin hankali ni Tasalonika</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 17:1" />Nga̱ Bulus ni Silas aba laga Abipolis na Afolloniya, aba wuci Tasalonika, ihuga ina yaba ahunda̱ i Hayahudawa I hayahudawa iba yiwa. <verse eid="ACT 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 17:2" />Nga̱ bware buba ia̱gu Bulus u ise ni suwa wai yaba ahunda̠ i Hayahudawa, asabar ataco a uhunpacu bware ni ta̱gu mahawara ni suwa cikarigo ci Musa, <verse eid="ACT 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 17:3" />bware ni ia̱gya ga bayani adaki ni Kristi kwa aso wahala bu masinge su bu kwaji. &lt;&lt;Ani Yesu ana a gya ni ia̱gya ni cikarigo bware bi busa Kristi,&gt;&gt; bware bu hin. <verse eid="ACT 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 17:4" />Ha cyage Hayahudawa ha yaji a laga Bulus ni Silas, Aco dinya ana azi wasa i Hwinsu Heliniyawa sa'a dinya aba gami sa aco ni Silas. <verse eid="ACT 17:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 17:5" />Ama Hayahudawa a hugi isigu; kwa aba ni tanagan aco ni za hankali ni kasuwa, kwa aba ni kirkiri cubya kwa ni yasinga hankali wa aco wui i'ogo. Kwa aba ni ya̱mani mun da kurwa yaba i Yason aba ni gimbo u Bulus ni Silas zwama si lacumagya aco. <verse eid="ACT 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 17:6" />Ama nga̱ aba hyanuwo Bulus na Sila, Kwa aba ni silacumi Yason ni cyage alagano ni gaba a mugwam gwam, aba ni sangan ci'ogo: &lt;&lt;Aco nibwe kuliya tashin hankali ni doone ka̱mu hinda a kurwa pini, <verse eid="ACT 17:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 17:7" />Ama Yesu acega ni yaba. Kamu ahina ni cwa Yason dokoki u bware, a hina bucyage bugwama bu yiwa, buna aba ugo Yesu.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 17:8" />Nga̱ aba hugi cini cikarigo, aco i'ogo ni mugwamgwam kwa aba ni hugi sunguro dinyiya. <verse eid="ACT 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 17:9" />A san Yason ni cage lagan kwa nga̱ aba cya musare mu belin.<verse eid="ACT 17:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bulus ni Silas ni Beriya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 17:10" />Nga̱ gita aba a ia̱g, alagano kwa aba ni cuman Bulus ni Silas kurwo u Biriya nga̱ aba wuci beriya, kwa aba ni kure muginga pa Hayahudawa. <verse eid="ACT 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 17:11" />Baniyan Hayahudawa hana hayiwa haza hali a burya̠ a zake ana a Tasalonika, zwama ace cikarigo ni wa̱wo dinya si byangan cikarigon ci Hwinsu tun na hun a hyan ina Bulus uba hyin naba ko usi kamahinda. <verse eid="ACT 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 17:12" />Hayahudawa dinyiya ha ciye cikarigo ci Hwinsu ka̱mu ni si cyage sa'a si Helinawa sina sizi masayi ni aco cware dinyiya a yage. <verse eid="ACT 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 17:13" />Nga̱ Hayahudawa a yiwa ni Tasalonika aba hugi ana Bulus i yiwa ni ia̱gu wa'azi u cikarigo ci Hwinsu ni Biriya, aba ma kwa ni kure, ni yasinga hanka yaco zwama iyi tawaye. <verse eid="ACT 17:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 17:14" />Take kwa alagano ni silacuma Bulus kurwa ugagi uwo, ama Silas ni Timtawus a madaliya ni Beriya. <verse eid="ACT 17:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 17:15" />Aco ni sibke Bulus a kule bware hal kurwa Atina kwa Bulus ni cumaniga pa Silas ni Timtawus abangya bware pa bware buba yiwa.<verse eid="ACT 17:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bulus ni suwa Atina</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 17:16" />Nga̱ Bulus uba ni ape waba ni i'ogo i Atina, bware bu hugi sugoro dinyiya zwama bware bu hyan i'ogo sinji ni a'uyo. <verse eid="ACT 17:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 17:17" />Zwama harbuniya bware si iyi cikarigo ni Hayahudawa ni suwa wui muginga na Hahelinawa hana azi wasa i Hwinsu ni suwa wui kasuwa hinda tunnahun pa aco ni bware si bangi. <verse eid="ACT 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 17:18" />Harbuni Abikuriyawa ni Sadokiyawa ana aza ilimi a iyi mahawara ni bware. a cage kaba̠ bware, &lt;&lt;Surutu u biya bucu bu surutu nu bwe bu zwamago?&gt;&gt; A cage kaba, &lt;&lt;Kila bware wa'azi a'uyi ana asa anyagata.&gt;&gt; azwami haruni zwama Bulus wa yiwa ni ia̱gu wa; azi cikarigo ci laco cina ci Yesu ni wasingo u bware u uwo. <verse eid="ACT 17:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 17:19" />Azangi bware kwa ni kula bware ni tudun Arasa, ihuga ina aba hin ni bware, &lt;&lt;Bui ci zwamana ini icibago ipu ina goo buci kulagiya? <verse eid="ACT 17:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 17:20" />Buci kulage cikarigo cipu ni hacwabe ahacu, ci gimbagu ci dakya ma'ana ma cibo.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 17:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 17:21" />(Ka̱mu Atinawa ni hanyagata hana hayiwa ni dalo si kure amadale a ia̱guwo ihya kwa cikarigo hinda ni ikubulagu cikarigo cipu.) <verse eid="ACT 17:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 17:22" />Kwa Bulus ni masinga ni usa Arisiyawa kwa ni hyan: &lt;&lt;Ga̱hi Atinawa! Ni hyan isa aco iyiwa na pan hacyagiya ha Hwinsu cilabe. <verse eid="ACT 17:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 17:23" />Nga̱ gya niyiwa ni cihano ni byani ni burya̠ ni hyan nga̱ ga̱hi i ia̱gu ahunda̠ hal na bangi ihuga ipanganu sadaka una aba iyi rubutu: HWINSU UNA ABA A DAKUWO. Baniya ina ga̱hi si iyi ahunda̠ ina ga̱hi ya dakuwo ibe gya ni ka̱ri na zwama.<verse eid="ACT 17:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 17:24" />&lt;&lt;Hwinsu una u iyi doone ni iyi ni yiwa ni suwa ube usa bugwama bu zaro ni cinge wa madalagwa ni yaba ahunda i Hayahudawa muna aba ima ni wa. <verse eid="ACT 17:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 17:25" />Hinda Hwinsu karuwo taimako ni siwa, nga̱ si ka̱ri ihya zwama uba ni eco i buba si pa aco ka̱mu ana zi muhunju ni tiyigya ka̱mu. <verse eid="ACT 17:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 17:26" />Pa buco buika uba iyi aco ka̱mu, zwama aba madale asinji cinge ka̱mu; hinda u iri tigamba lokaci abuba hinda bu pa tigamba hugo ini uba bwa madala. <verse eid="ACT 17:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 17:27" />Hwinsu u iyi haruna zwama aco ka̱mu bu ginbage ga ko i eg lalube a hin uwa, ko nga̱ bwa mirinwa pa tigamba. <verse eid="ACT 17:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 17:28" />&lt;Pa bware ga̱cu yiwa ci iyi cihana ci hin i wa.&gt; Nga̱ cage aco na hin na egu hazuga aba hin, &lt;Ga̱ci cisa biro bware.&gt; <verse eid="ACT 17:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 17:29" />&lt;&lt;Zwama harbuniya ga̱cu siwa bware Hwinsu, ta ci ia̱gu tsammani Hwinsu nya̱ga ni ga̱cu ko i zinariya ko azurfa ko tare-ko ina ga̱cu sabe ni wa ni mahasa na maba. <verse eid="ACT 17:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 17:30" />Ni jigu Hwinsu iyi nga̱ wa hyanuwo ni ia̱gu eewo nuci zwama nagu cidaku, ama baniya u zwama aco ka̱mu a curi eewo yaba. <verse eid="ACT 17:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 17:31" />Zwama u iri Hwinsu uba ui ia̱gya doone hukunci una u gaskiya pa buco buna buba zabi. Hwinsu u pa tabaci aciniyi pa aco ka̱mu ni yasiguwo buco bu ciye pa aco kwadagu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 17:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 17:32" />Nga̱ aba hugi zwama wasungo aco na a kwadaga, cyagiya aco ia̠gi bware alala cyage aco hyan, &lt;&lt;Ci gimbagu huge cikarigo acibu cina goo buyiwa ni kargyaga hon menwa.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 17:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 17:33" />Ni lokaci bani, Bulus kwa ni curo mugwamgwam. <verse eid="ACT 17:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 17:34" />Aco cimu a sani lagan Bulus ni ina yaji. Ciki waba aza Diyonisiyus, bware busa ciki a mugwamgwam, hinda ni bu'a buna aba ugo Damaris, na cyage aco dinyiya.<verse eid="ACT 17:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="ACT 18" />
  <para style="s">Bulus u i wa'azi na Korinti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 18:1" />Bayan uharuni, Bulus u curi Atina u ali Korintus <verse eid="ACT 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 18:2" />Ahwaya bware buba bangi Akila busa Bayahude, i'ogo i buba Pantus, buna bwa sanuwo ni giwo na bua buba Biriskila a yase ni italiya, zwama Kaladiyos apa doka kamu Hayahudawa a curi cinge ci Roma. Kwa Bulus ni kuri hugu yaba, <verse eid="ACT 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 18:3" />zwama azi sana'a iri inka bware bu isa pa ba a egi ibwana tare. <verse eid="ACT 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 18:4" />Tun hunba asabar Bulus si iyi mahawara ni suwa muginga, zwama bware bu gimbo Hayahudawa na ana asa Hayahudawa ace cikarigo ci burya̠ . <verse eid="ACT 18:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 18:5" />Lokaci ana Silas ni Timtawus aba a kure daga makidonuya, Bulus u pa lokaci abuba ni i ia̱gu i wa'azi, ni zwamgana Hayahudawa ana Yesu abiya asa Kristi. <verse eid="ACT 18:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 18:6" />Ama Hayahudawa ha egi bware masasa, kwa Bulus ni bibiza cilapo ci bware kwa ni hin naba, &lt;&lt;Mahya amahi ma yinsa ni sicwa asihi daga baniya ni mawalan kuri pa aconi sa Hayahudawa. <verse eid="ACT 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 18:7" />Kwa Bulus ni curya yaba ahunda i Hayahudawa kwa ni kuri ni i'iba i yaba i Titiyus yastu, bulagana bu Hwinsu. <verse eid="ACT 18:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 18:8" />Kwa Kiribus bulabe bu yaba i ahunda̱ a Hayahudawa, kamu ni yaba bware a yaje ni Buca̱ bu yaba Yesu; aco Korintiyawa dinyiya a yaji nga̱ aba hugi a ia̱gu ga baptisma. <verse eid="ACT 18:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 18:9" />Wahya ni gita Buca̱ bu yaba Yesu bu ia̱gi Bulus cikarigo ni Halabuwa: &lt;&lt;Ta huga iwasa; goo ni egu cikarigo, ta uwatana. <verse eid="ACT 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 18:10" />Zwama ni yiwa tare ni goo, ko ni buna bwe gazgana ubu egi ihya, zwama ni aco dinya ni suwa i'ogo.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 18:11" />Kwa Bulus ni madala har shekara inka ni rabi, ni cibagiga cikarigo ci Hwinsu. <verse eid="ACT 18:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 18:12" />Lokaci ana a Galiyo bware ni cigwama Akaya, kwa Hayahudawa ni gama sicwa kwa ni kumbi Bulus kwa ni kuli bware kotu. <verse eid="ACT 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 18:13" />&lt;&lt;Buco buna,&gt;&gt; ci kumbi bware, bware buyiwa sana aco dole a apa Hwinsu cilabe una wa san daidai ni cikarigo c Musa nuci.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 18:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 18:14" />Bulus uyiwa ni shiri u iyi cikarigo, Galiyo i hin ni Hayahudawa, &lt;&lt;Si ga̱hi Hayahudawa i yiwa ni cikarigo ci magwata gimbu ina isa burya̠ na unu u labe uni u gya ni yaji i cya kara nuhi. <verse eid="ACT 18:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 18:15" />Am ng ubasa mahawara u cikarigo ni haze ni dokoki u Musa Salaji mashiri sicwa asihi. Niza isana alkali acina cikarigo.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 18:16" />Kwa bware ni ance shari'a waba. <verse eid="ACT 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 18:17" />Kwa kamu waba ni mabicika pa Sostanus bulabe bu yaba i ahunda̱ a Hayahudawa a emi bware ihuna ni gaba a kotu. Ama Galiyo a iyiwo kula naba.<verse eid="ACT 18:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ibiskila, Akila na Apolos</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 18:18" />Bayan haruni Bulus u iyi muhun ni korinti. kwa bware ni curya ahun kwa bware ni ala kuruwa Siriya, Ibiskila ni Akila asila bware. Kafin aba masinge, bware bu punje icwa ibuba zwama kucuna kuna bware bu ma zangi. <verse eid="ACT 18:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 18:19" />Kwa aba ni wuci Apisa, ahwaya Bulus uba curi Biskila ni Akila. Bware kwa ni ise ni yaba ahunda i Hayahudawa kwa bware ni ia̱gu mahaura ni Hayahudawa. <verse eid="ACT 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 18:20" />Akaba bware bu yisa bu iyi muhun naba, ama bware bwa yajuwa. <verse eid="ACT 18:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 18:21" />Inga bware bu mawalan, bware bu egyaga alkawari, &lt;&lt;Ni maringe si Hwinsu u yaji.&gt;&gt; Kwa bware ni sire Apisa ni mawalan. <verse eid="ACT 18:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 18:22" />Inga bware buba wuci Kaisariya, kwa bware ni kure ni bunga alagano ni suwa u yaba ahunda i Hayahudawa kwa bware ni ala zubu kuruwa Antakiya.<verse eid="ACT 18:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 18:23" />nga̱ bware bu sata cimu ni suwo Antakiya, kwa bware ni masiga ni ala ni ange mu ugo mu galantiya ni pirijiya, bware ni karfafa kamu silmajiri. <verse eid="ACT 18:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 18:24" />Ahwaya Bayahude buna abu ugo Afollos, bu cinge ci Alekzandiriya, bu kurya Apisa. Bware buzi ilimi u cikarigo ci Musa. <verse eid="ACT 18:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 18:25" />Acibagi bware yina u Hwinsu Bugwama bu duniya, bware si iyi cikarigo ci burya̠ hinda bware bu cibage yina u yesu ni burya̠, ama bware bu daki baptisma a Yohana kawai. <verse eid="ACT 18:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 18:26" />bware bu hinani ni ia̱gu wa'azi ni suwa muginga ko ni iwasa. Inga Ibiskila ni Akila aba hugi bware kwa aba ni ugan bware ni yaba kwa ni cibag bware cikarigo ci Hwinsu ni burya̠. <verse eid="ACT 18:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 18:27" />Inga Apolos akari ala cinge ci Akaya kwa alagano ni temak bware kwa alagano ni rubuta silmajiri sina siyiwa Akayas aci bware. Nga̱ bware buba wuci bware bu sas bu banganu ani ca i burya̠ hinda na tano soo. <verse eid="ACT 18:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 18:28" />Zwama bware bu i nasara ni mahawara bware bu iyi ni Hayahudawa ni gaba wu aco, bu tabaciga ni suwa cikarigo ci Hwinsu Yesu abe asi Kristi.<verse eid="ACT 18:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="ACT 19" />
  <para style="s">Bulus ni suwa Apisas</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 19:1" />Lokaci ana a Afollos aba yans ni Korinti, Bulus kwa ni angi cinge ci Apisa, apaya bware bu bangi silmajiri <verse eid="ACT 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 19:2" />bware bu kabaga, &lt;&lt;Icuwa ahuru a burya̠ nga̱ gahi i yaje?&gt;&gt; Kwa aba ni cani bware, &lt;&lt;Aye, cisa tabuwa ihuge ahuru aburya̠ ayiwa.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 19:3" />Kwa bulus ni kaban, &lt;&lt;Cba baptisma gahi ciye?&gt;&gt; &lt;&lt;Baptisma a Yuhana,&gt;&gt; a cyani bware. <verse eid="ACT 19:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 19:4" />Bulus u cyani, &lt;&lt;Baptisma a Yuhana usa u curi u eewo. Bware bu zwama aco a yaj ni buna buyiwa ni kuri buna buyiwa ni kuri ni kacutu ka bware, buna busa Yesu.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 19:5" />Inga aco na yaje aba hugi haruni, a egyaga baptisma ni izi i Bugwama bu duniya Yesu Kristi. <verse eid="ACT 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 19:6" />Inga Bulus bu tani wa hwa aco, ahuru a burya̠ a kure hwab, ahi na egyi cikarigo ni sicyage sare kwa ni hinan eg cikarigo ina i kure pare. <verse eid="ACT 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 19:7" />Aco kupe ni arya abe yans. <verse eid="ACT 19:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 19:8" />Bulus u ise ni yaba ahunda i Hayahudawa u hina ni egi cikarigo ko ni iwasa hal pyana bitaco, bware ni egya mahawara dinyiya zwama cigwama ci Hwinsu. <verse eid="ACT 19:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 19:9" />Ama cyage aco a wanji yaje; hal egi cikarigo ci Hwinsu alala ni gaba wa aco. Kwa Bulus ni curyaga ni mawalan. bware bu aliyitare ni silmaji ni cibagaga tunohun. Ni makaranta ma Tiranus. <verse eid="ACT 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 19:10" />Icibago a egyi hal shekara arya kamu ni Hayahudawa ni ana asa Hayahudawa ani madaliye ni cinge ci Asiya a hugi cikarigo ci bugwama duniya. <verse eid="ACT 19:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 19:11" />Hwinsu u iyi i al'ajabi ni wa u Bulus, <verse eid="ACT 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 19:12" />Aco ma hal na hankici ko cilapo ana aba danga bware si kule pa buco bu mahuna, mahuna si hwengi hinda mupyala mu uwo si sire. <verse eid="ACT 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 19:13" />Ha cyage Hayahudawa a kure aba ni zacyaga mupyala mu uwo a i kokari atani ni ize Yesu Bugwama bu duniya Yesu zata hu aco ni zi mupyala mu wo. Aba si hyin ni izi Yesu, buna Blus uba ia̱gu wa'iz, ni hin ni goo sirya.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 19:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 19:14" />Sawo tandarya si Sikeba Bayahude bulabe bulabe, abiya ayiwa ni egu uni. <verse eid="ACT 19:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 19:15" />Kwa mupyala mu uwo ni cyanega, &lt;&lt;Yesu ni daki, ni daki Bulus hinda, ama guwo busa gamba?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 19:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 19:16" />Buco buna buzi mupyala mu uwo bu ma hien kwa ni sakiga kwa ni huniga kamu.bu iyamagiga ihuna hal iyama munda kuruwa yaba kasudi mahya ni sire ni ikanga yaba. <verse eid="ACT 19:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 19:17" />Ka ac niyiwa ni dala Hayahudawa ni ani asa Hayahudawa ni suwa Apisa, i sinji ni iwasa kamu, ize i Bugwama bu duniya Yesu a hina ni pani uwa cilabe . <verse eid="ACT 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 19:18" />Aco dinyiya ani yaji asire ni pili kwa ni zwamaga eewo yaba. <verse eid="ACT 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 19:19" />Aco dinyiya ini iyiwa ni egu dabo kwa ni tanaganu ha takada haba kwa ni cubi ula ni pili. Inga aba rutagi musuwa mu musare ma hatakada, mu wuci dubu kupe ta. <verse eid="ACT 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 19:20" />Ni harbuni cikarigo ci Bugwama bu duniya si hina ni mose ni koce tuhumba. <verse eid="ACT 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 19:21" />Inga zwama ni kamu uba pari, Bulus kwa ni egu shiri kuro urshalima bware bu laga Makidoniya ni Akaya. &lt;&lt;Inga gya ni wuci hwayi,&gt;&gt; bware bu hyin, &lt;&lt;Ni kuri ogo i Roma hinda&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 19:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 19:22" />bware bu cuma abanganu barya, Timoti ni Erastus, kuruwa makidoniya, bware bu madaliye ni cinge ci Asiya.<verse eid="ACT 19:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tashin hankali ni Episos</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 19:23" />Ni lokaci bini aba iyio tashinhankalki zwama yina uni. <verse eid="ACT 19:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 19:24" />Aza buco buna aba ugo Dimitiriyus bu pyapo bu azupa, busa bu pyape hagunki ana aba ogo Artemis, ibwana iboba si kulagiya bwa musare na aco boba dinya. <verse eid="ACT 19:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 19:25" />Bware bu uganiga ka̱mu, na aco ni ia̱gu ibwana na aco ni si sangagu, kwa bware ni hin: &lt;&lt;Aco, idaki ci hyangu riba dinyiya ni kasuwa akaci. <verse eid="ACT 19:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 19:26" />I hya n hinda i hugi una Bulus usa aco dinyiya ni iogo i Apisa ka̱mu ni i'ogo i Asiya. bware bu hyan ina bnuco buba ia̱gi ni wa yasa hwinsu. <verse eid="ACT 19:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 19:27" />Damuwa u yiwa sa kawai sana'a nacu ci nagi ize nicu i burya̠ , kamu ni yaba ahunda̠ i Hayahudawa i uyi Artemis yi hugi mu'inya, ni uyo eco yaba, ana acoba si pa cilabe ka̱mu ni cinge ci Asiya ni doone, aza jidakana i yaje ni cilabe ci buba.<verse eid="ACT 19:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 19:28" />Nga̱ aba hugi haruni, kwa hasoo hab na hacigag kwa iba hinan ibado: &lt;&lt;Cilabe cisa ci Artemis ana a i'ogo i Apisawa.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 19:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 19:29" />Kwa i'ogo ka̱mu ni yana ni tashin hankali. kwa aco ka̠mu ni nyaman munda kurwo ihuga ina aco a matanaga, Kwa aco ni kumbi Gayus ni Aristarkus, a cihana ci Bulus kuruwa makidoniya. <verse eid="ACT 19:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 19:30" />Bulus u ka̠ri ise pa acona matanaga ama silmajiri si gazga bware. <verse eid="ACT 19:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 19:31" />Hal ni mugwamgwam mu cinge cini, si'usa si Bulus a iyi ci cuma buta isa pa ihuga ina aco a matanaga.<verse eid="ACT 19:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 19:32" />Aco ni matanaga asinji ni rudu: cyage aco ni sangan aco ci ina aba dakuwo a cyage harbuni. Aco dinyiya a dakuwo ina kule ga. <verse eid="ACT 19:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 19:33" />Hayahudawa ha swabke Alekzanda gaba gaba, Ha cyage aco hinda a hina ni sangan ci'ogo. Bware bu iyi alama a uwatanu bu ka̱ri ia̱gya aco bayani. <verse eid="ACT 19:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 19:34" />Inga aba a daki busa Bayahude, kwa aba ni gunja bicwaro kamu hal kuruwa awa arya: &lt;&lt;Cilabe cisa ci Artemis bun cinge ci Apisawa!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 19:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 19:35" />Na ihogu kwa buco bu labe bu i'ogo kwa ni hin ni aco: &lt;&lt;Aco Apisawa, ya dakuwo ka̠mu u doone u daki i ugo i Afisawa ibi si apa si yaba ahunda̠ i Hayahudawa i bulabe bu Artemis ni hoto i buba, una wa hine ni zaro? <verse eid="ACT 19:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 19:36" />Zwama harbuniya, nga̱ uba usa ina ini tabaci, u kamaci ga̱hi uwatan ita ia̱gi hya ni mabuna. <verse eid="ACT 19:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 19:37" />I kule aco ni pini, a iwo ahya u muginga ko hinda a hacigagi muze mu hwinsu. <verse eid="ACT 19:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 19:38" />Sa, harbuni, Dimitiriyus ni a'usa a bware si kasuwa siza damuwa ni bware kotu u gunje hinda aco sharia. siyiwa, a ise kara. <verse eid="ACT 19:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 19:39" />Si izi ihya ina ga̠hi i gimba ina ga̠hi daki i kuliya, i ia̠gu shiri pa aco. <verse eid="ACT 19:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 19:40" />Kamahinda, ciyiwa ni suwa ni damuwa a pwa ni ci uga zwama tashin hankali u nawuya.Zwama harbuni ciza ipwana dalili u tashin hankali una nga̱ dalili uba za.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 19:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 19:41" />Inga bware bu hogi cikarigo cini bware bu saleme ga kamu.<verse eid="ACT 19:41" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="ACT 20" />
  <para style="s">Bulus Koro u makidoniya na Hellas</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 20:1" />Inga rikici uba hogi, Bulus u cuma pa silmajiri, hinda nga̱ buba pan ga koce u shuwa, kwa ni hin nab kwa-lala kwa buba ala Makidoniya. <verse eid="ACT 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 20:2" />Nga̠ bware bu aliyi bu hina ni lagan mu'ogo, ni ia̠gi aco cikarigo ci ijidan aco koce soo, kwa bware kuri Hellas, <verse eid="ACT 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 20:3" />Apayi bwari bu iyi pyana bitaco. Zwama bware buba ni gimba isi jirgi u miya kuro cinge ci Suriya, Kwa bware ni tanganu maringiya yina una u kuri Makidoniya. <verse eid="ACT 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 20:4" />Supata bwa bu Farus bu sil bware kuro Biriya, tare ni Aristarkus na Sakundus ni Tasalonika, Gayus ni Darbe, ni Timoti hinda ni Tikikusni Tarofimus, aco Asiya a sila bware. <verse eid="ACT 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 20:5" />Acona a zwalagi ni ala hinda kwa ni ci apugag ni Toruwas. <verse eid="ACT 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 20:6" />Ama gaci kwa ni ise jirgi u miya ni Pilipi nga̱ gaci hogi lagu u burodi una uza yist, hinda nga̱ muhun muta muba aliyi kwa gaci ni bangi kacagiya akaci ni toruwas, ihugu ini gaci iyi muhun mu tandarya.<verse eid="ACT 20:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">A ansinge Yutikus nga̱ buba kwaji</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 20:7" />Hon u jigo na sati ci korya ka̱mu zwama cire ci burodi. Bulus u i cikarigo na aco, zwama su ubungwa u bonge bu ka̱ri ala, bu hina cikarigo hal na usa u gita. <verse eid="ACT 20:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 20:8" />Haficila ha yanse dinya zata u yaba izaro ihuga ina aba yanse na taro. <verse eid="ACT 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 20:9" />Zata u taga aza bulagasa bu madale iziya i buba Yutikus, malabo kwa na zangace bwa lokaci una u Bulus uba masanga na cikarigo.Inga malabo mab zangaci bwa denya, kwa buba ne henya zata u yaba zaro mataki mataco an tanga bwa kwa bwa kwadwo. <verse eid="ACT 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 20:10" />Kwa Bulus na kanzig, kwa ne kwama icwa yiba pa bulagasa hinda kwa dwukana siwa na ucucu u buba.&lt;&lt;Ita madama,&gt;&gt; bu hin. &lt;&lt;Bui kwadwuwo!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 20:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 20:11" />Kwa bware ne yindana zata u yaba zarokwa na makareya. Kwa bware buba na re gaba ne cikarigo hal ubongwa u bonge, kwa buba na malana. <verse eid="ACT 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 20:12" />Kwa aco ne zangi bulagasa na rai u buba koro u yaba hinda wa̱wo u konbe ga denya.<verse eid="ACT 20:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Usipago u Bulus na onga a Apisus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 20:13" />Kwa gaci ne ala gaba kwa ne ese jirgi u miya kwa ne ala koro Asus, ihug ina gaci zangi Bulus. Bware bu i shiri uni zwama bu ginbage bu jabage na bwana. <verse eid="ACT 20:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 20:14" />Inga bware buba ci bangya na Asus, kwa gaci na zangi bware na jirigi u miya koro Mitilin. <verse eid="ACT 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 20:15" />Inga ubungwa uba bonge kwa gaci na ala na jirigi u miya hinda ibongwa i ubongwa kwa gaci wuci ugagi Kiyos.I nga ubongwa uba bonge ci kace koro u Samos, hinda ubongwa uba na bongya ci wuci Miletus. <verse eid="ACT 20:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 20:16" />Da ma Bulus ui tanuwa shuwa an bware boi lagana Apisa zwama boi kanruwo bu haciga lokaci na Asiya, Bware bu yiwa na mabuna bu kore Urshalima, sa ui ma ia̱ga ma, lokaci u lago u pentikos.<verse eid="ACT 20:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 20:17" />Na Miletus, Bulus uba cuma kure Apisa a oganya bware onga a coci. <verse eid="ACT 20:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 20:18" />Inga aba wuci, kwa bware na hyen nab: &lt;&lt;I daki ka̱mu nga̱ gya na yanse na ganhi, daga hon jigo una gya na ese cinge ci Asiya. <verse eid="ACT 20:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 20:19" />Na laga Hwinsu na shuwa uika na cidaro, kwadi igwaju ina Hayahuda hab na egyi. <verse eid="ACT 20:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 20:20" />I daki ka̱mu na curiwo ne ia̱gya cikarigo cina ci taimako ama na cibago pa aco hinda muyaba. <verse eid="ACT 20:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 20:21" />Na zwama Hayahudawa na aco na ai sa Hayahuwa amaringiya pa Hwinsu a curi eewo hinda a tane shuwa pa Bugwama bu doniya Yesu.<verse eid="ACT 20:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 20:22" />&lt;&lt;Hinda baniya, soo nimui u ni cibe, gya kore Urshalima, hinda na dakuwo ina i ia̱go na gya. <verse eid="ACT 20:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 20:23" />Ina gya na daki tenba e'ogo se hoge na soo nimui isho u ukaba u ci cuna wahala u yiwa na anpe nimui. <verse eid="ACT 20:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 20:24" />Ama na zanguwo icwa nimui ihya, sa kawai na hogo munda hinda tata ibwana ina i Bugwama bu duniya Yesu iba na pan-ibwana i izwamago i cikarigo ci Hwinsu na i burya̠ uba.<verse eid="ACT 20:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 20:25" />&lt;&lt;Baniya ni daki an ka̱mu nuhin iza na hyanakana ganhi buna ga̠ci hina ne ange ne zwamag cikarigo ci cigwama ci Hwinsu. <verse eid="ACT 20:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 20:26" />Zwama haruni, ne zwama nawuya na dakuwo ehya hinda ka̱mu nuhin naza alhaki ko buco buika. <verse eid="ACT 20:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 20:27" />Zwama na zwama ka̱mu ina Hwinsu uba ginbo na ga̠hi. <verse eid="ACT 20:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 20:28" />Eago hankali na sicwa a sihin hinda hatami hana ha Ahunru a burya̠ aba ai pan a̠pe. Huban hatami ha Hwinsu, han iba sa na mahya maiba. <verse eid="ACT 20:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 20:29" />Na daki ka̱mu si na ali, mukarkyas mu mogota mui korya a̠hwahin hinda muza icurya hatamiyo. <verse eid="ACT 20:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 20:30" />Hal ma na suwa nuhin ai hya aco na ai masinge ai egyi cibya zwama a kaji aco na yiwa na lagana Yesu koro pa ba. <verse eid="ACT 20:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 20:31" />Zwama haruni ma dale jo na shiri!Si mabutaryage haya hataco tohonba hwinsu na gitane curiwo na ia̱gya gargadi hal ma na maisa.<verse eid="ACT 20:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 20:32" />&lt;&lt;Baniya na cuta sicwa sihin pa Hwinsu hinda pa yama na cikarigo ciba uba, cina ci kimuga ga hinda ci pa ga gado pa ka̱mu aco na aba sana na nagu ciri. <verse eid="ACT 20:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 20:33" />Na tano suwa pa musare mu bucahya ko zinariya ko hanzoga. <verse eid="ACT 20:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 20:34" />Goo bucuma bu Hwinsu hi ka̱mu i daki nima ryagyacuma na siwa a simui ka̱mu ma na aco na ayiwa tare ni gya. <verse eid="ACT 20:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 20:35" />Na ena gya na e ka̱mu, na zwama an dole ci e ibwana zwama ci taimaki aco na za koce, cima butaryage na cikarigo cina Bugwama bu duniya Yesu iba zwamage: &lt;U zake gama buco bu pan na an pan bwa.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 20:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 20:36" />Inga bware buba hogi izwamag kwa buba na kuzat na ia̱go anhunda. <verse eid="ACT 20:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 20:37" />Kanmu waba a rungumi bware na cidaro na haisa hab. <verse eid="ACT 20:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 20:38" />Ina dame ga cikarigo cina bware buba zwama ga an za hyana kana bware hinda. Kwa aba na silan bware koro pa jirigi u miya.<verse eid="ACT 20:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="ACT 21" />
  <para style="s">Cihano ci Bulus kurwo Urshalima</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 21:1" />Nga̱ gaci cima rebi naba, kwa ga̱ci ne ise jirigi kurwo u kos. Nga̱ ubongwa uba u bonge kwa gaci ala kurwo Rodes daga pani kwa gaci ni alah Fatara. <verse eid="ACT 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 21:2" />Kwa ga̱ci ne bangi jirigi u miya una u ginbo kaca kurwo u cinge ci kurwo u Finikiya, kwa ga̱ci ne alah. <verse eid="ACT 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 21:3" />Nga̱ ga̱ci ci biske Sayifurus kwa ne burya̠ imya u ba, kwa ni ise jirigi umiya korwo u Suriya. Nga̱ ga̱ci ci kanzigi na Taya, ihug ina i jirigi nuci uba kari kanziga icwana. <verse eid="ACT 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 21:4" />Nga̱ ga̱ci ci bangi silmajiri payi, kwa ga̱ci ne madala muhun utandarya̱. Nga̱ gaci ci hoge na suwa nuci nga̱ sihuru si burya̠ siba ci zwam kwa ga̱ci ne zwaman Bulus u ta lagana Urshalima. <verse eid="ACT 21:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 21:5" />Ama nga̱ lokaci nuci uba i, kwa gaci ne alah na cihano acici. Ka̱mu u silmajiri na sia si sibana saawoaci sibke siro u i'ogo, hinda kwa gaci ne kuzat zwama ci i anhunda pa hega ujaba. <verse eid="ACT 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 21:6" />Nga̱ ga̱ci ci sipei ga, kwa ga̱ci ne ise jirigi u miya kwa hinda ne ali giwo.<verse eid="ACT 21:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 21:7" />Ci re gaba na cihano acici kurwo Taya hal ci wuci Tolemayis, ga̱ci ci mabongage ahun kwa ga̱ci ne yinsa na ihon inkan. <verse eid="ACT 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 21:8" />Ni ubungwa i bungwa kwa gaci ne gupa itadan cihano ci kore na Kaisairiya kwa ne ise yaba i Filibus ana a sa buco bucikarigo ci Hwinsu, bu yiwa pa aco utandarya. <verse eid="ACT 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 21:9" />Buza saawo si cua utandarya̱ sina sisi iwo cigya sina si hyanagi si zwame ina si i.<verse eid="ACT 21:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 21:10" />Nga̱ ga̱ci i monhon, acibago an Hwinsu ize yaba Agabas a sirya Yahudiya kurwa a hwaci. <verse eid="ACT 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 21:11" />Nga̱ Agabus aba a korya a hwaci, kwa bware ne zangi mapalago ma Bulus, kwa buba na mapalag siwa na buna kwa ni hin, &lt;&lt;Ahuru a burya̠ an hin, harbuni Hayahudawa ha Urshalima hai konbe buhuzi bu mapalago man hinda ai cutan bwa pa aco na ai dakuwo Hwinsu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 21:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 21:12" />Nga̱ ga̱ci hugi haruni, ga̱ci aco mayiwa ci panga Bulushankuri ana uta kula Urshalima. <verse eid="ACT 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 21:13" />Kwa Bulus ni cyani, &lt;&lt;Baisa ga̱hi iyiwa ni darya hinda ni sani soo nimui u hacigagi? Ni ma shiru sa ana ni palage kawai, amam halm kwaji ni Urshalima zwama ize Bugwama bu doone Yesu.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 21:14" />Nga̱ ga̱ci mayagi ni mune soo u bware, kwa gaci ni curya hinda kwa ni hin, &lt;&lt;Hwinsu u i ini uba hyan u gyamace.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 21:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 21:15" />Nga̱ muhun mu wali kw gaci ni eg shiri kwa ni ala Urshalima. <verse eid="ACT 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 21:16" />Silmajiri sina si yiwa kaseriya sici sila, kwa siba ni sibi kula pa Manason ihuga ini ga̱ci cimadala. bware busa buco bu Sayifuros silmajiri si jigu.<verse eid="ACT 21:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kurwa u Bulus Jarusalem</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 21:17" />Nga̱ ga̱ci wuci Urshalima, alagano Yesu a ci ciye niwa̱wo. <verse eid="ACT 21:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 21:18" />Nga̱ ubunga uba wa bunge Bulus kwa ni kuri ni ga̱ci pa Yakub, hinda ka̱mu ni unga a ynsi ni ga̱ci. <verse eid="ACT 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 21:19" />Nga̱ Bulus uba sanaga kwa bware ni zwamaniga ini Hwinsu uba iyi pa aco ni dakuwo Hwinsu ni cikarigo ci Hwinsu.<verse eid="ACT 21:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 21:20" />Nga̱ uba hugi haruni, kwa aba ni pan Hwinsu cilabe. kwa aba ni hin ni Bulus: Ahun namuya, i hyan, nga̱ Hayahudawa dinyiya haba laga cikarigo ci Hwinsu, hinda ka̱mu waba asa aco ilagano i cibago i Musa. <verse eid="ACT 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 21:21" />A hugi ana goo bu cibagu ka̱mu Hayahudawa hana ha madaliye ni suwa aco ni dakuwo Hwinsu ana zwama a curi icbago i Musa, ni zwamaniga ana ata ia̱gya sawusaba kaciya ko nabiya a laga al'ada aco naciya. <verse eid="ACT 21:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 21:22" />Bice ga̱ci ci iagu? zwama lalai e hui ana goo bu kurya, <verse eid="ACT 21:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 21:23" />zwama haruni ia̱ga ini ga̱ci cihi ana goo iyi. Zwama cizi aco nsi ana yiwa ni ga̱ci ana macune. <verse eid="ACT 21:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 21:24" />Zanga acona kure naba magamuiji i lago u iguzagu ciri hinda goo cupe musare; mu kimgana yaba zwama a hunje sicwa saba. Hinda tigamaba bui daki ana ina hi ana goo bu i ana goo bu iyi aza i zangi si kamahinda, ama uwo hinda buyiwani lagan i cibago i Musa. <verse eid="ACT 21:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 21:25" />Ama na aco ni isa Hayaudawa ana ci cikarigo, ci cumago ga na a takada ana ata ryakana mare mana maba pa gunki, ni mahya, ni munigwa muni ma aba wukure bicwaro hinda acuri cidan.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 21:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 21:26" />Nga̱ ubungwa uba wa bunge Bulus kwa ni zangi aco ni hinda kwa bware ni ea pisu wui iguzagu ciri yaba. Kwa bware ni ise iginga i labe zwama bu zwamaga huna muhun mu iguzagu ciri muba mui ala hinda ni sadaka una waba wui pana zwama ka̱mu waba.<verse eid="ACT 21:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Akumbi Bulus na Roma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 21:27" />Nga̱ muhun mu tandara mu kari ala, aza Hayahudawa hana ha sire usala u Asiya ha hyan Bulus ni yaba ahunda i Hayahudawa i labe. Kwa ni amaga aco ni matanaga hinda kwa ni kumbi bware, <verse eid="ACT 21:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 21:28" />ni sangan ci'ogo &lt;&lt;Aco Izra'ila, ci bangaji! Buco buna bu yiwa ni cibaga aco nuci kamu ina isa inka ni icibagu niciya hinda ni huga ina. Ban uni hinda, bware bu kule Hahelinawa ni suwa u yaba ahunda i Hayahudawa nuci i labe una u hacigage ihuga ina za ciri.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 21:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 21:29" />(Ina sa aba hin haruni zwama aza huna aba hyan Bulus aba ni jabaga ni Turofimus buco bu Apisawa ube usa aba inga ani bulus u isa ni bware ni suwa ni yaba ahunda̠ i Hayahudawa ilabe.)<verse eid="ACT 21:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 21:30" />Kwa aco i ugo ka̱mu ni masinga kwa aco ni sire ni munda. kwa aba ni kumbi Bulus, kwa ni silacumi bware ni yaba ahunda̱ i Hayahudawa ilabe, hinda i sanuwo kwa ni gundan mu'iba mu yaba ahunda̱ i Hayahudawa. <verse eid="ACT 21:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 21:31" />aba ni gimba i huni bware, kwa cikarigo ni wuci pa komanda u musoja mu roma inasa i'ogo i Urshalima ka̱mu hasuwa kwa ni masiga. <verse eid="ACT 21:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 21:32" />Kwa buba ni mahaguzan kwa ni zangi mu soja kwa ni kure pa aco ni matanaga. Inga aco ni matanaga aba hyan Komanda umusoja, kwa aba ni curya isupagu i bulus.<verse eid="ACT 21:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 21:33" />kwa komanda uba ni kure kwa ni zangi bware kwa ni hin ani apare bware ni mari mari arya. kwa ni kabana bware busa buco bu humba hinda bware bu iyi be. <verse eid="ACT 21:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 21:34" />Kwa aco ni matanaga ni san ci'ogo ina isa bika ni ina cyagiya aco ni zwamaga ni bware bu iyi, hinda nga̱ komanda uba wa hiwo kamahinda zwam ibadi ya aco, kwa bware ni hyen ani a kuli Bulus ni bariki u musoja. <verse eid="ACT 21:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 21:35" />Nga̱ Bulus uba u wuci pa ihuga ini uba punji, kwa aco ni ka̱ri hune bware kwa ni majidaga apisa gimbao ihuni bware kwa nga̱ musoja muba zangi bware. <verse eid="ACT 21:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 21:36" />Aco ni matanaga a hina ni sangan ci'ogo, &lt;&lt;Alaji ni bware!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 21:36" /></para>
  <para style="s">Cikarigo ci Bulus pa aco ni matanaga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 21:37" />Nga̱ mu soja mu kari zangi Bulus pa bariki, kwa bware ni kaban komanda, &lt;&lt;Ni pwa nibu zwaman cikarigo?&gt;&gt; &lt;&lt;Bu pwa Hahelinanci?&gt;&gt; bu cyani.<verse eid="ACT 21:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 21:38" />&lt;&lt;Sa gabui busa buco bu Masar buna ba yasige aco suwa hinda bu kaji aco dubu nasi ani hnagi aco ni hila?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 21:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 21:39" />Bulus u cyani, &lt;&lt;Gya nisa Bayahude, buco bu Tasos ni cinge ci Kilikiya, buco bu cinge ci burya̠. Ni zwama Hwinsu, ni curi ni i cikarigo ni acona.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 21:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 21:40" />Nga̱ komanda uba yaje bware, Bulus kwa ni masinga ne yinsana ne i punje, kwa bware ni danda wa ana aco otani. Nga̱ aco ba otani ka̱mu kwa bware ni ia̱gya ga cikarigo ni a̱re a ci Aramaya:<verse eid="ACT 21:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="ACT 22" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 22:1" />&lt;&lt;Hun nimui na hacaca, sablagaje na zwama i egyi.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 22:2" />Inga aba hoge Bulus bu egyi cikarigo na Aramaya, kwa aba ne o'atana. Kwa Bulus ne hyen: <verse eid="ACT 22:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 22:3" />&lt;&lt;Gya nisa Bayahude, hinda an mace na Tarsus na cinge ci Kilisiya, ama na monse a pini. Na i makaranta na wa u Gamaliyel buna bu ne cibage tibai ina i egyi na si kaka asici hinda showa numui u ginbo ibwana i Hwinsu nga̱ ka̱mu nuhin i ginbo nawuya. <verse eid="ACT 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 22:4" />Na hone aco na yiwa na lagana yina u'o, na konbag aco cware na aco cua hinda esag acagiya aco ukaba u ci'incu. <verse eid="ACT 22:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 22:5" />hinda na cidak ci bulabe bulabe na aco na yiwa na bangan bwa ibwana. An pana atakad koro pa hunwo aba na Damasku, hinda gya kore koleya ga palage koro u Urshalima zwama a pan ga wahala. <verse eid="ACT 22:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 22:6" />&lt;&lt;Na Hwinsu na icwa nga̱ gya ni yabuta Damasku, ai sanuwo kwa haske na riganan una u sire na zaro. <verse eid="ACT 22:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 22:7" />Kwa gya na maginda na cinge hinda kwa gya ne hoge ugwa, &lt;Shawulu! Shawulu! Bai san go bu yiwa nahona?<verse eid="ACT 22:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 22:8" />&lt;&lt; &lt;Go busa ganba? Kwagya ne kaban. &lt;&lt; &lt;Gyamui Yesu i Nazareth, ina go buyiwa ne honanag,&gt; kwa buba ne cane. <verse eid="ACT 22:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 22:9" />Aco na yiwa na sibuka an hya haske ama ai hyanuwo buna bu yiwa na karigyagana.<verse eid="ACT 22:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 22:10" />&lt;&lt; &lt;Be gya ne ia̱g, Buca̱ bu yaba? Gya na kaba.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 22:10">&lt;&lt; &lt;Masinge,&gt; Buca̱ bu yaba bu hyen, &lt;Ala kurwo u Damasku. Ahwayi aba ai bu zwaman ina go bwe ia̱g.&gt; <verse eid="ACT 22:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 22:11" />Aco na gaci ci yiwa naba kwa na kumgag wa kwa na kad korwa u Damasku, zwa haske u ula una u gya na hyem u na rubacumi.<verse eid="ACT 22:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 22:12" />&lt;&lt;Kwa buco buna aba yiwa ne oge Hananiya ne korya a homui. Bu yiwa ne lagana Hwinsu pa cikarigo ci Musa hinda aco yiwa ne pan bo cilabe denya pa Hayahudawa hana yiwa payi. <verse eid="ACT 22:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 22:13" />Bu yinsa ciyabu ne gya kwa na hyen, &lt;Buhun abumui Bulus, marigya ne hanag!&gt; Ai sanuwo kwa gya ne hya n bware.<verse eid="ACT 22:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 22:14" />&lt;&lt;Kwa bware ne hyen: &lt;Hwinsu u hacaco a haci u bu tanga go daki ina uba ginbo hinda go hyan Buco bu burya̠ go hoge cikarigo na uno u buba. <verse eid="ACT 22:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 22:15" />Bui pan sheda u buba pa aco ina go bu hyan hinda bu hoge. <verse eid="ACT 22:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 22:16" />Hinda bane bei go bu yiwa na anpe? Masinge, abu yagi baptisma hinda aguzagi magwata̱ amabui, ne rubagi iziya i buba.&gt;<verse eid="ACT 22:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 22:17" />Inga gya na maringe Urshalima gya ne ia̱ga ahunda ne iginga ilabe, kwa gya ne hyan icwa nimui nga̱ halabuwa <verse eid="ACT 22:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 22:18" />kwa gya ne hyan Bugwama bu doone na cikarigo. &lt;Mahuguza!&gt; bu hyen na gya. &lt;Curya Urshalima baniya,zwa aza ihoge cikarigo aciboi zwama gya.&gt;<verse eid="ACT 22:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 22:19" />&lt;&lt; &lt;Kwa gya ni hin,&gt; aco na daki an ni yanse ne lagana Muginga mu labe zwama gya konbe hinda hone aco na yiwa ne lagana ayinana. <verse eid="ACT 22:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 22:20" />Hinda nga̱ aba jigi mahya ma I stifanus, Na yinsa a payi ne mugingo mu ina gya na hyan a i hinda kwa na anpa hazonga han ha aco na hone bware.&gt;<verse eid="ACT 22:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 22:21" />&lt;&lt;Kwa Bugwama bu doone ni hyen ni gya, &lt;Ala; Ni bu cumana a hwayo mire pa aco na ai dakuwo Hwinsu.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 22:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bulus buco bu Roma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 22:22" />Aco na matanaga a kubli ina Bulus uba yiwa ne karigyagana ga kwa nga̱ bware buba hyen naba. Kwa aba ne danda bicwarwa ne san cuogo, &lt;&lt;Hona je bware! Ata curya bware na doone!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 22:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 22:23" />Aba ne sangana cuog ne kwamgana hazoga hab ne ansinga bula, <verse eid="ACT 22:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 22:24" />kwa komanda ne hin a kole Bulus na Bariki. an pan bware bulala hinda a egyi bware makab ina san aco ba yiwa ne sagana cuog haruni. <verse eid="ACT 22:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 22:25" />Nga̱ aba labute Bulus an a pan bware bulala, kwa bware hyen na ishoja i labe i Roma ina iyiwa i yinsa ciyabu, &lt;&lt;Ukamace ga̠hi pan buco bu Roma bulala kaza ka ganhi i konbe bwa na magwata?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 22:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 22:26" />Inga ishoja i Roma iba hoge haruni, kwa ne kore ne zwaman komanda. &lt;&lt;Bai gaci ci ia̱ga?&gt;&gt; bu kabo. &lt;&lt;Buco buna busa Buroma.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 22:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 22:27" />Kwa komanda ne kore pa Bulus ne kaban, &lt;&lt;Na zwama, go busa buco bu Roma?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 22:27">&lt;&lt;Inyo, nisa Buroma,&gt;&gt; Bu cane.<verse eid="ACT 22:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 22:28" />Kwa comanda ne hyen, &lt;&lt;Na cupe musare dinyiya zwa ma gya sa buco bu cinge.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 22:28">&lt;&lt;Ama Bulus u cane,&gt;&gt; gya an mace gya buco cinge.<verse eid="ACT 22:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 22:29" />Aco yanse ne ginbo egyi bware makabo kwa ne curya. Inga komanda uba hoge ana bo konbe boco bu Roma wata Bulus, hal bu gunda bwa.<verse eid="ACT 22:29" /></para>
  <para style="s">A kole Bulus pa majalisa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 22:30" />Inga ubungwa uba wa bonge,ina komanda uba ginbage u daki ina san Hahudawa hab ginbo i hone Bulus, kwa bware ne curya Bulus kwa ne hin an Bulabe bu labe na aco majalisa ka̱mu an matanago. kwa bware kole Silacome Bulus ne yinsa bware na unsa wab.<verse eid="ACT 22:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="ACT 23" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 23:1" />Kwa Bulus ne halana aco majalisa haisa kwa ne hin, &lt;&lt;Ahun nimui Hayahudawa, Na sinju ibwana i Hwinsu i burya̠ na soo uikan na iri u dala ana gya na i nawuya.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 23:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 23:2" />Nga̱ Hananiya haruni kwa bware ni hyan na aco na ayiwa ciyabu na bware a mare bware. <verse eid="ACT 23:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 23:3" />Kwa Bulus na hin, &lt;&lt;Hwinsu wei bu mala go ma, bu nyaga na ubwaga u ukaba una aba shokotage penti u cene! dale na ia̱gya shara'a sa aco na yiwa ne lagana cikarigo ci Musa, go hinda buza ne lagana icibago Musa hal ne san an mare!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 23:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 23:4" />Aco na a mayabuta na Bulus kwa ne hin, Buyiwa ne cwana bulabe bulabe bu Hwinsu?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 23:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 23:5" />Kwa Bulus ne cane, &lt;&lt;Ahun, Ne dakuwo an bware busa bulabe bulabe; zwama an rubuci: &lt;Ta zwamana mugwamgwam cikarigo ci wo.&gt; &gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 23:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 23:6" />Nga̱ Bulus uba wa gane an aza Hasadaukiyawa, na Haparisawa, kwa Bulus ne gopa ia̱gya aco majalisa cikarigo, &lt;&lt;Ahun nimui, Gya na sa Baparisiye, bwa bu haparisawa. Zwama gya ne tani soo na wasingewa wa aco na kwaji ube usan aba yiwa na ia̱ga shari'a.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 23:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 23:7" />Nga̱ bware buba zwame haruni, kwa gadama ne masinge pa Haparisawa na Hasadaukiyawa, hal aco na matanaga an macabi cirya. <verse eid="ACT 23:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 23:8" />(Zwama Hasadaukiyawa ha hin an wasingewa u za pa aco na kwaji, hinda ai yadwuwa na acuma a Hwinsu ko a̠huru, ama Haparisawa ha yaje na ini ka̱mu.) <verse eid="ACT 23:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 23:9" />Kwa rikici na masinga dinyiya, hinda hawalami hai icibago i musa an asa hayahudawa kwa ne masiga ni. rikici dinyiya &lt;&lt;Ci hyanuwo ina i buco buna buba egyi,&gt;&gt; an hin.Idaki ko anhunru a acuma a Hwinsu abe a i cikarigo na bware?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 23:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 23:10" />Nga̠ masinsa mab ma monse dinyiya kwa komanda ne hoge iwasa an ai bubusag Bulus. Kwa bware ne zwaman mushoja mu kore mu sirya Bulus na koce a kole bware na bariki. <verse eid="ACT 23:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 23:11" />Gita an a laga Bugwama bu dwoniya bu yinsa ciyabu na Bulus kwa hyen, &lt;&lt;Ta huga iwasa! Inga go bu i cikarigo a cimui na Urshalima, harbuni go bwe ia̱g na Roma.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 23:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Hayahudawa ha ka̱ri hone Bulus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 23:12" />Inga ubongwa ub wa boge Hayahudawa ha pare muno ka̱mu hal na kucona an aza ere ko icisho kwa a hone Bulus. <verse eid="ACT 23:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 23:13" />Aco na a i shiri uni a hwace aco kope nasi. <verse eid="ACT 23:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 23:14" />Kwa aba ne kore pa bulabe bulabe na aco labe kwa ne hyen, Ci zangi macono pa Hwinsu an ciza ire ko ci sho ihya kwa ci hone Bulus. <verse eid="ACT 23:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 23:15" />Baniya , na ganhi aco majalisa i cuma pa komanda i kwande an i ginbo i jidana ia̱gya bware makabo i byane cikarigo ci bware. Gaci hinda cima shiri ci hone bware kapi bu wucya pini.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 23:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 23:16" />Inga bwa bu buhun bu Bulus buba hoge shiri waba, kwa buba ne ese bariki kwa ne zwaman Bulus. <verse eid="ACT 23:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 23:17" />Kwa Bulus ne uga ishoja ilabe i Roma kwa ne hin, &lt;&lt;Kula bulagas buna pa buco bu labe, bu ginbo i zwaman bwa ihya.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 23:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 23:18" />Kwa aba ne kola bwa pa komanda.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 23:18">Ishoja i labe kwa ni hyen, &lt;&lt;Bulus, una aba gonda, una cuma an a kuleya bulagas buna a hwaboi zwama buza ina buba ginbo ni bu zwaman.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 23:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 23:19" />Kwa komanda ne konbe wa u bulagas, kwa ne numi bwa na ihug ina iza aco kwa ne kaban, &lt;&lt;Be i go buginbo na zwaman?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 23:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 23:20" />Bu hyen: &lt;&lt;Hayahudawa ha yajoa bu zwama an go kole Bulus pa Majalisa nu ubongwa aba kwande an a ginbo jidani egyi bware makabo dinya. <verse eid="ACT 23:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 23:21" />Ta yada na ba, zwama aco na awuci kope nasi na anpe u bware zwama a hone bware. Ama cone an a ta re ko aso kwa a hone bware. ayiwa na anpe noboi go ihin nab an bo yaje.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 23:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 23:22" />Kwa komanda ne nume bulagasa hacobe, &lt;&lt;Buta zwamana buciyahya an bu cubaga bwa cikarigo ciniyo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 23:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">A kole Bulus pa Gwamna Felis</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 23:23" />Kwa ne oga musoja mu labe murya kwa ni hyen na muba, &lt;&lt;Eaje shiri na musoja dari urya, muna mu jwakwa kope tandarya hinda na aco na aza mashi dari urya a kore Kaisariya na karfe utanasi na gita. <verse eid="ACT 23:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 23:24" />Hinda i hyagiyo Bulus zwam bina bware buba bwe yidana zwama a kole bware pa Felis Gwamna lafiya.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 23:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 23:25" />Kwa komanda ne rubuta atakad harbuna: <verse eid="ACT 23:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 23:26" />Pa Kalaudiyus Lisiyas,kurwa pa Buco bulabe Gwamna Felis: Nibu bungago.<verse eid="ACT 23:26" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 23:27" />Buco buna Bulus Hayahudawa ha konbe bwa ha gane cimu ha hone bwa, ama kwa gya ne korya na musoja a mumoi kwa ne silacome bwa, zwama na hoge an isa buco bu cinge ci Roma. <verse eid="ACT 23:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 23:28" />Inga gya ni ginbo daki ina bware buba i aba galaganu bwa, kwa gya ne kula bware pa majalisa mab. <verse eid="ACT 23:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 23:29" />Na gane an a wonje bware zwama cikarigo ci icibago yaba, ama gya ne hyanuwo bu i ina i jube ihono ko a pare bware ko ese na ukaba ci'incu. <verse eid="ACT 23:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 23:30" />Inga aba ne zwama shiri uwo akan bware, kwa gya nacuma abu kulagiya na mabuna. Hinda Ni zwama aco na yiwa na zargi u bware a korya a bu zwama ina san aba ginbo i hone bware.<verse eid="ACT 23:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 23:31" />Zwama haruni kwa musoja, ni zangi Bulus ni gita nga̱ aba zwama mua koro Antifatiris. <verse eid="ACT 23:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 23:32" />Inga ubungwa ub bonge kwa aba ne san musoja mujwakwa mu ali na bware, kwa muba ne maringya bariki. <verse eid="ACT 23:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 23:33" />Inga mushoja mu jwakwa muba wuci Kaisariya, kwa muba ne cutan Gwamna utakada hinda kwa ne pan bware Bulus. <verse eid="ACT 23:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 23:34" />Kwa Gwamna ne karanta atakada kwa ne hyan usala una Bulus uba wa sire. Inga buba hoge an bu sirya na Kilikiya, <verse eid="ACT 23:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 23:35" />kwa ne hyen, &lt;&lt;Ne hoge ina go bu i sa aco na ayiwa a kole kara noboi a wuco.&gt;&gt; Kwa Gwamna ne hin a gonda Bulus ukaba u ci'incu u yaba ahunda i Hayahudawa Hiridus Bugwam.<verse eid="ACT 23:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="ACT 24" />
  <para style="s">Hayahudawa ha kule Bulus pa Bugwama Felis</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 24:1" />Nga̠ muhun muta mub ali kwa Hananiya bulabebulabe ne kore Kaisariya na aonga na loya una aba ogo Tartulus, a kole kara u Bulus pa Gwamna. <verse eid="ACT 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 24:2" />Nga̠ aba uga Bulus na shuwa, kwa Tartulus ne zwaga i esa kara pa Felis kwa ne hyen: &lt;&lt;Ci hoge laco dinya nga̱ go buci komgage gaci aco nabweya, hinda mahansa a mabuya ma kulaguwa cinge cina ikimgano i dinya. <verse eid="ACT 24:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 24:3" />Tuhonba a yiwa na bu goje, na zangaco iziya nebo Felis, gojo nuci uza uhare. <verse eid="ACT 24:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 24:4" />Ama zwama cita bu hacigaga lokaci, ni yiwa na buona hoge yama nici kubuli ina gaci ci kari ns bu zwaman ciza i sano.<verse eid="ACT 24:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 24:5" />&lt;&lt;Ci konbya buco buna buza rikici, bu yiwa ne amagan Hayahudawana dinyiya ka̱mu. Na kungiya hya una aba yiwa ne oge nazarawa bube busa buco bulabe. <verse eid="ACT 24:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 24:6" />hinda bu ginbo i hacigaga yaba ahunda i Hayahudawa i labe; ube u san ga̠ci konbya bwa. <verse eid="ACT 24:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 24:7" />ama shugaba Lisiyasu kore kwa ca bware na koce na wa nuci, <verse eid="ACT 24:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 24:8" />Ube usan gaci ci kole bwa a hwabui zwama goo kabgana bware ni icwa nibui bui daki ina sangaci ci yiwa ne ia̱ga kara u buba ahwaboi.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 24:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 24:9" />Hayahudawa ma ha yiwa na kacuta a kaci, ha yaje an i ni iyiwa harbuni <verse eid="ACT 24:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 24:10" />Nga̠ gwamna uba pan Bulus an bu i cikarigo, Kwa Bulus ne cane: &lt;&lt;Na daki an bu i haya dinyiya goo ne ia̠gi aco cinge cina shara'a; zwama haruni nihoge laco dinya ui kala icwa nimui. <verse eid="ACT 24:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 24:11" />Ai si bu kabo bui hoge ni sa hwacuwa mohon ikope na murya gya na danje korwo Urshalima na pan Hwinsu cilabe. <verse eid="ACT 24:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 24:12" />Hayahudawa na a kole kara nimui ai na tabuwa na hyana gya ni ia̱go masinsa na buciyahya na shuwa ui yaba ahunda i Hayahudawa i labe, ko imagano ya aco a ansige hankali na ihuga izangacuwo i Hwinsu ko nabiya ihugo hya na iogo. <verse eid="ACT 24:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 24:13" />Hinda aza ipan sheda ina aba a bu kulage an isa harbuniyo. <verse eid="ACT 24:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 24:14" />Ibikan gya na yaje naba ni yiwa ne lagana Hwinsu una hacaca a haci hab lagan una usa yina, una aba ogo aco azwaga a cibya. Ni yaje tibai ina iywa ne lagan icibaga i Musa hinda a rubuci na Acibago an Hwinsu. <verse eid="ACT 24:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 24:15" />hinda na tane soo na Hwinsu nga̱ aco na, harbuni hinda na ansingewa wa aco akwajo an i burya̠ na eewo. <verse eid="ACT 24:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 24:16" />Ube u san gya si i kokari shuwa numui uza shaka pa Hwinsu na aco. <verse eid="ACT 24:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 24:17" />&lt;&lt;Hinda nga̱ gya ni ea haya na za na yaba, kwa gya ni giwo Urshalima zwama kuleya ina aba ai taimak aco nimui an aza koce hinda gya pan sadaka. <verse eid="ACT 24:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 24:18" />Gya na suwa wai yaba ahunda i Hayahudawa kwa ni hogo na iguzagu ciri. Hinda ne yanuwa ni bucohya, hinda ne asingewa soo a bucohya ko ibada. <verse eid="ACT 24:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 24:19" />Ama Hayahudawa ha cinge ci Asiya ha yanse, ha be hasa bui kule kara nimui ama ni hyanuwo han zwam habe si haza ihya ina gya ni kulagya. <verse eid="ACT 24:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 24:20" />Ko hinda hana ha yiwa pini ha zwama magwata ina gya na i hona gya na yinsa pa majalisa- <verse eid="ACT 24:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 24:21" />kwadi aza huna gya na i cikarigo na koce pa ba: &lt;Ina gya na zwame isa wasingewa wa aco na kwaji ube u san gya yisa ahwabui zwama makabo nawuya.&gt; &gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 24:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 24:22" />Felis a daki i dinyapa yinani, kwa ne dajigana cikarigo kwa hon u menwa. &lt;&lt;Nga̱ Lisiyas konmanda aba a korya,&gt;&gt; kwa bware ne hin, &lt;&lt;Na hune cikarigo acibui hon menwa.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 24:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 24:23" />Kwa Felis na zwaman i soja i Roma i anpan Bulus kwa na pan bware dama siboki si pan bware ina buba ginbo ka̱mu. <verse eid="ACT 24:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 24:24" />Nga̱ mohon muba ali Felis a kore na bu'a a buba Durusila, buna busa Buyahude. Bu kubuli bware ka̱mu nga̱ buba ea cikarigo ci itano i soo na Kristi Yesu. <verse eid="ACT 24:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 24:25" />Nga̱ Bulus uba i cikarigo ci nagu uciriyo, ikonbo ui icwa hinda shara sina si yiwa korwa, ama Felis ne hoge iwasa kwa ne hyen, &lt;&lt;Baniya ujubo harbuni! Bu pwan i ala. Si na hin dama ni cuman go kurya.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 24:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 24:26" />Na lokaci uni bu nga̱ an ko bulus ui pan bware musare, ube u san Felis uba hina ne cumagan pa Bulus binibini bu kargyage na bware. <verse eid="ACT 24:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 24:27" />Nga̱ haya harya hab aliyi, kwa aba ne kola Fokiyus Felis u canji bware, hinda Felis a kari a ia̱gi Hayahudawa i burya̠, kwa bware ne curya Bulus na ukaba u ci'incu.<verse eid="ACT 24:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 24" />
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="ACT 25" />
  <para style="s">Bulus u zangaci kara koro pa kaisar</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 25:1" />Inga moho mutaco muba aliyi, Festus a kore cinge ci Kaisariya koro Urshalima, <verse eid="ACT 25:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 25:2" />ihug ina i bulabe bulabe na aco a Hayahudawa aba a kole Bulus kara pa ba. <verse eid="ACT 25:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 25:3" />Kwa aba ne kama Festus na Hwinsu, an a rige Bulus Urshalima, zwama a ginbago yama aba na yina aba gita ga a hone bware ne yina. <verse eid="ACT 25:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 25:4" />Kwa Festus ne cane, &lt;&lt;A konbegage Bulus na Kaisariya, hinda gya ni yabutano koro hwayi. <verse eid="ACT 25:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 25:5" />Zwama haruni ginbagaje aco labe nahin ci kore nab a i kara u bware ahwayi, si bu i ina i gyamaco.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 25:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 25:6" />Inga buba i moho utataco ko ikope tare nab, kwa bware ne ala Kaisariya, hinda nga̱ ubungwa uba ubonge kwa buba ne madala ne idalo i sharia kwa ne hyen a kolagiya bware Bulus. <verse eid="ACT 25:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 25:7" />Inga Bulus uba wa kore, Hayahudawa han ha sirya Urshalima ha yinsa ciyabu na bware, hab ne kolage kara u bware, han ha za icwa.<verse eid="ACT 25:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 25:8" />Kwa Bulus ne kala icwa uba: &lt;&lt;Na iwo ihya ina i laganowa cikarigo ci Hayahudawa ko Iginga ilabe ko hinda Kaisar.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 25:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 25:9" />Ama zwama Festus hugi yama hinda ai karunwo a hacigage Hayahudawa soo, kwa ne hyen na Bulus, &lt;&lt;Bu ka̱ri ci kore Urshalima na go zwama abu egyi shara'a hwayiyo?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 25:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 25:10" />Kwa Bulus na cane: &lt;&lt;Baniya ni yiwa na kotu u Kaisar, ihug ina i kamace a na i doone aco na ia̱gi shara'a. Ni ia̱guwo Hayahudawa ina ya kamacuwa, nga̱ go ma bu daki. <verse eid="ACT 25:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 25:11" />Si, gya, ni i laifi una u jobe ana hone, ni wujuwa a na hone. Ama si kara una Hayahudawa aba ha kole ui sa kamahinda, Aza buna bui pan ga gya an hone. Ni ginbo a zagaci kara numui koro pa Kaisar!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 25:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 25:12" />Nga̱ Festus aba kolage aco na buba yiwa ne ibwana na ba, kwa bware nr hin: &lt;&lt;Bu zangaci karapa Kaisar. To pa Kaisar go boi kore!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 25:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Festus U Kole Bulus Pa Bugwama Agiriffa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 25:13" />Nga̱ muhun muba ali kwa bugwama Agiriffa na Banis kore Kaisariya zwama abonge Festus. <verse eid="ACT 25:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 25:14" />Nga̱ aba ka̱ri ia̱ muhun payi, kwa Festus cikarigo Bulus pa bugwama. Kwa ni hin: &lt;&lt;Aza buco buna bu Felis aba ni curigagi na ukaba u ci'incu. <verse eid="ACT 25:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 25:15" />Hona u gya na kore Urshalima kwa bulabe bulabe aco labe ne kole kara ububa na ginbo an a hone bwa.<verse eid="ACT 25:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 25:16" />&lt;&lt;Ama na zwama ga an ui sa u burya̠ Bu roma bu egyi buco magwat shari'a kwa sa a kole bo pa aco na yiwa na kara ububa, zwama bu kare icwa i buba. <verse eid="ACT 25:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 25:17" />Nga̱ aba a kore ni gya, ne hacigago lokaci, nga̱ ubungwa uba wa bonge kwa gya ne ugan dala a kotu ibongwa u bungwa kwa ne san a esa na bware <verse eid="ACT 25:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 25:18" />Nga̱ aco na a kole bware a masenge ginbo an a ka̱ri ea cikarigo, ai koleya ina gya na nga̱ an bware bu i. <verse eid="ACT 25:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 25:19" />Kwa di aza ina ya gami ga zwama wa adini a ba hinda zwa buco buna bu koji buna aba ogo Yesu buna bu Bulus uba hyen an bu yiwa bwe kodwuwo. <verse eid="ACT 25:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 25:20" />Gya na nagi nga̱ gya ne kulag na cikarigo cini; kwa gya ni kaban bware si bwe yaje bu korye Urshalima zwama a ia̱gi bware shara'a si ina aba hyen an bware bu i. <verse eid="ACT 25:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 25:21" />Ama nga̱ Bulus uba zangaci cikarigo zwama Bugwama bu labe bu gunji cikarigo, kwa gya ne hyen an kumgage bware hal lokaci una u gya ne san a kole bware pa Kaisar.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 25:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 25:22" />Kwa Bugwama Agiriffa ne hyen na Festus, &lt;&lt;Gya ma na ginbo i huge buco buna ne icwa ne mui.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 25:22">Bware bu cane, &lt;&lt;Na ubungwa bwe hoge bwa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 25:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">A kole Bulus pa Bugwama Agiriffa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 25:23" />Nga̱ ubungwa uba bonge kwa Bugwama Agiriffa na Banis kwa ne ese na cilabe ci cugwama hinda a ese ukaba na aco labe gasa na aco labe ai e'ogo. Kwa Festus ne cuman a esa ne Bulus. <verse eid="ACT 25:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 25:24" />Kwa Festus ne hin: &lt;&lt;Bugwama Agiriffa, hinda na aco na yiwa na gaci ka̱mu, i hya buco buna! Hayahudawa kamu ha kole kara u bware ahwamui ni Urshalima na Kaisariya, aba ne sangan cu'og an a hone bware. <verse eid="ACT 25:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 25:25" />Gya na hyan bware bwe iwo ihyo ina dwobe u'o, ama nga̱ bware bu be bu ginbage a kole cikarigo pa Kaisar kwa gya ne kola bware Roma. <verse eid="ACT 25:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 25:26" />Ama na za cikarigo cina ci gya rubuci Bugwama bu Roma. Zwama haruni na kulowa bware pa ga̱hi, musamman ma go, Bugwama Agiriffa, zwama ibyano ina go bui ea na hyan ina gya ni rubuta. <verse eid="ACT 25:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 25:27" />Zwama ni hyanuwo a u gyamacuwa gya kulage bware buna aba yiwa na kara anagi ina san aba kole bwa kara.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 25:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 25" />
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="ACT 26" />
  <para style="s">Bulus u kula icwa i uba pa Bugwama Agiriffa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 26:1" />Kwa Agiriffa na hin na Bulus, &lt;&lt;Abu pano dam ea cikarigo na icwa nubui.&gt;&gt; Kwa Bulus ne danda wa kwa ne rwaga cikarigo zwama icwa i buba: <verse eid="ACT 26:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 26:2" />&lt;&lt;Bugwama Agiriffa na hoge laco dinya na gaba nubui zwama gya i cikarigo cina ci Hayahudawa hab ha zwame an na ea, <verse eid="ACT 26:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 26:3" />hinda ma goo bu daki aladu a hayawudawa dinya na ina hab hai yadwuwa na ba. Zwam haruni, ni yiwa ni bu gama na Hwinsu go sabulage na burya̠.<verse eid="ACT 26:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 26:4" />&lt;&lt;Hayawudawa ha daki ka̱mu dala na wansigewa gya bwa bu noya, wasengewa nimui na cinge acimui, na Urshalima. <verse eid="ACT 26:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 26:5" />A sano na daku nimui a daki nuni, sa yaje, nga̱ aco ana a yiwa pa adini nuci, na ia̱ dala nimui nga̱ buco bu Buparisawa. <verse eid="ACT 26:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 26:6" />Hinda baniya zwama itano numui i soo ni ina Hwinsu uba ia̱gi hacaca a haci alkawali an ai na ia̱gya shara'a nawuya. <verse eid="ACT 26:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 26:7" />Alkawali ani baniya an aba ia̱gi sizwaga ikope na sirya siba cimgagi si hyan a sinji aco na yiwa ne lagan Hwinsu gita na hwinsu. Dak bugwama, zwama itano i soo biniibe i Hayahudawa haba yiwa na ia̠ karanumoi. <verse eid="ACT 26:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 26:8" />Be san ga̱hi i hya an Hwinsu uza ipwana i asinga aco na kwaji?<verse eid="ACT 26:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 26:9" />&lt;&lt;Gya ma na hya an u gyamace ia̱gi i dinya ina i gazgana cikarigo ci Yesu buco Nazaret i ala gaba. <verse eid="ACT 26:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 26:10" />Ina gya na i bini na Urshalima. Ni umurni u bulabe bu labe na kwama aco Hwinsu dinyiya na ukaba u ci'incu, hinda nga̱ aba hone ga, na cibe ihogo laco nimui. <verse eid="ACT 26:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 26:11" />Na laga muginga moaba mu labe zwa pan ga wahala, hinda na i kokari san aco acwane Yesu. Na hacigage soo dinyiya, Na laga ga ma korwo cinge ci ijapu zwam pan ga wahala.<verse eid="ACT 26:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 26:12" />Bugwama Agripa na haruni, aza hun na gya na cihano ci korwo u Damasku gya na utakada una u Bulabe bu labe buba na pan. <verse eid="ACT 26:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 26:13" />Na hwinsu uba ne cwa, Bugwama, gya ne jabaga na yina, Na hya ula wa sirya na zaro, una u zake hwinsu na malanga, kwa u ni ringa na aco ana a yiwa na sibka. <verse eid="ACT 26:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 26:14" />Kwa ka̱mu nuci na maginda na cinge, kwa gya na hoge bicwarwa na oga na anre a ibranayanci, &lt;Shawulu, Shawulu, be san goo bu yiwa na pan wahala? Buyiwa ne pan icwa nibui wahala goo bu yiwa na gaba ni gya.&gt;<verse eid="ACT 26:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 26:15" />&lt;&lt;Kwa gya ne kaban, &lt;Gamba ne, Bugwama bu jone?&gt;<verse eid="ACT 26:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 26:16" />&lt;Bane masenge hinda yinsa na bona nubui. Na bu silta zwama i bu pan ibwana in bugyama hinda sa seda u ina go bu hyan gya na i hinda na ina gya na bu ciba. <verse eid="ACT 26:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 26:17" />Na bu cagaga pa aco naboi hinda aco na ai sa hayahudaw. Na ginbo na bu cuman pa ba <verse eid="ACT 26:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 26:18" />zwam goo gonje haisa haba zwam a ringi yaga pa ci'incu kurwo malanga, pa koce u bugwama bu eewo korwo pa Hwinsu, nga̱ aba ai sana na nagu ciri maba hinda a re gado hwa aco na tani soo na Hwinsu.&gt;<verse eid="ACT 26:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 26:19" />&lt;&lt;Zwam haruni, Bugwama Agiriffa, na yajuwa gya wonje i lagana cikarigo cina ci gya na hyan nga̱ ulabuwa na zaro. <verse eid="ACT 26:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 26:20" />Na rwage pa aco Damasku, hind pa aco Urshalima na tunba usala u Yahudiya, na aco na ai sa Hawudawa ma, Na hin an a curi eewo ama ringya pa Hwinsu hinda a i burya̠. <verse eid="ACT 26:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 26:21" />Ina san bini Hayahudawa haba na konbe na Muginga muwaba hal ka̱ri na hona. <verse eid="ACT 26:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 26:22" />Ama na hin koce Hwinsu nawuya, ube gya na yinsa pa aco labe na aco noya. Ne kargyaga cikarigo cina ai hwace ci acuma a Hwinsu na ina i Musa uba zwamage an i ia̱, <verse eid="ACT 26:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 26:23" />an Kristi i pan yan wahala hinda, buco bu jigu buna boi masinga pa aco u'o, zwam bu kulage aco buba malanga hinda pa aco na ai sa Hayahudaw.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 26:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 26:24" />Bulus uba na cikarigo kwa Festus sanan bware cuog. &lt;&lt;Buza nabeya icwa, Bulus!&gt;&gt; bu dande bicwarwa. &lt;&lt;Karatu kana ka goo bu yiwa ne ia̱ ka hacigago icwa nubui.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 26:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 26:25" />&lt;&lt;Ni tiya apisa, buco bu labe Festus,&gt;&gt; Bulus u cane. &lt;&lt;Ina gya ni yiwa na zwamag isa kamahinda. <verse eid="ACT 26:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 26:26" />Bugwama Agrippa bu daki na ini gya na yiwa ne zwamag, hinda na pwa ia̱ga cikarigo na bware ko iwasa. Na daki hinda ini iyiwa na soo u bware bui sa mai nya̱ganuwa, zwama ai ia̱guwo na cisuin. <verse eid="ACT 26:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 26:27" />Bugwama Agiriffa, bu yaje na cuma Hwinsu? Na daki ka̱mu bu yaje.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 26:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 26:28" />Kwa Bugwama Agiriffa na hyan na Bulus, &lt;&lt;Bu nga̱ an ko bui sa gya sa alagano a Yesu?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 26:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 26:29" />Kwa Bulus na cane, &lt;&lt;Bane ko sa bane-Na yiwa ne ia̱ga ahunda pa Hwinsu sa gabuya kawai ama aco na yiwa a kuli nawuya ai san ina gya na sa nawuya, kwa di mari mari aba na palage.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 26:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 26:30" />Kwa Bugwama Agiriffa na masinga, harbuni gwamna na Banis, na aco na madale na bware. <verse eid="ACT 26:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 26:31" />Nga̱ aba sire pa ukaba u shari'a, kwa aba ne mazwaman, kwa ne hin, &lt;&lt;Buco buna bui iwo ina jobe a hone bwa ko a ese bwa ukaba uci'incu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 26:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 26:32" />Kwa Bugwama Agiriffa ne hin na Festus, &lt;&lt;Si buco buna bwa zangacuwo cikarigo cina Kaisar ba ca i cure bwa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 26:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 26" />
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="ACT 27" />
  <para style="s">Bulus u ese jirigi u miya Kurwa u Roma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 27:1" />Inga aba hoge na cisiya ci masingiya na suwa jirgi kurya cinge ci italiya, kwa aba na pana Bulus na cagiya hapursina na wah wu usoja ulabe uroma iziya uba yuliyus, uyuwa na suwa kungiya na <verse eid="ACT 27:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 27:2" />kwa gaci ne ise jirgi u miya daga ucagiya mu'ugo una aba ne ogo Adramatiyam, una u ka̱ri masinga kure acagiya mu'ogo ana a yiwa usala u Asiya, kwa ga̠ci na rwagu punje na buna. Aristarkus, buco bu cinge ci Tasalonika ana yiwa cinge ci Makidoniya, bu yiwa na ga̱ci. <verse eid="ACT 27:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 27:3" />Na hargu yubungwa kwa gaci na wuci sidon; yuliyus u ia̱gi bulus i burya̠, bucuriye bware bu kure wah a'usa a bware a pah bware ka̱mu ina bware bu gimbo. <verse eid="ACT 27:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 27:4" />Nga̱ ga̠ci ci masinge kwa jirgina cikula na cikula na gaba cibiri ei sayifurus ihugana mupela muba mu za kuce. <verse eid="ACT 27:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 27:5" />Nga̱ ga̠ci cikaciya ukacaso uwoh una u yabta na cinge ci kilikiya na famfiliya, kwa ga̠ci na wuci mira na cinge ci likiya. <verse eid="ACT 27:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 27:6" />Apayi u soja u labe u roma uba hin ucagiya ugirgi wa Alekzandiriya una kure cinge ci italiya kwa buba na ci tana na suwa. <verse eid="ACT 27:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 27:7" />Ci iyi muho gaci na jabaga na hankali kacar ga̱ci wuci ciyabu na ieugo ina aba ugo kinidus. nga̱ mupela muba ciyazasga gaci regaba na cihano, kwa ga̱ci na lagana gefe ana mupale muba nu zah, kacuta ka tsibiri a kirit ciyabu na saimoni. <verse eid="ACT 27:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 27:8" />Ci ali ihuganiya dakyar kwa gaci na wuci ihuga ina aba ugo Amintaciyar mafaka, ciyabu na iego ina aba ugo lasiya. <verse eid="ACT 27:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 27:9" />Cihacigage lokaci dinya, cihano ci sano damuwa dinya zwamu lokaci aba azumi a rigyano a alluwo. Kwa Bulus na panaga shawara. <verse eid="ACT 27:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 27:10" />&lt;&lt;Aco nimui, na hyan cihano cina ci zana matsala hinda halma na jirgi, ka̱mu na a̱huru nuci.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 27:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 27:11" />Amma usoja ulabe wa yajuwa na ina Bulus uba hin naba, kwa uba na lagana ina bu ikaju bu jirgi na bu huzi bu jirgi. <verse eid="ACT 27:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 27:12" />Wa iwo gana na ihuga yi yisangano ya lasiya jirgi uyisa na habo, cagiya co dinyiya kwa nahya ciregaba na cihano, a iyi kokari a wuci Piniks, suma iyi aba hogi habo apayi. Piniks asa ihuge eyizgano ha jirgi na tsibiri cia kirit cina cigingye usala uzata bu pu i hin tuhumba ka̱mu.<verse eid="ACT 27:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">mupyala mu kuce</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 27:13" />Nga̱ mupek muba wrage hulagani usala wimme, kwa aco na yhe tsammani ahiwo ina aba gimbo; kwa aba na numakani iroma ina si kumbage jirgi u yisa kwa aba na ugana ne gagi tsibiri a kirit. <verse eid="ACT 27:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 27:14" />A sanuwa dinyiya, kwa mupela amuco mulabe mu sira &lt;&lt;Zata imme,&gt;&gt; kwa muba na supe tsibiri aniya. <verse eid="ACT 27:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 27:15" />Nga̱ mupyala muba mosupe jirgi, uma yage na lagana ihuge na muoela muba mua sire; kwa gaci na cure jirgi kawai ihuge ina mupyala nuba cikuye. <verse eid="ACT 27:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 27:16" />Nga̱ gaci laga kacuta ka tsibiri ana aba ugo kauda, dakyar gaci yise jirgi na gaji wa uwo. <verse eid="ACT 27:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 27:17" />Nga̱ aco aba a kaji jirgi unowa kurwa pa una labe, kwa aba na palaga jirgi na birigi zwamu amma kumgage. a huge iwasa mupela muta zanga ga kuwra higa cinge ci sirtis cina si naki tegya. <verse eid="ACT 27:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 27:18" />Harbuniya ga̱ci hina na so wahala zwamu koce u mupyala hal kurwo ihargu yiwa ubungwa kwa aba na hinana kwamagana icwana na suwa u miya. <verse eid="ACT 27:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 27:19" />Na hwinsu u tacula, aba nai cuyab kwa aba na kwamma gana hazunga haba na cua yab hi buana jirgi. <verse eid="ACT 27:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 27:20" />Ci hin muhun dinya ca hyanuwo hwinsu bale pena harbuniya mupoela na silla a hina na ci yamma huna, kwa ga̱ci na zaciga soo wa surwa. <verse eid="ACT 27:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 27:21" />Aco sanu dinya ariwa mare, Bulus kwa na masinge na usa waba: &lt;&lt;Aco, ya zangi shawara numiya ita alah i curi tsibiri ci kirit; ya za ise una wahala. <verse eid="ACT 27:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 27:22" />Baniya nayiwa na ia̱gi gargadi zan je koce soo, zwamu kona buna bwe nagi a huro abuba; kwadi i hin hasara ha jirgi. <verse eid="ACT 27:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 27:23" />Na gita bucuma bu Hwinsu buna gye na pagano cilabe buyisa ciyabu na gya. <verse eid="ACT 27:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 27:24" />Kwa na hin, &lt;Tahuga iwasa, Bulus. Lailai bwe yisana na gaba a kaisar; hinda Hwinsu urigeno wa bupanu ka̱mu aco na yiwa na suwa ujirgi.&gt; <verse eid="ACT 27:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 27:25" />Zwamu harbuniya isanaje kuce usuwa, aco, zwamu na tani suwa pa hwinsu zwanu wi pala nga̱ ubana zwama. <verse eid="ACT 27:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 27:26" />Zwamu harbuniya, dole pa mupala muci kuliya ihugana higa uba yiwa. Watau tsibiri.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 27:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 27:27" />Huna ga̱ci sinji muhu kupe na munasi na gita mupyala muci zabukiya kuwro uwo wa meditereniya, nusa gita batano wuci ugagi wu uwo. <verse eid="ACT 27:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 27:28" />Kwa aba na gwaji a hin zwabuco miya da̱ri na kupa hare zwammaco nga̱ aba madajigana cimu kwa aba na gwaji hinda zwambuco kop tanasi. <verse eid="ACT 27:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 27:29" />Zwam iwasa jirgi u miya nuci uta hiba u i karo na hatare, kwa aba na curi na muroma mari mari mu nasi zwa gasga jirgi cihano kwa aba na hin ahunda na halana Hwinsu hisa hal i yiwu ubungwa. <verse eid="ACT 27:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 27:30" />Ama aco i kadagu u jirgi a i kokari a sume na suwa jirgi, kwa aba na pasingega ha jirgi ha nuya aba na hin wayo nga gimbo cuwrana mari-mari na suwa miye. <verse eid="ACT 27:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 27:31" />Kwa Bulus na zwamana usojah ulaba na hasojoji, &lt;&lt;Kwapa aco na a yisa na suwa jirgi, aza buco bui sire.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 27:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 27:32" />Kwa hasojoji na gunda irigi ha jirgi ha nuya kwa haba na lagana miya. <verse eid="ACT 27:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 27:33" />Ubungwa wa kawro ibunge Bulus kwa na unega are mare kamu wab. &lt;&lt;Ci iwo muhu kupa na mu sani,&gt;&gt; Bware buhye, &lt;&lt;Ga̱hi na apa ustammani yariwa mare hinda kwa na ihe. <verse eid="ACT 27:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 27:34" />Na yiwa na roko nuhi ire mare zwamu lafiya nuhiya. kona buna boi nagi ko da cihinji cibuba.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 27:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 27:35" />Nga̱ bware buba zwamaga haruniya, kwa bware na zangi burodi kno na gundaga kwa na gwaje Hwinsu na gaba ba kamu bware kwa nare. <verse eid="ACT 27:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 27:36" />Kwa aba kamu na hya iduluwa isuwa kwa nare mare na suca saba. <verse eid="ACT 27:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 27:37" />Ka̱mu na suwa jirgi ayase aba dariure na kupe tandare na cunuhi na suwa. <verse eid="ACT 27:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 27:38" />Nga̱ ab-re mare a sagagi nga̱ abgimbo, kwa aba na cakana jirgi mure wi cona na kwagana a buhu ha alkama na suwa minya. <verse eid="ACT 27:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 27:39" />Nga̱ ubungwa uba wa bungya, a dakuwo pa cinge cina jirgi uba kuliga, ama a yi kula na hye kokari a kuliya jirgi suwa hye. <verse eid="ACT 27:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 27:40" />Kwa aba na gundaga kamu irigi na kumbagage mari-mari kwa nai cure na suwa umiye. kwa aba na pasgya ulapo nga̱ mupala muba mu iswabugaga na gagi u uwo. <verse eid="ACT 27:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 27:41" />Ama nga̱ gaci ciwuci ihuga ina miya samagami kwa jirgi na sufe hega. Hai jirgi uise na cinge umayage na majumma, kwa jirgi na wraga na mapopose na kacuta zwama kuce muya. <verse eid="ACT 27:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 27:42" />Kwa hasojoji na kari hunaga aco kurkuku zwamu ata sumaga amalani. <verse eid="ACT 27:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 27:43" />Ama musoja u labe rome wakoruwa idanga Bulus u ka̱ri cure bware zwama ina ipala nab bware bui zamaga- Buba kwa buna bu po'a miye a wragi isa ayi bega a'wuci na ugagi. <verse eid="ACT 27:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 27:44" />Acagiya aco aba yinda zata na hakatako ko nabiya ha pupusagi jirgi. Na harbuniya aba wuci ug ugagi lafiya wab lau.<verse eid="ACT 27:44" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 27" />
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="ACT 28" />
  <para style="s">Bulus na tsibiri a malta</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 28:1" />Nga̱ ga̱ci ci sere ka̱mu, kwa ga̱ci na wuci na tsibiri cina aba ugo malta. <verse eid="ACT 28:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 28:2" />Aco ihuga iniya aci ia̱gi i burya̠ dinyiya. Aci uitangiya ula zwam duro na sua. <verse eid="ACT 28:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 28:3" />Nga̱ Bulus hala e'o na suwa u ula kwa ikwana ahwa na mazarek na shuwa ula zwama ubwobwo kwa na nadagi Bulus na wa. <verse eid="ACT 28:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 28:4" />Inga aco tsibiri a hyan ahwa kwa anadagi wa u Bulus, kwa aba na mazwaman, &lt;&lt;Buco buna bu honago aco; zwama ban a sire uwo, hal kabaniya u'o u yiwa na lagana bwa.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 28:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 28:5" />Amma Bulus u bibziye wa u bware kwa ahwa na matana na ula hinda bware bu huguwa ihye. <verse eid="ACT 28:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 28:6" />Aco ingana bware bwe pui ko bu kwaji, ama nga̱ aba sani a hya i ia̱guwo na Bulus, kwa aba na hyen bware busa hwinsu.<verse eid="ACT 28:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 28:7" />Ciyabu naba ihuga yiwa ina aco labe tsibiri aniya hyiwa ina aco labe tsibiri aniya huzi na labe i huga. Bulabe bucipa ihuga burya̠ hal muho mutaco. <verse eid="ACT 28:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 28:8" />Buca bu buba buyiwa na pama ne mahuna, zazabi abiya a dame bware. Bulus kwa na ise pa buba zwamu bu hyen bware, kwa na hye ahunda, kwa na dwukana bu wa na coa yibuba, kwa buco buniya na hwinga. <verse eid="ACT 28:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 28:9" />Inga zwamuna uba pare, aco na yiwa na tsibiri kamu ana a huguwa laco akure kamu hinda bware bu huigucuma kamu. <verse eid="ACT 28:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 28:10" />Aci egiyi daje dinya nga̱ gaci ci ka̱ri alaya na cihano acicu. Kwa aba na citanaga ina gaci gimbo kamu.<verse eid="ACT 28:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bulus a wuci Roma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 28:11" />Inga gaci iyi pyana bitaco kwa gaci na hinana cihano na suwa miya. Jirgi usa wa Alekzandiriya una u hoge siye na tsibiri se malta. A egiya jirginiya alama sigila si hwinsu na iye iswabukago wub. <verse eid="ACT 28:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 28:12" />Inga gaci wuci sirakus kwa gaci na ea muhu mutaco. <verse eid="ACT 28:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 28:13" />Daga apayi kwa gaci na alah hal ci wuci rigium. Na harigu yubungwa mupala kwa na hurpani na ime, na harigu yubungwa kwa gaci na wuci futiyoli. <verse eid="ACT 28:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 28:14" />Ci bangi ahuwa alagano ana aci uga na gaci iyi muho tandare tare naba. harbuniya gaci wuce Roma. <verse eid="ACT 28:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 28:15" />Ahuwa alagano ahughe ana ciyuwa na kuwra, kwa aba na cigita cucu na kasuwa ka affiyus na huga ina aba yuwa na uge masanki mataco nga̱ Bulus uba hyega kwa uba na pana Hwinsu cilabe hinda bware bu ma karfafi nga̱ buba hyega. <verse eid="ACT 28:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 28:16" />Nga̱ ga̱ ci wuci Roma, kwa aba nai yaje Bulus umadaliya na icwa yoba, na isoja i a̱pan bware.<verse eid="ACT 28:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bulus u i wa'azi na Roma.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 28:17" />Bulus muho mutaco bulus kwa na ugane alabe a hayahudawa. nga̱ aba matanaga, bulus kwa na hyenab, &lt;&lt;Ahun nimui, kodi nga̱ gya na iwo aco namu laifi bale ko al'ada a hacece hacu, duka na harbuniya ana kune na urshalima kwa na pana hasojoji ha Romawa <verse eid="ACT 28:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 28:18" />Ana kabganu a karisi na cura, zwama na iwoh laifi balle a wuci hal ana hune. <verse eid="ACT 28:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 28:19" />Ama kwa hahudawa na wunje iyaje, dole gya na zangaci kara kuwra hu kaisar sa ana naza laife balle ko nayiwa na kara aco namu. <verse eid="ACT 28:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 28:20" />Ubiya usa giye na kabba ko gimbage bu hye iyi cikarigo na goo. Zwamu ina iserailawan aba tane soo kurwa bware ubiya usa gya na yiwa na mari mari.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ACT 28:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 28:21" />Kwa aba na cane, &lt;&lt;Ga̱ci di ca ci iyiwo wasika heye na wah wu hayahudawa zwamu goo, ko na byhuwa buna bua sire a hohi bwa cikulage numa hye zwam gua. <verse eid="ACT 28:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 28:22" />Ama cigimbago huga na unwo nubweyia, zwamu citake aco tuhumba aiyua na cikarigio ciwo zwamu ciba.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 28:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 28:23" />A iri Hwinsu una aba imagama na Bulus, kwa aba nai kura ihuga ina bware buba buyiwa na dala. Tun nu bungwa maiba kuwra uyimbe bware na Ia̱giga bayani kwa nai zwamana zwama cigwama ci Hwinsu bware na kokari bu numa ga pa Yesu na suwa wi cibago i musa na hatakarda ha acuma Hwinsu. <verse eid="ACT 28:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 28:24" />Acagiya ayaje aco ayaje ina bware buba cibagega, amma a cagiya aco a yajuwa. <verse eid="ACT 28:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 28:25" />Zwam harbuniya ama yadagawa na sucua saba kafin aba curi ihuga ina aba yiwa. Bulus uhye naba: &lt;&lt;A huru a Hwinsu a numage gaskiya pa hacece a hahi nga̱ uba zwame na unu wa Ishaya bucubaga:<verse eid="ACT 28:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 28:26" />Kula pa aco namuye i hin naba,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 28:26">&lt;&lt;Yi huge i hina na huge amma iza; yi hugaga. Yi henaga dinyiya ama har'abadan yi za ihenaga sam sam.<verse eid="ACT 28:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 28:27" />Zwamu suwa waco na u dari;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 28:27">A zwapage laacuba haba a za ihuge hind a gunda hise hab aza ihunaga. Imbaci harbuniye i</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ACT 28:27">hye na hisa haba i huge na ha</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 28:27">cubu haba a ganiyana suwa waba hinda a mabicike, gye hungacumi ga&gt;. <verse eid="ACT 28:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 28:28" />Zwam harbuniya na gimbo i dake Hwinsu cuma ceto uba pa aco na asa Hayahudawa, aba hinda i watagana a hugage!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ACT 28:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 28:29" />Inga bware buba hoge cokarigio kwa hayahudawa nai hina masisa aba ba.<verse eid="ACT 28:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 28:30" />Bulus wa iyi shekara are bware na dala ukaba haya kamu buna bwa kure heni bware si curiya bwa ko na gasganu. <verse eid="ACT 28:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 28:31" />Bware bu hina na hye wa'azi ko na sheka zwama a gazganuwa bware bu hina na wa'azi a cigwama ci Hwinsu na cibaga zwam Buca̱ bu yaba Yesu Kristi.<verse eid="ACT 28:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 28" />
</usx>